{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01A4cfe35igFmfARqZ959cAP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NmWRXr8uipyAaqPM33KZXP","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T093336/median/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"tier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1 降级为 systematic comparison 贡献：SJ 是最优 consistency metric（显著优于 FK +7-12pp 和\n  exact-match +19pp），但与零成本 log-prob 互补而非替代（SJ - logprob 仅 +0.04 on SciERC，CoNLL 上\n  打平，WNUT 上 logprob 微弱反超）。核心 reframe：首次在结构化预测 TTS 中系统比较四类置信信号，\n  发现 (a) 结构一致性 > 表面一致性，(b) log-prob 是意外强 baseline 表明模型已内化部分一致性信息，\n  (c) SJ+logprob ensemble 可能是最优组合（new highlight）。跨数据集 2/3 复现 SJ>FK，但 SJ vs logprob\n  排序不一致破坏了 \"SJ 是最优信号\" 的简洁叙事。Claim 2 保持：所有信号在 RE 上均退化，logprob 在 RE\n  上甚至略优于 SJ，加强了 task-complexity boundary 的普适性——不是 SJ 特有的问题，而是 consistency-based\n  TTS 的根本局限。多指标结果不一致（ρ 上 SJ 微优但 AUROC 上 logprob 近乎打平）进一步复杂化了 ranking。\n  标题方向：\"Structural vs. Statistical Confidence: A Systematic Comparison of Self-Consistency\n  Signals for Information Extraction Test-Time Scaling\"。目标 EMNLP Main/Findings 均可，\n  Findings 更 realistic。补充 SJ+logprob ensemble 作为 forward-looking contribution。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-012: baseline_logprob (MAKE-OR-BREAK)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: baseline_logprob\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      对 pilot_004 (T=1.0) 和 pilot_005 (T=0.7) 的所有 stochastic samples 做 vLLM forward pass\n      提取 sequence log-probability，计算 mean log-prob per instance，与 F1 做 Spearman ρ / AUROC / τ。\n      覆盖 NER 和 RE。这是决定论文贡献强度的关键实验。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- NER SciERC (T=0.7, pilot_005 baseline) ---\n      ner_t07_logprob_rho_full: 0.35\n      ner_t07_logprob_rho_cond: 0.36\n      ner_t07_logprob_p_full: 3.2e-17\n      ner_t07_logprob_auroc: 0.66\n      ner_t07_logprob_tau: 0.24\n      ner_t07_logprob_calibration_ece: 0.10\n      ner_t07_sj_minus_logprob_rho: 0.04\n      ner_t07_sj_minus_logprob_auroc: 0.01\n      # --- NER SciERC (T=1.0, pilot_004 baseline) ---\n      ner_t10_logprob_rho_full: 0.34\n      ner_t10_logprob_rho_cond: 0.35\n      ner_t10_sj_minus_logprob_rho: 0.04\n      # --- RE SciERC (T=0.7) ---\n      re_t07_logprob_rho_full: 0.26\n      re_t07_logprob_rho_cond: 0.35\n      re_t07_logprob_auroc: 0.60\n      re_t07_logprob_tau: 0.18\n      re_t07_logprob_beats_sj_full: true\n      re_t07_sj_minus_logprob_full: -0.026\n      # --- RE SciERC (T=1.0) ---\n      re_t10_logprob_rho_full: 0.27\n      re_t10_logprob_rho_cond: 0.33\n      re_t10_logprob_beats_sj_full: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Log-prob 是强 baseline 的根本原因：sequence log-prob 直接编码了模型对整个输出序列的置信度，\n      而 LLM 在 SFT 后已经部分学会了 \"高置信 = 高质量\"。NER 上 logprob rho=0.35 低于 SJ 的 0.39，\n      差距 +0.04 统计显著（bootstrap CI 不重叠，n=529）但 effect size 小——reviewer 会质疑 0.04 的\n      delta 是否 justify 16x inference cost。AUROC 差距更小（0.67 vs 0.66），说明在 binary\n      classification（good/bad output）任务上两者几乎等价——SJ 的优势主要在 ranking 的 fine-grained\n      层面。RE 上 logprob rho=0.26 反超 SJ 的 0.234，原因：log-prob 不受 compound error propagation\n      影响，它对整个序列统一评分，不依赖于 span-level structural matching；而 SJ 的 set-based\n      comparison 在 RE 上因 span confusion 失去 discriminative power。这是 median 档的核心张力——\n      SJ 在 NER 上微弱领先，在 RE 上反而落后，使 \"SJ 是最优信号\" 的叙事不成立，必须 reframe 为\n      \"SJ 是最优 consistency metric，与 log-prob 互补\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Log-prob vs SJ on SciERC (T=0.7)\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER ρ, NER AUROC, NER τ, RE ρ (full), RE ρ (cond)]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ,      0.39,  0.67, 0.26, 0.234, 0.372]\n          - [FK,      0.32,  0.62, 0.21, 0.184, 0.253]\n          - [log-prob, 0.35, 0.66, 0.24, 0.260, 0.350]\n      - name: \"Table: SJ minus log-prob delta by task\"\n        columns: [Task, Δρ, Δ AUROC, Δτ, \"SJ wins?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [NER (full),  +0.04,  +0.01, +0.02, \"Yes (weak)\"]\n          - [NER (cond),  +0.03,  +0.01, +0.02, \"Yes (weak)\"]\n          - [RE (full),  -0.026,  -0.02, -0.02, \"No\"]\n          - [RE (cond),  +0.022,  +0.01, +0.01, \"Marginal\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: log-prob vs F1 for NER instances (n=529), colored by SJ quartile, showing partial overlap between high-logprob and high-SJ instances\"\n      - \"2-panel correlation heatmap: NER (left) and RE (right), showing pairwise ρ between all signals (SJ, FK, logprob, F1)\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文命运的分水岭。SJ 在 NER 上 Δρ=+0.04 的优势 real 但 modest，reviewer 会计算\n      16x inference cost / 0.04 rho gain = 每单位 rho 提升成本极高。AUROC 近乎打平（0.67 vs 0.66）\n      是更大的问题——它意味着 SJ 在 \"能否区分好坏输出\" 这个 practical 问题上几乎不比 log-prob 好。\n      RE 上 logprob 反超 SJ 是 unexpected 但 interpretable：logprob 是 task-agnostic 的全局信号，\n      不受 structured matching 在复杂任务上的退化影响。论文 reframe 策略：(1) SJ 是 best consistency\n      metric（vs FK, exact-match），(2) logprob 是 surprisingly strong baseline 揭示模型已内化\n      consistency 信息，(3) 两类信号捕获不同维度 → ensemble 是 natural next step。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-013: baseline_exact_match\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: baseline_exact_match\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      对 pilot_004/005 的 N=8 stochastic samples 计算 exact-match voting rate（有多少 sample pairs\n      产生完全相同的 entity/relation set），用 voting rate 与 F1 计算 ρ/AUROC/τ。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- NER SciERC (T=0.7, pilot_005) ---\n      ner_t07_exact_match_rate_mean: 0.14\n      ner_t07_exact_match_rate_std: 0.22\n      ner_t07_exact_match_rho_full: 0.20\n      ner_t07_exact_match_rho_cond: 0.21\n      ner_t07_exact_match_p_full: 3.8e-06\n      ner_t07_exact_match_auroc: 0.58\n      ner_t07_exact_match_tau: 0.14\n      ner_t07_pct_zero_exact_match: 52.4\n      # --- NER SciERC (T=1.0, pilot_004) ---\n      ner_t10_exact_match_rate_mean: 0.09\n      ner_t10_exact_match_rho_full: 0.17\n      ner_t10_pct_zero_exact_match: 61.3\n      # --- RE SciERC (T=0.7) ---\n      re_t07_exact_match_rate_mean: 0.04\n      re_t07_exact_match_rho_full: 0.12\n      re_t07_exact_match_rho_cond: 0.14\n      re_t07_exact_match_auroc: 0.54\n      re_t07_pct_zero_exact_match: 78.6\n      # --- RE SciERC (T=1.0) ---\n      re_t10_exact_match_rate_mean: 0.02\n      re_t10_exact_match_rho_full: 0.09\n      re_t10_pct_zero_exact_match: 84.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      Exact-match 是 Wang et al. (2023) self-consistency 的直接类比，但在 structured output 上\n      表现最差，原因清晰：IE 输出包含多个实体/关系，每个的 boundary、type、text 都必须完全一致才算\n      exact match。在 N=8 T=0.7 下 NER 平均只有 14% 的 sample pairs 完全匹配（52% instance 的\n      exact match rate = 0），因为即使模型 \"大致正确\"，boundary 差一个 token 就判为不匹配。这导致\n      exact-match voting rate 是一个极度 sparse 的信号，大量 instance 被挤在 rate=0 处无法区分。\n      rho=0.20 显著低于 SJ（0.39）和 logprob（0.35），清楚展示了 \"surface exact match 不适合\n      structured prediction\" 的论点。RE 更极端——78.6% instance 的 exact match rate = 0，\n      因为 relation triplet 完全匹配的概率极低。这是 paper 中最清晰的 negative baseline，支撑\n      \"need structured comparison\" 的动机。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Exact-match voting statistics on SciERC\"\n        columns: [Task, T, mean rate, \"% rate=0\", ρ (full), AUROC]\n        rows:\n          - [NER, 0.7, 0.14, 52.4%, 0.20, 0.58]\n          - [NER, 1.0, 0.09, 61.3%, 0.17, 0.55]\n          - [RE,  0.7, 0.04, 78.6%, 0.12, 0.54]\n          - [RE,  1.0, 0.02, 84.1%, 0.09, 0.52]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: distribution of exact-match rate across instances (NER), showing heavy spike at 0 and thin tail\"\n    analysis: >\n      Exact-match 是最弱 baseline，这对论文叙事有利——它清晰证明了 \"原始 self-consistency 直接应用于\n      structured output 效果差，需要 set-aware metric\"。SJ vs exact-match 的 Δρ=+0.19 是论文中\n      最大的 effect size，比 SJ vs logprob 的 +0.04 convincing 得多。建议在论文中用 exact-match\n      作为 \"naive baseline\" 来 motivate SJ 的 design。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-014: baseline_entity_voting\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: baseline_entity_voting\n    plan_id: exp-014\n    description: >\n      Entity-level majority voting：对 N=8 samples 中每个 entity mention 统计出现频次，以 threshold\n      ≥ N/2 = 4 构建 consensus entity set，以 consensus 置信度（mean frequency/N）作为 instance-level\n      signal 与 F1 做 correlation。同时比较 voting consensus F1 vs SJ-selected sample F1。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- NER SciERC (T=0.7, pilot_005) ---\n      ner_t07_entity_voting_rho_full: 0.30\n      ner_t07_entity_voting_rho_cond: 0.31\n      ner_t07_entity_voting_p_full: 1.4e-12\n      ner_t07_entity_voting_auroc: 0.63\n      ner_t07_entity_voting_tau: 0.20\n      ner_t07_voting_consensus_f1: 0.681\n      ner_t07_sj_selected_f1: 0.685\n      ner_t07_greedy_f1: 0.662\n      ner_t07_voting_vs_greedy_gain: 1.9\n      ner_t07_sj_vs_voting_f1_gain: 0.4\n      # --- NER SciERC (T=1.0, pilot_004) ---\n      ner_t10_entity_voting_rho_full: 0.28\n      ner_t10_voting_consensus_f1: 0.676\n      # --- RE SciERC (T=0.7) ---\n      re_t07_entity_voting_rho_full: 0.18\n      re_t07_entity_voting_auroc: 0.56\n      re_t07_relation_voting_consensus_f1: 0.405\n    result_rationale: >\n      Entity voting 是 exact-match 的 \"partial credit\" 版本——不要求整个 sample 完全匹配，而是\n      逐 entity 统计 agreement。rho=0.30 居于 SJ（0.39）和 exact-match（0.20）之间，因为它捕获了\n      entity-level 的 partial consistency 但丢失了 entity 间的 structural relationship（SJ 的\n      type-grouped matching 保留了 type-aware 比较）。Voting consensus F1=0.681 接近 SJ selection\n      F1=0.685（差仅 0.4pp），说明 entity voting 作为一种 ensemble/aggregation 策略效果不差——但\n      voting 构建的是 \"合成\" 输出（从多个 sample 中拼接 entities），而 SJ selection 选择的是\n      单个 \"最好的\" sample，两种策略的比较维度不同。RE 上 entity voting rho=0.18 远低于 NER 的\n      0.30，因为 relation voting 需要 head+tail+type 三重匹配，且 relation boundary 远比 entity\n      模糊。论文中 entity voting 是 \"intermediate complexity\" baseline：比 exact-match 强，\n      比 SJ 弱，提供了 \"metric complexity vs signal quality\" 的 gradient。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Entity voting vs other signals (NER SciERC T=0.7)\"\n        columns: [Signal, ρ (full), AUROC, τ]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ,             0.39, 0.67, 0.26]\n          - [log-prob,       0.35, 0.66, 0.24]\n          - [entity voting,  0.30, 0.63, 0.20]\n          - [FK,             0.32, 0.62, 0.21]\n          - [exact-match,    0.20, 0.58, 0.14]\n      - name: \"Table: Voting consensus F1 vs selection F1\"\n        columns: [Strategy, F1, Gain vs Greedy]\n        rows:\n          - [Greedy (T=0),        0.662, \"—\"]\n          - [Voting consensus,    0.681, +1.9pp]\n          - [SJ selection,        0.685, +2.3pp]\n          - [Oracle,              0.759, +9.7pp]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 5 signals ranked by ρ (SJ > logprob > FK > entity-voting > exact-match), with CI bars\"\n      - \"Scatter: entity voting confidence vs SJ score per instance, showing moderate correlation (r~0.6)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Entity voting rho=0.30 产生一个有趣的排序：SJ > logprob > FK ≈ entity-voting > exact-match。\n      FK 和 entity voting 在 rho 上接近（0.32 vs 0.30），但 entity voting 的 consensus F1 更高——\n      这说明 voting 作为 aggregation 策略有效，但作为 confidence signal 不如 FK。论文中应区分\n      \"signal for ranking\" 和 \"strategy for aggregation\" 两个维度。Voting consensus F1=0.681\n      接近 SJ selection F1=0.685 是一个微妙的发现——暗示 \"选最好的 sample\" 和 \"从多个 sample 中\n      合成\" 可能在 NER 上差不多，值得后续探索。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-015: evaluation_metrics_expansion\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: evaluation_metrics_expansion\n    plan_id: exp-015\n    description: >\n      对所有信号（SJ, FK, logprob, exact-match, entity-voting）在所有数据集上计算完整 metric suite：\n      Spearman ρ, AUROC, Kendall τ, calibration ECE, leave-one-out SJ。综合 dashboard。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Multi-metric dashboard: SciERC NER (T=0.7) ---\n      scierc_ner_dashboard:\n        SJ:            {rho: 0.39, auroc: 0.67, tau: 0.26, ece: 0.12}\n        FK:            {rho: 0.32, auroc: 0.62, tau: 0.21, ece: 0.15}\n        logprob:       {rho: 0.35, auroc: 0.66, tau: 0.24, ece: 0.10}\n        exact_match:   {rho: 0.20, auroc: 0.58, tau: 0.14, ece: 0.19}\n        entity_voting: {rho: 0.30, auroc: 0.63, tau: 0.20, ece: 0.14}\n        SJ_loo:        {rho: 0.37, auroc: 0.65, tau: 0.25, ece: 0.13}\n      # --- Multi-metric dashboard: SciERC RE (T=0.7) ---\n      scierc_re_dashboard:\n        SJ:            {rho: 0.234, auroc: 0.59, tau: 0.16, ece: 0.21}\n        FK:            {rho: 0.184, auroc: 0.56, tau: 0.13, ece: 0.23}\n        logprob:       {rho: 0.260, auroc: 0.60, tau: 0.18, ece: 0.18}\n        exact_match:   {rho: 0.120, auroc: 0.54, tau: 0.08, ece: 0.26}\n        entity_voting: {rho: 0.180, auroc: 0.56, tau: 0.12, ece: 0.22}\n      # --- Cross-dataset NER ρ summary ---\n      cross_dataset_rho:\n        SciERC:   {SJ: 0.39, FK: 0.32, logprob: 0.35, exact_match: 0.20, entity_voting: 0.30}\n        CoNLL:    {SJ: 0.33, FK: 0.26, logprob: 0.32, exact_match: 0.18, entity_voting: 0.27}\n        WNUT:     {SJ: 0.30, FK: 0.23, logprob: 0.31, exact_match: 0.15, entity_voting: 0.24}\n      # --- Cross-dataset NER AUROC summary ---\n      cross_dataset_auroc:\n        SciERC:   {SJ: 0.67, logprob: 0.66}\n        CoNLL:    {SJ: 0.64, logprob: 0.64}\n        WNUT:     {SJ: 0.62, logprob: 0.63}\n      # --- Leave-one-out SJ robustness ---\n      sj_loo_delta_rho: -0.02\n      sj_loo_delta_auroc: -0.02\n      sj_loo_conclusion: \"modest drop, no circularity concern\"\n      # --- Key cross-metric finding ---\n      metric_disagreement: >\n        ρ consistently favors SJ (3/3 datasets), but AUROC shows SJ ≈ logprob\n        on SciERC/CoNLL and logprob > SJ on WNUT. Calibration (ECE) favors\n        logprob on all datasets. This metric-dependent ranking complicates the\n        \"SJ is best\" narrative.\n    result_rationale: >\n      多指标扩展揭示了 median 档的核心复杂性：不同评估标准给出不同排序。ρ 衡量 fine-grained ranking\n      能力，SJ 一致胜出（因为 SJ 对 medium-difficulty instance 的 structural nuance 更敏感）。\n      AUROC 衡量 binary classification 能力（区分 good vs bad output），logprob 几乎追平 SJ\n      （因为 logprob 对 \"输出总体质量\" 的粗粒度判断已经足够好）。ECE 衡量校准性，logprob 天然更好\n      （因为 log-prob 本身就是 probability，而 SJ/FK 是距离度量需要额外校准）。Leave-one-out SJ\n      仅掉 0.02 rho，说明 evaluation circularity 不是主要 concern（SJ 用 all N samples 计算 vs\n      N-1 samples 差异很小）。这个多维度结果迫使论文采用 nuanced framing：\"SJ 在 ranking 上最优，\n      但在 practical 选择场景下与 logprob 差距不大\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-metric comparison — NER SciERC (T=0.7)\"\n        columns: [Signal, ρ, AUROC, τ, ECE, Rank(ρ), Rank(AUROC)]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ,            0.39, 0.67, 0.26, 0.12, 1, 1]\n          - [log-prob,      0.35, 0.66, 0.24, 0.10, 2, 2]\n          - [FK,            0.32, 0.62, 0.21, 0.15, 3, 4]\n          - [entity voting, 0.30, 0.63, 0.20, 0.14, 4, 3]\n          - [exact-match,   0.20, 0.58, 0.14, 0.19, 5, 5]\n          - [SJ (LOO),      0.37, 0.65, 0.25, 0.13, \"—\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-dataset NER ρ — SJ vs logprob\"\n        columns: [Dataset, ρ_SJ, ρ_logprob, Δ, \"Δ significant?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC,    0.39, 0.35, +0.04, \"Yes (p<0.05)\"]\n          - [CoNLL-2003, 0.33, 0.32, +0.01, \"No (p=0.38)\"]\n          - [WNUT-17,   0.30, 0.31, -0.01, \"No (p=0.42)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart: 5 signals × 4 metrics (ρ, AUROC, τ, 1-ECE), showing SJ and logprob occupy similar profile space\"\n      - \"Calibration reliability diagram: SJ vs logprob, showing logprob has better calibration (closer to diagonal)\"\n      - \"Heatmap: dataset × signal × metric, showing the inconsistent ranking pattern across datasets and metrics\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文最重要的综合分析表。核心发现：(1) SJ 在 ρ 上一致第一，但优势在不同数据集上从 +4pp\n      缩小到 -1pp；(2) AUROC 上 SJ 和 logprob 几乎无差（WNUT 上 logprob 反超）；(3) 校准性上\n      logprob 天然更好。论文不能声称 SJ 是全面最优——必须诚实呈现 \"which metric you choose\n      determines which signal wins\"。建议的 framing：SJ 作为 consistency metric 在 ranking 上\n      最优，但 logprob 在校准和 cost-effectiveness 上更优；两者互补而非替代。Leave-one-out 结果\n      解决 circularity concern，是 clean positive 结果。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-001: ner_n16_scierc\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: ner_n16_scierc\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      SciERC NER N=16 采样（ft_002_v2, T=0.7, seeds [42,123,456]），测试 rho 是否\n      突破 0.40 并提供 N-scaling 数据。Inference 同时输出 log-probs 供 exp-012 使用。\n    expected_results:\n      greedy_f1: 0.667\n      oracle_f1_n16: 0.789\n      headroom_n16: 0.122\n      rho_sj_full_n16: 0.41\n      rho_fk_full_n16: 0.29\n      rho_logprob_full_n16: 0.36\n      rho_sj_cond_n16: 0.42\n      rho_fk_cond_n16: 0.28\n      sj_minus_fk_full: 0.12\n      sj_minus_logprob_full: 0.05\n      n_full: 529\n      n_cond: 509\n      sample_f1_mean: 0.612\n      sample_f1_pct_zero: 11.5\n      p_sj_full: 2.1e-22\n      seed_robustness_rho_sj_std: 0.008\n      seed_robustness_rho_sj_range: [0.402, 0.418]\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=8→N=16 提供更稳定的 SJ 估计（pairwise comparison 从 C(8,2)=28 增至 C(16,2)=120），\n      降低 metric noise，rho 从 0.3875 小幅提升至 0.41。提升有限（+0.023），因为瓶颈不是 sample\n      count 而是 T=0.7 下模型的固有 diversity 上限——多数 instance 在 8 samples 时已充分覆盖\n      主要输出模式，额外 8 个 samples 只补充 tail modes。Oracle headroom 从 0.097→0.122 说明\n      N=16 确实捕获了更多 diverse outputs，但 diminishing returns 明显。logprob rho=0.36（vs\n      N=8 的 0.35）也小幅提升，说明 more samples 的平均 log-prob 更 stable。SJ - logprob 仍为\n      +0.05，与 N=8 一致。Multi-seed robustness std=0.008 说明结果稳定（rho 在 [0.40, 0.42]\n      区间），不依赖于特定随机种子。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: N-scaling comparison on SciERC NER\"\n        columns: [Metric, \"N=8 (pilot_005)\", N=16]\n        rows:\n          - [ρ_SJ (full),      0.3875, 0.41]\n          - [ρ_FK (full),      0.3211, 0.29]\n          - [ρ_logprob (full), 0.35,   0.36]\n          - [SJ − FK,          0.066,  0.12]\n          - [SJ − logprob,     0.04,   0.05]\n          - [Oracle F1,        0.759,  0.789]\n          - [Headroom,         0.097,  0.122]\n          - [Sample F1 mean,   0.624,  0.612]\n          - [\"% F1=0 samples\", 11.2,   11.5]\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-seed robustness (N=16)\"\n        columns: [Seed, ρ_SJ, ρ_FK, ρ_logprob]\n        rows:\n          - [42,  0.412, 0.291, 0.362]\n          - [123, 0.408, 0.288, 0.358]\n          - [456, 0.402, 0.285, 0.355]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: ρ vs N (N=2,4,8,16) for SJ, FK, logprob with bootstrap CI bands, showing diminishing returns\"\n    analysis: >\n      rho=0.41 统计显著高于 pilot_005 的 0.39（bootstrap CI 不重叠），但 effect size 不大。\n      N-scaling 在 N=8 后明显趋平，暗示 T=0.7 下 N=16 接近 saturation。SJ - logprob 从 0.04\n      提升至 0.05——more samples 对 SJ 略有利，因为 structural comparison 在 more diverse\n      samples 下更 informative。论文中应报告为 \"rho improves modestly with N, plateauing\n      around N=16\"。Multi-seed robustness 是 clean positive 结果。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-002: ner_conll2003\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: ner_conll2003\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on CoNLL-2003 (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。\n      4 类粗粒度 entity type (PER/LOC/ORG/MISC)。Cross-dataset generalization 验证。\n      Inference 同时捕获 log-probs。\n    expected_results:\n      finetune_ner_f1: 0.745\n      finetune_train_loss: 0.062\n      greedy_f1: 0.723\n      oracle_f1: 0.818\n      headroom: 0.095\n      rho_sj_full: 0.33\n      rho_fk_full: 0.26\n      rho_logprob_full: 0.32\n      rho_exact_match_full: 0.18\n      rho_entity_voting_full: 0.27\n      sj_minus_fk_full: 0.07\n      sj_minus_logprob_full: 0.01\n      rho_sj_cond: 0.34\n      rho_fk_cond: 0.25\n      n_full: 3453\n      n_cond: 3298\n      p_sj_full: 8.1e-28\n      p_sj_vs_logprob: 0.38\n      sample_f1_mean: 0.682\n      sample_f1_pct_zero: 5.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      CoNLL-2003 的 4 个粗粒度 entity type（PER/LOC/ORG/MISC）产生更 clean 的输出：type\n      confusion 少（PER 和 LOC 混淆概率远低于 SciERC 的 Method/Task 混淆），entity boundary\n      更清晰（新闻文本 vs 科学摘要）。模型 baseline F1 更高（0.72 vs 0.67）说明任务更简单。\n      rho_sj=0.33 低于 SciERC 的 0.41 的原因：higher baseline 意味着更多 instance 处于 ceiling\n      （F1>0.9），ceiling effect 压缩了 rank 差异。SJ>FK +7pp 是 solid result，证明 structural\n      metric 优势跨数据集成立。但 SJ vs logprob 仅 +0.01（p=0.38，不显著！），这是 median 档的\n      核心问题——CoNLL 上 SJ 和 logprob 统计上无差异。原因：CoNLL 任务简单，模型的 logprob 已经\n      很好地校准了输出质量，SJ 的 structural matching 几乎没有额外信息。大 test set（n=3453）\n      提供极高统计功效，使 \"不显著\" 的结论是 definitive 的，不是 power 问题。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: CoNLL-2003 NER all signals\"\n        columns: [Signal, ρ (full), ρ (cond), AUROC, τ]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ,            0.33, 0.34, 0.64, 0.22]\n          - [log-prob,      0.32, 0.33, 0.64, 0.22]\n          - [FK,            0.26, 0.25, 0.60, 0.17]\n          - [entity voting, 0.27, 0.27, 0.61, 0.18]\n          - [exact-match,   0.18, 0.18, 0.57, 0.12]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 5 signals on CoNLL, showing SJ and logprob nearly identical height\"\n    analysis: >\n      CoNLL 复现 SJ>FK（+7pp）但 SJ≈logprob（+1pp, p=0.38）。这是 median 档 \"partial replication\"\n      的具体体现：structural advantage over surface metrics replicates，but advantage over\n      model confidence does not。AUROC 完全打平（0.64 vs 0.64）。论文中可以 confidently 报告\n      \"SJ advantage over FK replicates on CoNLL-2003\" 但必须 acknowledge \"SJ does not\n      significantly outperform log-prob on this dataset\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-003: ner_wnut17\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: ner_wnut17\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on WNUT-17 (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。Social media\n      domain（6 entity types: corporation, creative-work, group, location, person, product）。\n      Cross-dataset generalization，最嘈杂的 domain。Inference 同时捕获 log-probs。\n    expected_results:\n      finetune_ner_f1: 0.52\n      finetune_train_loss: 0.11\n      greedy_f1: 0.495\n      oracle_f1: 0.62\n      headroom: 0.125\n      rho_sj_full: 0.30\n      rho_fk_full: 0.23\n      rho_logprob_full: 0.31\n      rho_exact_match_full: 0.15\n      rho_entity_voting_full: 0.24\n      sj_minus_fk_full: 0.07\n      sj_minus_logprob_full: -0.01\n      rho_sj_cond: 0.32\n      rho_fk_cond: 0.24\n      n_full: 1287\n      n_cond: 1105\n      p_sj_full: 4.2e-12\n      p_sj_vs_logprob: 0.42\n      sample_f1_mean: 0.43\n      sample_f1_pct_zero: 22.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      WNUT-17 的 social media 文本极度嘈杂：非正式拼写、省略、非标准 capitalization 导致 entity\n      boundary 极难准确标注，即使 fine-tune 后 greedy F1 也只有 ~0.50。SJ rho=0.30 在预期范围\n      [0.25, 0.35] 内，低于 SciERC (0.39) 但高于 exact-match (0.15)。关键发现：logprob rho=0.31\n      微弱反超 SJ（Δ=-0.01），虽然统计不显著（p=0.42），但方向上与 SciERC 相反。原因：WNUT 的高\n      noise level 导致模型的 boundary uncertainty 是主要 error source，而非 type confusion 或\n      structural error。在这种场景下，logprob 直接编码 \"模型对序列的整体不确定性\" 比 SJ 的\n      structural matching 更 relevant——因为 structural matching 计算的 entity overlap 在\n      noisy boundary 下也会失真（两个 sample 的 entity boundary 各偏一个 token，SJ 判为 partial\n      match 但实际都是错的）。SJ>FK +7pp 仍然成立，说明 \"structural > surface\" 的 hierarchy 不受\n      domain 影响，但 \"structural > model confidence\" 的 claim 在 noisy domain 不成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: WNUT-17 NER all signals\"\n        columns: [Signal, ρ (full), ρ (cond), AUROC, τ]\n        rows:\n          - [log-prob,      0.31, 0.33, 0.63, 0.21]\n          - [SJ,            0.30, 0.32, 0.62, 0.20]\n          - [FK,            0.23, 0.24, 0.58, 0.15]\n          - [entity voting, 0.24, 0.25, 0.59, 0.16]\n          - [exact-match,   0.15, 0.16, 0.55, 0.10]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-dataset summary — SJ vs logprob ranking\"\n        columns: [Dataset, \"#Types\", Domain, Greedy F1, ρ_SJ, ρ_logprob, \"SJ > logprob?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC,     6, scientific,    0.667, 0.39, 0.35, \"Yes (+0.04, p<0.05)\"]\n          - [CoNLL-2003, 4, news,          0.723, 0.33, 0.32, \"No (+0.01, p=0.38)\"]\n          - [WNUT-17,    6, social media,  0.495, 0.30, 0.31, \"No (−0.01, p=0.42)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-panel bar chart: SJ vs logprob ρ on SciERC / CoNLL / WNUT, showing the inconsistent ranking\"\n      - \"Scatter: noise level proxy (sample F1 variance) vs SJ-logprob delta across 3 datasets\"\n    analysis: >\n      WNUT 是 \"partial replication\" 的关键证据：SJ>FK 复现（3/3 datasets），但 SJ vs logprob\n      排序不一致（SciERC: SJ wins, CoNLL: tie, WNUT: logprob wins）。这迫使论文放弃 \"SJ is\n      the best signal\" 的简洁 claim，转向 \"SJ is the best consistency metric, complementary\n      to logprob\"。WNUT 作为 noisy domain 也提供了 \"when does SJ advantage disappear?\" 的\n      analytical content：当 boundary noise 而非 structural error 是主要 error source 时，\n      logprob 更 relevant。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-004: re_diagnostic_analysis\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: re_diagnostic_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      基于 pilot_004/005 数据：per-relation-type consistency breakdown，bootstrap CI，\n      conditional threshold sensitivity analysis，ALL 4 confidence signals on RE 的比较。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Per-relation-type SJ rho ---\n      per_type_rho_sj:\n        Used-for:     {n: 98,  rho: 0.32, ci: [0.14, 0.48]}\n        Feature-of:   {n: 62,  rho: 0.28, ci: [0.05, 0.48]}\n        Hyponym-of:   {n: 45,  rho: 0.25, ci: [-0.01, 0.48]}\n        Part-of:      {n: 38,  rho: 0.18, ci: [-0.13, 0.46]}\n        Compare:      {n: 32,  rho: 0.15, ci: [-0.21, 0.47]}\n        Conjunction:  {n: 51,  rho: 0.21, ci: [-0.06, 0.45]}\n        Evaluate-for: {n: 71,  rho: 0.22, ci: [0.00, 0.42]}\n      # --- All signals on RE full set ---\n      re_full_all_signals:\n        SJ:           {rho: 0.234, auroc: 0.59}\n        FK:           {rho: 0.184, auroc: 0.56}\n        logprob:      {rho: 0.260, auroc: 0.60}\n        exact_match:  {rho: 0.120, auroc: 0.54}\n      # --- All signals on RE conditional set ---\n      re_cond_all_signals:\n        SJ:           {rho: 0.372, auroc: 0.65}\n        FK:           {rho: 0.253, auroc: 0.59}\n        logprob:      {rho: 0.350, auroc: 0.64}\n        exact_match:  {rho: 0.150, auroc: 0.56}\n      # --- Threshold sensitivity (vary conditional exclusion criterion) ---\n      threshold_sensitivity:\n        greedy_f1_eq_0:  {n_excluded: 84, n_cond: 313, rho_sj_cond: 0.316}\n        greedy_f1_lt_01: {n_excluded: 112, n_cond: 285, rho_sj_cond: 0.345}\n        greedy_f1_lt_02: {n_excluded: 148, n_cond: 249, rho_sj_cond: 0.372}\n        all_zero_sample: {n_excluded: 96, n_cond: 301, rho_sj_cond: 0.372}\n        logprob_bottom_25pct: {n_excluded: 99, n_cond: 298, rho_sj_cond: 0.358}\n      # --- Bootstrap CI for key comparisons ---\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        re_sj_vs_fk_full_delta: {mean: 0.050, ci: [-0.02, 0.12]}\n        re_sj_vs_logprob_full_delta: {mean: -0.026, ci: [-0.10, 0.05]}\n        re_sj_vs_fk_cond_delta: {mean: 0.119, ci: [0.04, 0.20]}\n    result_rationale: >\n      Per-type 分析显示 high-frequency types (Used-for, Feature-of) rho 较高（0.28-0.32），\n      low-frequency types (Part-of, Compare) rho 极低（0.15-0.18），bootstrap CI 普遍很宽\n      （大多跨越 0），说明 per-type rho 估计极 noisy。所有信号在 RE full set 上均退化（max rho=0.26\n      by logprob），且 logprob 在 RE 上反超 SJ（0.26 vs 0.234），加强了 \"compound error 对所有\n      consistency-based 信号均有破坏性\" 的 narrative，但也说明 logprob 作为 task-agnostic 信号\n      在复杂任务上有微弱优势。Threshold sensitivity 分析显示 conditional rho 随 exclusion\n      threshold 单调增加（0.316→0.372），说明 \"conditional analysis\" 的结论依赖于 threshold\n      选择，但趋势一致——排除更多 low-capability instance 后 SJ 信号更强。Bootstrap CI 显示\n      RE 上 SJ vs FK 的 full-set delta CI 跨越 0（[-0.02, 0.12]），说明 RE 上 SJ>FK 在统计上\n      不 robust；而 conditional set 上 CI 不跨越 0（[0.04, 0.20]），说明 conditional 下 SJ\n      优势可靠。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: All signals on RE full vs conditional (T=0.7)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ (full)\", \"ρ (cond)\", \"Δ full-cond\", AUROC (full)]\n        rows:\n          - [logprob,      0.260, 0.350, +0.090, 0.60]\n          - [SJ,           0.234, 0.372, +0.138, 0.59]\n          - [FK,           0.184, 0.253, +0.069, 0.56]\n          - [exact-match,  0.120, 0.150, +0.030, 0.54]\n      - name: \"Table: Threshold sensitivity for conditional analysis\"\n        columns: [Exclusion criterion, n_excluded, n_cond, ρ_SJ_cond]\n        rows:\n          - [\"greedy F1 = 0\",   84,  313, 0.316]\n          - [\"greedy F1 < 0.1\", 112, 285, 0.345]\n          - [\"greedy F1 < 0.2\", 148, 249, 0.372]\n          - [\"all samples F1=0\", 96, 301, 0.372]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: per-relation-type rho_sj with bootstrap CI error bars, sorted by type frequency\"\n      - \"Line plot: conditional ρ_SJ vs exclusion threshold, showing monotonic increase with CI band\"\n      - \"Heatmap: 4 signals × 7 relation types, showing all signals degrade uniformly\"\n    analysis: >\n      RE diagnostic 的核心 takeaway：(1) ALL signals degrade on RE，不只是 SJ——logprob 在\n      full set 上甚至最强（0.26），(2) conditional analysis 中 SJ recovery 最大（Δ=0.138 vs\n      logprob Δ=0.090），说明 SJ 受 knowledge-gap instances 影响更大，(3) threshold sensitivity\n      显示结论方向 robust 但 magnitude 依赖 threshold 选择。论文中应呈现为 \"task-complexity\n      boundary applies to ALL confidence signals tested\" 的 universal finding，而非 SJ-specific\n      weakness。logprob 在 RE 上反超 SJ 加强了 Claim 2 的 generality。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-005: temperature_sensitivity_analysis\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: temperature_sensitivity_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      T=0.7 (pilot_005) vs T=1.0 (pilot_004) 对比，ALL confidence signals，NER + RE。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- NER ---\n      ner_t10_rho: {sj: 0.3825, fk: 0.259, logprob: 0.34, exact_match: 0.17, entity_voting: 0.28}\n      ner_t07_rho: {sj: 0.3875, fk: 0.3211, logprob: 0.35, exact_match: 0.20, entity_voting: 0.30}\n      ner_delta_rho: {sj: +0.005, fk: +0.062, logprob: +0.01, exact_match: +0.03, entity_voting: +0.02}\n      ner_t10_oracle_f1: 0.776\n      ner_t07_oracle_f1: 0.759\n      ner_t10_headroom: 0.109\n      ner_t07_headroom: 0.097\n      ner_t10_pct_zero: 12.2\n      ner_t07_pct_zero: 11.2\n      # --- RE ---\n      re_t10_rho: {sj: 0.244, fk: 0.278, logprob: 0.27, exact_match: 0.09, entity_voting: 0.19}\n      re_t07_rho: {sj: 0.234, fk: 0.184, logprob: 0.26, exact_match: 0.12, entity_voting: 0.18}\n      re_t10_cond_rho: {sj: 0.316, fk: 0.307, logprob: 0.33}\n      re_t07_cond_rho: {sj: 0.372, fk: 0.253, logprob: 0.35}\n      re_t10_pct_zero: 44.3\n      re_t07_pct_zero: 42.4\n      re_t10_all_zero_filtered: 84\n      re_t07_all_zero_filtered: 96\n    result_rationale: >\n      T=0.7 vs T=1.0 的 tradeoff 是 signal quality vs output diversity。NER 上 SJ 几乎不受\n      T 影响（Δ=+0.005），因为 SJ 的 type-grouped matching 对 minor boundary shifts 鲁棒。但\n      FK 变化大（Δ=+0.062！）：T=0.7 下 samples 更相似，FK 的 exact-match based agreement 提升\n      显著，但 FK rho 并未 correspondingly 提升太多——说明 FK 的 higher absolute value at T=0.7\n      更多反映 reduced diversity 而非 better discrimination。Logprob 的 T-sensitivity 很小\n      （Δ=+0.01），因为 logprob 来自 forward pass 不依赖 sampling temperature。RE 上 pattern\n      更复杂：SJ full rho 在 T=0.7 下反而降低（0.244→0.234），但 conditional rho 显著提升\n      （0.316→0.372），因为 T=0.7 使更多 borderline instance 输出 all-zero（96 vs 84），effectively\n      做了更 aggressive 的 knowledge-gap filtering。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Temperature sensitivity — NER (all signals)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ at T=1.0\", \"ρ at T=0.7\", Δ]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ,            0.383, 0.388, \"+0.005\"]\n          - [FK,            0.259, 0.321, \"+0.062\"]\n          - [log-prob,      0.34,  0.35,  \"+0.01\"]\n          - [exact-match,   0.17,  0.20,  \"+0.03\"]\n          - [entity voting, 0.28,  0.30,  \"+0.02\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Temperature sensitivity — RE (SJ, FK, logprob)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ full T=1.0\", \"ρ full T=0.7\", \"ρ cond T=1.0\", \"ρ cond T=0.7\"]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ,      0.244, 0.234, 0.316, 0.372]\n          - [FK,      0.278, 0.184, 0.307, 0.253]\n          - [logprob, 0.270, 0.260, 0.330, 0.350]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2-panel: NER (left) all signals ρ at two T; RE (right) full vs cond ρ at two T\"\n      - \"Per-instance scatter: SJ at T=0.7 vs T=1.0, colored by F1 bucket\"\n    analysis: >\n      主要 takeaway：T 选择对 NER ρ 影响很小（SJ delta < 0.01），对 RE conditional ρ 影响较大\n      （SJ delta +0.056）。FK 是 T-sensitivity 最高的 signal，因为它基于 exact agreement 受\n      diversity 影响最大。Logprob 是 T-sensitivity 最低的（理论上应为零，微小差异来自 prompt\n      长度的 minor variation）。论文中作为 1-2 段 analysis 呈现，主要 takeaway：T=0.7 推荐为\n      default（NER 无影响，RE conditional 有提升），但 T 选择不是 critical hyperparameter。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-006: adaptive_compute_demo\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: adaptive_compute_demo\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      Best-of-N selection on ALL NER datasets + RE：SJ vs logprob vs FK vs exact-match\n      vs random vs greedy。覆盖 SciERC (N=16), CoNLL (N=8), WNUT (N=8), RE SciERC (N=8)。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- SciERC NER (N=16) ---\n      scierc_ner:\n        greedy:       0.667\n        random:       0.674\n        exact_match:  0.676\n        fk:           0.680\n        logprob:      0.688\n        sj:           0.692\n        oracle:       0.789\n        sj_over_greedy: 2.5\n        sj_over_logprob: 0.4\n        sj_headroom_capture_pct: 20.5\n        logprob_headroom_capture_pct: 17.2\n      # --- CoNLL NER (N=8) ---\n      conll_ner:\n        greedy:       0.723\n        random:       0.731\n        fk:           0.734\n        logprob:      0.739\n        sj:           0.741\n        oracle:       0.818\n        sj_over_greedy: 1.8\n        sj_over_logprob: 0.2\n      # --- WNUT NER (N=8) ---\n      wnut_ner:\n        greedy:       0.495\n        random:       0.506\n        fk:           0.510\n        logprob:      0.520\n        sj:           0.518\n        oracle:       0.620\n        sj_over_greedy: 2.3\n        sj_over_logprob: -0.2\n        logprob_beats_sj: true\n      # --- RE SciERC (N=8, negative) ---\n      scierc_re:\n        greedy:       0.421\n        random:       0.425\n        fk:           0.426\n        sj:           0.430\n        logprob:      0.434\n        oracle:       0.588\n        sj_over_greedy: 0.9\n        logprob_over_greedy: 1.3\n        logprob_beats_sj: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best-of-N 结果直接反映了 ranking quality（rho）到 practical F1 gain 的转化。SciERC 上\n      SJ gain=+2.5pp（headroom capture 20.5%）是 3 个 NER 数据集中最好的，对应最高的 rho=0.41。\n      但 SJ vs logprob 仅 +0.4pp on SciERC——这意味着 SJ 的 \"额外 structural info\" 只贡献了\n      0.4pp 的实际 F1 改善，reviewer 会问：这 0.4pp 值得 16x 推理成本吗？CoNLL 上 SJ vs logprob\n      仅 +0.2pp（essentially equivalent），WNUT 上 logprob 反超 SJ by 0.2pp。跨数据集模式：\n      SJ 一致优于 FK 和 random（3/3 datasets），但 SJ vs logprob 不一致（1/3 SJ wins marginally,\n      1/3 tie, 1/3 logprob wins marginally）。RE 上所有信号的 gain 都小（<1.5pp），且 logprob\n      最好（+1.3pp），确认 RE 上 consistency-based selection 价值有限。整体 best-of-N gain\n      在 [1.8, 2.5] pp 范围，与 median tier 的 [1.5, 3.5] 一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Best-of-N F1 comparison across datasets\"\n        columns: [Strategy, SciERC NER, CoNLL NER, WNUT NER, SciERC RE]\n        rows:\n          - [Greedy,      0.667, 0.723, 0.495, 0.421]\n          - [Random,      0.674, 0.731, 0.506, 0.425]\n          - [exact-match, 0.676, \"—\",   \"—\",   \"—\"]\n          - [FK,          0.680, 0.734, 0.510, 0.426]\n          - [log-prob,    0.688, 0.739, 0.520, 0.434]\n          - [SJ,          0.692, 0.741, 0.518, 0.430]\n          - [Oracle,      0.789, 0.818, 0.620, 0.588]\n      - name: \"Table: SJ vs logprob F1 gain over greedy\"\n        columns: [Dataset, SJ gain, logprob gain, \"SJ − logprob\", \"SJ better?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC NER, +2.5pp, +2.1pp, +0.4pp, \"Marginal\"]\n          - [CoNLL NER,  +1.8pp, +1.6pp, +0.2pp, \"No (trivial)\"]\n          - [WNUT NER,   +2.3pp, +2.5pp, \"−0.2pp\", \"No (logprob wins)\"]\n          - [SciERC RE,  +0.9pp, +1.3pp, \"−0.4pp\", \"No (logprob wins)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4-panel bar chart: one panel per dataset, showing F1 by strategy\"\n      - \"Line plot: SJ gain vs logprob gain across datasets, with 45-degree reference line\"\n    analysis: >\n      Adaptive compute demo 是论文最 practical 的结果但也最 underwhelming。SJ 一致 beat FK\n      和 random 但 vs logprob 的优势 inconsistent across datasets。+2.5pp max gain（SciERC）\n      是 technically meaningful 但不 dramatic。WNUT 和 RE 上 logprob 反超 SJ 是 clear evidence\n      that \"SJ is not universally the best selection signal\"。论文中应呈现为 complete table\n      with honest reporting，frame 为 \"SJ provides the most consistent gains across\n      conditions, but log-prob is a strong competitor at zero additional inference cost\"。\n      Ensemble (SJ + logprob) 是 natural follow-up that should be explored.\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-007: ner_multi_model (LLaMA)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: ner_multi_model\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on SciERC (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。\n      Cross-model validation。Inference 同时捕获 log-probs。\n    expected_results:\n      finetune_ner_f1: 0.63\n      finetune_train_loss: 0.092\n      greedy_f1: 0.601\n      oracle_f1: 0.748\n      headroom: 0.147\n      rho_sj_full: 0.33\n      rho_fk_full: 0.26\n      rho_logprob_full: 0.32\n      rho_exact_match_full: 0.16\n      rho_entity_voting_full: 0.25\n      sj_minus_fk_full: 0.07\n      sj_minus_logprob_full: 0.01\n      rho_sj_cond: 0.35\n      rho_fk_cond: 0.25\n      n_full: 529\n      n_cond: 488\n      p_sj_full: 5.6e-15\n      p_sj_vs_logprob: 0.36\n      sample_f1_mean: 0.52\n      sample_f1_pct_zero: 17.1\n      sj_beats_logprob_conclusive: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B 的 SciERC fine-tune 弱于 Qwen3-8B（greedy F1 0.60 vs 0.67），因为\n      LLaMA 的 instruction following 和 structured output 能力略差（Qwen3 在代码/结构化任务上\n      经过更多优化）。rho_sj=0.33 低于 Qwen 的 0.41，但 SJ>FK +7pp 仍显著成立，证明\n      \"structural > surface consistency\" 是 model-agnostic finding。SJ vs logprob 差距 +0.01\n      （p=0.36，不显著），与 Qwen 上的 +0.04 方向一致但更弱。llama_sj_beats_logprob 判定为\n      inconclusive，与 median tier 预期一致。rho 降低的主要原因：LLaMA lower baseline\n      performance 意味着更多 instance 在 \"inability\" 区间（all-zero 17.1% vs 11.2%），\n      这些 instance dilute overall correlation。更大的 headroom（0.147 vs 0.097）说明\n      LLaMA 的 stochastic samples 更 diverse（weaker model = more variable outputs），\n      暗示 SJ-based selection 在 weaker model 上有更大 potential 但当前 correlation 不足\n      以充分 exploit 这个 headroom。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-model comparison on SciERC NER (N=8, T=0.7)\"\n        columns: [Metric, Qwen3-8B, LLaMA-3.1-8B]\n        rows:\n          - [Greedy F1,      0.667, 0.601]\n          - [ρ_SJ (full),    0.39,  0.33]\n          - [ρ_FK (full),    0.32,  0.26]\n          - [ρ_logprob,      0.35,  0.32]\n          - [SJ − FK,        +7pp,  +7pp]\n          - [SJ − logprob,   +4pp,  +1pp]\n          - [Oracle F1,      0.759, 0.748]\n          - [Headroom,       0.097, 0.147]\n          - [\"% F1=0 samples\", 11.2, 17.1]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 5 signals for Qwen vs LLaMA, showing consistent SJ>FK but inconsistent SJ vs logprob\"\n    analysis: >\n      Multi-model 结果 addresses R2 但 mixed message：SJ>FK 是 model-agnostic（两个 model\n      均 +7pp），但 SJ vs logprob 从 Qwen 的 +4pp（significant）降至 LLaMA 的 +1pp\n      （not significant）。这与 median tier 完全一致——SJ 的 structural advantage 在不同\n      model 上不 robust relative to logprob。论文中应诚实报告：\"The SJ advantage over FK\n      is model-agnostic (+7pp on both models), but the advantage over log-prob is\n      model-dependent and not consistently significant.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-008: re_n16_confirmation (P1)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: re_n16_confirmation\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      RE N=16 on SciERC (ft_002_v2, T=0.7) 确认 negative finding with higher statistical power。\n    expected_results:\n      greedy_f1: 0.421\n      oracle_f1_n16: 0.628\n      headroom_n16: 0.207\n      rho_sj_full_n16: 0.25\n      rho_fk_full_n16: 0.20\n      rho_logprob_full_n16: 0.28\n      rho_exact_match_full_n16: 0.13\n      rho_sj_cond_n16: 0.34\n      rho_fk_cond_n16: 0.27\n      rho_logprob_cond_n16: 0.36\n      sj_beats_fk_full: true\n      logprob_beats_sj_full: true\n      logprob_beats_sj_cond: true\n      n_full: 397\n      n_cond: 298\n      all_zero_count: 99\n      pct_zero_samples: 41.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      RE N=16 的 full rho_sj=0.25 vs N=8 的 0.234，提升极小（+0.016），因为 compound error\n      propagation 不因 more samples 缓解——16 个 samples 产生的 span-level SJ 仍无法区分\n      \"不确定 head entity\" vs \"不确定 relation type\" vs \"根本不知道这个 relation\"。Logprob\n      在 RE N=16 上仍然最强（rho=0.28），且 conditional 上也领先（0.36 vs SJ 0.34），这在\n      N=8 时已有迹象但 N=16 下更 definitive。所有信号的 max rho=0.28（logprob），在 median\n      tier 范围 [0.22, 0.32] 内。Oracle headroom 从 0.167→0.207 说明 N=16 确实覆盖了更多\n      RE output modes，但 selection signals 都不够好来 exploit 这个 headroom。Conditional\n      rho 在 N=16 下未有大幅提升（SJ: 0.372→0.34，甚至微降），因为更多 samples 并未帮助\n      区分 boundary cases——反而可能因为 N=16 下 all-zero 的 threshold 更 noisy。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: RE N-scaling — all signals\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ full N=8\", \"ρ full N=16\", \"ρ cond N=8\", \"ρ cond N=16\"]\n        rows:\n          - [logprob,     0.260, 0.280, 0.350, 0.360]\n          - [SJ,          0.234, 0.250, 0.372, 0.340]\n          - [FK,          0.184, 0.200, 0.253, 0.270]\n          - [exact-match, 0.120, 0.130, 0.150, 0.160]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side: NER N=16 vs RE N=16, showing stark contrast in signal quality\"\n    analysis: >\n      RE N=16 confirms Claim 2 with higher statistical power：compound error propagation\n      是 fundamental bottleneck。Logprob 在 RE 上一致最优（full 和 cond 均领先）是重要发现——\n      说明在复杂任务上 model's internal confidence 比 any external consistency metric 更\n      informative。论文中直接写：\"Increasing N from 8 to 16 yields negligible improvement\n      in RE full-set correlation for any signal tested, confirming that the degradation\n      is structural rather than statistical.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-009: capability_stratification (P1)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: capability_stratification\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      按 difficulty strata（greedy F1 buckets + 独立 proxy: sentence length, entity count）\n      分层分析 rho，验证 inverted-U pattern。NER + RE。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- NER strata (greedy F1 buckets, N=16) ---\n      ner_strata:\n        high_f1_gt_08:   {n: 185, rho_sj: 0.14, rho_logprob: 0.12, ci: \"[0.02, 0.26]\"}\n        medium_f1_04_08: {n: 212, rho_sj: 0.45, rho_logprob: 0.38, ci: \"[0.34, 0.55]\"}\n        low_f1_lt_04:    {n: 132, rho_sj: 0.22, rho_logprob: 0.20, ci: \"[0.06, 0.38]\"}\n      # --- RE strata ---\n      re_strata:\n        high_f1_gt_06:   {n: 88,  rho_sj: 0.12, ci: \"[-0.09, 0.32]\"}\n        medium_f1_02_06: {n: 135, rho_sj: 0.31, ci: \"[0.16, 0.45]\"}\n        low_f1_lt_02:    {n: 174, rho_sj: 0.16, ci: \"[0.02, 0.30]\"}\n      # --- Independent proxy: entity count ---\n      ner_entity_count_proxy:\n        low_entities_0_2:   {n: 180, rho_sj: 0.18}\n        medium_entities_3_5: {n: 210, rho_sj: 0.42}\n        high_entities_6plus: {n: 139, rho_sj: 0.28}\n      ner_peak_stratum: \"medium (F1 0.4-0.8)\"\n      re_peak_stratum: \"medium (F1 0.2-0.6)\"\n      boundary_sharpness: \"fuzzy — 10-15pp overlap between strata CIs\"\n      independent_proxy_confirms_inverted_u: true\n      proxy_correlation_with_f1_bucket: 0.58\n    result_rationale: >\n      Inverted-U 形状的根本原因：High stratum（easy instances）的 F1 和 SJ 都高且 variance 低，\n      ceiling effect 压缩 rank 差异（rho_sj=0.14）；Low stratum（hard instances）model 基本\n      fail，SJ 接近 random（rho_sj=0.22）。Medium stratum 同时有足够 variance 和 genuine\n      uncertainty，使 SJ discriminate 最有效（rho_sj=0.45）。在 medium stratum 内 SJ 明显\n      优于 logprob（0.45 vs 0.38），说明 SJ 的 structural info 在 \"model 有能力但不确定\" 的\n      sweet spot 上最有价值。独立 proxy（entity count）也呈现 inverted-U（low: 0.18, medium:\n      0.42, high: 0.28），且与 F1 bucket 的 correlation=0.58——moderate correlation 说明\n      entity count 是 reasonable 但 imperfect 的 independent proxy，inverted-U 不完全是\n      F1 bucket 的 circular artifact。但 boundary 很 fuzzy：strata CI 大幅重叠\n      （bootstrap CI width ~0.08-0.12），无法画出 clean cutoff。RE 的 pattern 更极端——\n      Low stratum 极大（n=174），反映 model capability 的 fundamental limitation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: NER ρ_SJ by difficulty stratum (N=16)\"\n        columns: [Stratum, F1 range, n, ρ_SJ, ρ_logprob, \"95% CI (SJ)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Easy,   \">0.8\",   185, 0.14, 0.12, \"[0.02, 0.26]\"]\n          - [Medium, \"0.4-0.8\", 212, 0.45, 0.38, \"[0.34, 0.55]\"]\n          - [Hard,   \"<0.4\",   132, 0.22, 0.20, \"[0.06, 0.38]\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Independent proxy (entity count) — NER\"\n        columns: [Entity count, n, ρ_SJ]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0-2 (few)\",   180, 0.18]\n          - [\"3-5 (medium)\", 210, 0.42]\n          - [\"6+ (many)\",   139, 0.28]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2-panel inverted-U: ρ_SJ and ρ_logprob vs stratum for NER (left) and RE (right) with CI ribbons\"\n      - \"Scatter: entity count vs greedy F1, colored by SJ rank accuracy, showing the sweet spot visually\"\n    analysis: >\n      Inverted-U 是 strongest analytical finding：解释了 \"为什么 overall ρ 只有 0.41——因为\n      easy 和 hard instances dilute the signal\"。Medium stratum 内 SJ 明显优于 logprob\n      （0.45 vs 0.38，+7pp）说明 SJ 在 sweet spot 上有独特价值——这是论文中最能 justify\n      SJ 的 analysis。Independent proxy 基本 confirms pattern 但不 definitive（r=0.58）。\n      论文中应诚实 frame：\"The inverted-U pattern is consistent across difficulty proxies\n      but boundaries are fuzzy; SJ's advantage over log-prob is concentrated in the\n      medium-difficulty stratum where genuine uncertainty, rather than inability,\n      drives output variation.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-010: selection_curves (P2)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: selection_curves\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      Best-of-N selection curves for N=1,2,4,8,16，all confidence signals，SciERC NER。\n    expected_results:\n      curves_sj:      {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.673, n4: 0.680, n8: 0.686, n16: 0.692}\n      curves_logprob:  {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.672, n4: 0.679, n8: 0.684, n16: 0.688}\n      curves_fk:      {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.670, n4: 0.675, n8: 0.678, n16: 0.680}\n      curves_entity_voting: {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.670, n4: 0.674, n8: 0.677, n16: 0.679}\n      curves_exact_match: {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.669, n4: 0.672, n8: 0.675, n16: 0.676}\n      curves_rand:    {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.669, n4: 0.671, n8: 0.673, n16: 0.674}\n      curves_oracle:  {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.710, n4: 0.745, n8: 0.776, n16: 0.789}\n      sj_logprob_gap_n4: 0.001\n      sj_logprob_gap_n8: 0.002\n      sj_logprob_gap_n16: 0.004\n    result_rationale: >\n      Selection curves 显示所有 practical signals 都远低于 oracle——oracle 在 N=16 时 F1=0.789\n      而 SJ 仅 0.692，gap=0.097pp。SJ 在所有 N 上 consistently outperform 其他信号，但\n      SJ-logprob gap 极小（N=4: 0.1pp, N=8: 0.2pp, N=16: 0.4pp），只有在 N≥8 时才开始\n      visible。Gap 随 N 增大是因为 more samples 给 SJ 的 structural comparison 更多\n      information，而 logprob 的 mean 在 N>4 后趋于 stable。所有 curves 呈 diminishing\n      returns，且 practical signals 的 curve 在 N=8 后几乎 flat——说明当前 signal quality\n      下 N>16 不会有 meaningful gain。Oracle curve 持续上升说明 bottleneck 是 selection\n      accuracy 而非 sample diversity。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: F1 vs N for 7 strategies with CI bands. Oracle rises steeply; others cluster near bottom. Inset zoom on N=8-16 range showing SJ-logprob gap\"\n    analysis: >\n      这张图的 visual impact 取决于 presentation。If zoomed to full range，SJ/FK/logprob/random\n      看起来一样。Inset zoom 是必须的。Key message：\"All signals capture only a fraction of\n      oracle headroom; SJ consistently leads but the margin over logprob is slim.\"\n      建议在论文中作为 Figure 而非 Table 呈现（Dream flagged table-only presentation）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-011: ner_ood_robustness (P2)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: ner_ood_robustness\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      Cross-domain transfer：WNUT fine-tuned model applied to SciERC test set (domain shift\n      from social media → scientific text)，测试 consistency signal 在 OOD setting 下的鲁棒性。\n    expected_results:\n      ood_greedy_f1: 0.32\n      ood_oracle_f1: 0.48\n      ood_headroom: 0.16\n      ood_rho_sj_full: 0.22\n      ood_rho_fk_full: 0.18\n      ood_rho_logprob_full: 0.25\n      ood_rho_exact_match_full: 0.10\n      ood_sj_minus_fk: 0.04\n      ood_sj_minus_logprob: -0.03\n      ood_n: 529\n      ood_pct_zero: 28.4\n      in_domain_comparison:\n        wnut_in_domain_rho_sj: 0.30\n        scierc_ood_rho_sj: 0.22\n        delta: -0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      OOD（WNUT model → SciERC data）产生 severe domain shift：social media 训练的模型对\n      scientific entity types（Method, Task, Material 等）几乎没有 concept，greedy F1 仅 0.32。\n      rho_sj=0.22 比 in-domain WNUT（0.30）降低 0.08，因为 domain shift 导致 systematic error\n      而非 random uncertainty——model 一致地 fail on scientific entities，产生 high SJ（samples\n      一致地错）但 low F1，破坏 SJ-accuracy correlation。Logprob 在 OOD 上仍然最强（0.25），\n      因为 logprob 对 OOD text 的 low confidence 更 faithfully 反映了 model 的 inability。\n      SJ vs logprob = -0.03（logprob wins），与 WNUT in-domain 的 -0.01 方向一致但更 extreme。\n      这进一步收窄了 SJ 的 applicable scope：not only dataset-dependent (WNUT vs SciERC)\n      but also domain-sensitive (in-domain vs OOD)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: In-domain vs OOD consistency signal robustness\"\n        columns: [Setting, Greedy F1, ρ_SJ, ρ_logprob, ρ_FK, \"SJ−logprob\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"WNUT in-domain\",     0.495, 0.30, 0.31, 0.23, \"−0.01\"]\n          - [\"WNUT→SciERC (OOD)\",  0.320, 0.22, 0.25, 0.18, \"−0.03\"]\n          - [\"SciERC in-domain\",   0.667, 0.39, 0.35, 0.32, \"+0.04\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: in-domain vs OOD ρ for all signals, showing uniform degradation\"\n    analysis: >\n      OOD 结果是 negative 但 informative。Uniform degradation across all signals 说明 OOD\n      不是 SJ-specific problem。但 logprob 在 OOD 下 relative advantage 增大——从 in-domain\n      的 -0.01 到 OOD 的 -0.03——说明 model confidence 在 unfamiliar domain 上是更 reliable\n      的 proxy than structural consistency。论文中作为 \"limitations\" 呈现：consistency signals\n      degrade under domain shift, with structural signals (SJ) degrading slightly more\n      than model confidence (logprob)。P2 优先级，时间紧可 cut。\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9183,"cache_read_input_tokens":53072,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9183},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fc74e73e-cb6b-451f-8484-a3b6959b28cd","uuid":"a4b6f110-af34-4171-9156-63bde7acda7a"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NmWRXr8uipyAaqPM33KZXP","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T093336/median/imagined_experiments.yaml has been updated successfully."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fc74e73e-cb6b-451f-8484-a3b6959b28cd","uuid":"140abd10-01d7-45a5-99e1-617c4203bb24","timestamp":"2026-05-14T11:13:04.489Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"update","filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T093336/median/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"tier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1 降级为 systematic comparison 贡献：SJ 是最优 consistency metric（显著优于 FK +7-12pp 和\n  exact-match +19pp），但与零成本 log-prob 互补而非替代（SJ - logprob 仅 +0.04 on SciERC，CoNLL 上\n  打平，WNUT 上 logprob 微弱反超）。核心 reframe：首次在结构化预测 TTS 中系统比较四类置信信号，\n  发现 (a) 结构一致性 > 表面一致性，(b) log-prob 是意外强 baseline 表明模型已内化部分一致性信息，\n  (c) SJ+logprob ensemble 可能是最优组合（new highlight）。跨数据集 2/3 复现 SJ>FK，但 SJ vs logprob\n  排序不一致破坏了 \"SJ 是最优信号\" 的简洁叙事。Claim 2 保持：所有信号在 RE 上均退化，logprob 在 RE\n  上甚至略优于 SJ，加强了 task-complexity boundary 的普适性——不是 SJ 特有的问题，而是 consistency-based\n  TTS 的根本局限。多指标结果不一致（ρ 上 SJ 微优但 AUROC 上 logprob 近乎打平）进一步复杂化了 ranking。\n  标题方向：\"Structural vs. Statistical Confidence: A Systematic Comparison of Self-Consistency\n  Signals for Information Extraction Test-Time Scaling\"。目标 EMNLP Main/Findings 均可，\n  Findings 更 realistic。补充 SJ+logprob ensemble 作为 forward-looking contribution。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-012: baseline_logprob (MAKE-OR-BREAK)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: baseline_logprob\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      对 pilot_004 (T=1.0) 和 pilot_005 (T=0.7) 的所有 stochastic samples 做 vLLM forward pass\n      提取 sequence log-probability，计算 mean log-prob per instance，与 F1 做 Spearman ρ / AUROC / τ。\n      覆盖 NER 和 RE。这是决定论文贡献强度的关键实验。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- NER SciERC (T=0.7, pilot_005 baseline) ---\n      ner_t07_logprob_rho_full: 0.35\n      ner_t07_logprob_rho_cond: 0.36\n      ner_t07_logprob_p_full: 3.2e-17\n      ner_t07_logprob_auroc: 0.66\n      ner_t07_logprob_tau: 0.24\n      ner_t07_logprob_calibration_ece: 0.10\n      ner_t07_sj_minus_logprob_rho: 0.04\n      ner_t07_sj_minus_logprob_auroc: 0.01\n      # --- NER SciERC (T=1.0, pilot_004 baseline) ---\n      ner_t10_logprob_rho_full: 0.34\n      ner_t10_logprob_rho_cond: 0.35\n      ner_t10_sj_minus_logprob_rho: 0.04\n      # --- RE SciERC (T=0.7) ---\n      re_t07_logprob_rho_full: 0.26\n      re_t07_logprob_rho_cond: 0.35\n      re_t07_logprob_auroc: 0.60\n      re_t07_logprob_tau: 0.18\n      re_t07_logprob_beats_sj_full: true\n      re_t07_sj_minus_logprob_full: -0.026\n      # --- RE SciERC (T=1.0) ---\n      re_t10_logprob_rho_full: 0.27\n      re_t10_logprob_rho_cond: 0.33\n      re_t10_logprob_beats_sj_full: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Log-prob 是强 baseline 的根本原因：sequence log-prob 直接编码了模型对整个输出序列的置信度，\n      而 LLM 在 SFT 后已经部分学会了 \"高置信 = 高质量\"。NER 上 logprob rho=0.35 低于 SJ 的 0.39，\n      差距 +0.04 统计显著（bootstrap CI 不重叠，n=529）但 effect size 小——reviewer 会质疑 0.04 的\n      delta 是否 justify 16x inference cost。AUROC 差距更小（0.67 vs 0.66），说明在 binary\n      classification（good/bad output）任务上两者几乎等价——SJ 的优势主要在 ranking 的 fine-grained\n      层面。RE 上 logprob rho=0.26 反超 SJ 的 0.234，原因：log-prob 不受 compound error propagation\n      影响，它对整个序列统一评分，不依赖于 span-level structural matching；而 SJ 的 set-based\n      comparison 在 RE 上因 span confusion 失去 discriminative power。这是 median 档的核心张力——\n      SJ 在 NER 上微弱领先，在 RE 上反而落后，使 \"SJ 是最优信号\" 的叙事不成立，必须 reframe 为\n      \"SJ 是最优 consistency metric，与 log-prob 互补\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Log-prob vs SJ on SciERC (T=0.7)\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER ρ, NER AUROC, NER τ, RE ρ (full), RE ρ (cond)]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ,      0.39,  0.67, 0.26, 0.234, 0.372]\n          - [FK,      0.32,  0.62, 0.21, 0.184, 0.253]\n          - [log-prob, 0.35, 0.66, 0.24, 0.260, 0.350]\n      - name: \"Table: SJ minus log-prob delta by task\"\n        columns: [Task, Δρ, Δ AUROC, Δτ, \"SJ wins?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [NER (full),  +0.04,  +0.01, +0.02, \"Yes (weak)\"]\n          - [NER (cond),  +0.03,  +0.01, +0.02, \"Yes (weak)\"]\n          - [RE (full),  -0.026,  -0.02, -0.02, \"No\"]\n          - [RE (cond),  +0.022,  +0.01, +0.01, \"Marginal\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: log-prob vs F1 for NER instances (n=529), colored by SJ quartile, showing partial overlap between high-logprob and high-SJ instances\"\n      - \"2-panel correlation heatmap: NER (left) and RE (right), showing pairwise ρ between all signals (SJ, FK, logprob, F1)\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文命运的分水岭。SJ 在 NER 上 Δρ=+0.04 的优势 real 但 modest，reviewer 会计算\n      16x inference cost / 0.04 rho gain = 每单位 rho 提升成本极高。AUROC 近乎打平（0.67 vs 0.66）\n      是更大的问题——它意味着 SJ 在 \"能否区分好坏输出\" 这个 practical 问题上几乎不比 log-prob 好。\n      RE 上 logprob 反超 SJ 是 unexpected 但 interpretable：logprob 是 task-agnostic 的全局信号，\n      不受 structured matching 在复杂任务上的退化影响。论文 reframe 策略：(1) SJ 是 best consistency\n      metric（vs FK, exact-match），(2) logprob 是 surprisingly strong baseline 揭示模型已内化\n      consistency 信息，(3) 两类信号捕获不同维度 → ensemble 是 natural next step。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-013: baseline_exact_match\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: baseline_exact_match\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      对 pilot_004/005 的 N=8 stochastic samples 计算 exact-match voting rate（有多少 sample pairs\n      产生完全相同的 entity/relation set），用 voting rate 与 F1 计算 ρ/AUROC/τ。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- NER SciERC (T=0.7, pilot_005) ---\n      ner_t07_exact_match_rate_mean: 0.14\n      ner_t07_exact_match_rate_std: 0.22\n      ner_t07_exact_match_rho_full: 0.20\n      ner_t07_exact_match_rho_cond: 0.21\n      ner_t07_exact_match_p_full: 3.8e-06\n      ner_t07_exact_match_auroc: 0.58\n      ner_t07_exact_match_tau: 0.14\n      ner_t07_pct_zero_exact_match: 52.4\n      # --- NER SciERC (T=1.0, pilot_004) ---\n      ner_t10_exact_match_rate_mean: 0.09\n      ner_t10_exact_match_rho_full: 0.17\n      ner_t10_pct_zero_exact_match: 61.3\n      # --- RE SciERC (T=0.7) ---\n      re_t07_exact_match_rate_mean: 0.04\n      re_t07_exact_match_rho_full: 0.12\n      re_t07_exact_match_rho_cond: 0.14\n      re_t07_exact_match_auroc: 0.54\n      re_t07_pct_zero_exact_match: 78.6\n      # --- RE SciERC (T=1.0) ---\n      re_t10_exact_match_rate_mean: 0.02\n      re_t10_exact_match_rho_full: 0.09\n      re_t10_pct_zero_exact_match: 84.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      Exact-match 是 Wang et al. (2023) self-consistency 的直接类比，但在 structured output 上\n      表现最差，原因清晰：IE 输出包含多个实体/关系，每个的 boundary、type、text 都必须完全一致才算\n      exact match。在 N=8 T=0.7 下 NER 平均只有 14% 的 sample pairs 完全匹配（52% instance 的\n      exact match rate = 0），因为即使模型 \"大致正确\"，boundary 差一个 token 就判为不匹配。这导致\n      exact-match voting rate 是一个极度 sparse 的信号，大量 instance 被挤在 rate=0 处无法区分。\n      rho=0.20 显著低于 SJ（0.39）和 logprob（0.35），清楚展示了 \"surface exact match 不适合\n      structured prediction\" 的论点。RE 更极端——78.6% instance 的 exact match rate = 0，\n      因为 relation triplet 完全匹配的概率极低。这是 paper 中最清晰的 negative baseline，支撑\n      \"need structured comparison\" 的动机。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Exact-match voting statistics on SciERC\"\n        columns: [Task, T, mean rate, \"% rate=0\", ρ (full), AUROC]\n        rows:\n          - [NER, 0.7, 0.14, 52.4%, 0.20, 0.58]\n          - [NER, 1.0, 0.09, 61.3%, 0.17, 0.55]\n          - [RE,  0.7, 0.04, 78.6%, 0.12, 0.54]\n          - [RE,  1.0, 0.02, 84.1%, 0.09, 0.52]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: distribution of exact-match rate across instances (NER), showing heavy spike at 0 and thin tail\"\n    analysis: >\n      Exact-match 是最弱 baseline，这对论文叙事有利——它清晰证明了 \"原始 self-consistency 直接应用于\n      structured output 效果差，需要 set-aware metric\"。SJ vs exact-match 的 Δρ=+0.19 是论文中\n      最大的 effect size，比 SJ vs logprob 的 +0.04 convincing 得多。建议在论文中用 exact-match\n      作为 \"naive baseline\" 来 motivate SJ 的 design。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-014: baseline_entity_voting\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: baseline_entity_voting\n    plan_id: exp-014\n    description: >\n      Entity-level majority voting：对 N=8 samples 中每个 entity mention 统计出现频次，以 threshold\n      ≥ N/2 = 4 构建 consensus entity set，以 consensus 置信度（mean frequency/N）作为 instance-level\n      signal 与 F1 做 correlation。同时比较 voting consensus F1 vs SJ-selected sample F1。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- NER SciERC (T=0.7, pilot_005) ---\n      ner_t07_entity_voting_rho_full: 0.30\n      ner_t07_entity_voting_rho_cond: 0.31\n      ner_t07_entity_voting_p_full: 1.4e-12\n      ner_t07_entity_voting_auroc: 0.63\n      ner_t07_entity_voting_tau: 0.20\n      ner_t07_voting_consensus_f1: 0.681\n      ner_t07_sj_selected_f1: 0.685\n      ner_t07_greedy_f1: 0.662\n      ner_t07_voting_vs_greedy_gain: 1.9\n      ner_t07_sj_vs_voting_f1_gain: 0.4\n      # --- NER SciERC (T=1.0, pilot_004) ---\n      ner_t10_entity_voting_rho_full: 0.28\n      ner_t10_voting_consensus_f1: 0.676\n      # --- RE SciERC (T=0.7) ---\n      re_t07_entity_voting_rho_full: 0.18\n      re_t07_entity_voting_auroc: 0.56\n      re_t07_relation_voting_consensus_f1: 0.405\n    result_rationale: >\n      Entity voting 是 exact-match 的 \"partial credit\" 版本——不要求整个 sample 完全匹配，而是\n      逐 entity 统计 agreement。rho=0.30 居于 SJ（0.39）和 exact-match（0.20）之间，因为它捕获了\n      entity-level 的 partial consistency 但丢失了 entity 间的 structural relationship（SJ 的\n      type-grouped matching 保留了 type-aware 比较）。Voting consensus F1=0.681 接近 SJ selection\n      F1=0.685（差仅 0.4pp），说明 entity voting 作为一种 ensemble/aggregation 策略效果不差——但\n      voting 构建的是 \"合成\" 输出（从多个 sample 中拼接 entities），而 SJ selection 选择的是\n      单个 \"最好的\" sample，两种策略的比较维度不同。RE 上 entity voting rho=0.18 远低于 NER 的\n      0.30，因为 relation voting 需要 head+tail+type 三重匹配，且 relation boundary 远比 entity\n      模糊。论文中 entity voting 是 \"intermediate complexity\" baseline：比 exact-match 强，\n      比 SJ 弱，提供了 \"metric complexity vs signal quality\" 的 gradient。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Entity voting vs other signals (NER SciERC T=0.7)\"\n        columns: [Signal, ρ (full), AUROC, τ]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ,             0.39, 0.67, 0.26]\n          - [log-prob,       0.35, 0.66, 0.24]\n          - [entity voting,  0.30, 0.63, 0.20]\n          - [FK,             0.32, 0.62, 0.21]\n          - [exact-match,    0.20, 0.58, 0.14]\n      - name: \"Table: Voting consensus F1 vs selection F1\"\n        columns: [Strategy, F1, Gain vs Greedy]\n        rows:\n          - [Greedy (T=0),        0.662, \"—\"]\n          - [Voting consensus,    0.681, +1.9pp]\n          - [SJ selection,        0.685, +2.3pp]\n          - [Oracle,              0.759, +9.7pp]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 5 signals ranked by ρ (SJ > logprob > FK > entity-voting > exact-match), with CI bars\"\n      - \"Scatter: entity voting confidence vs SJ score per instance, showing moderate correlation (r~0.6)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Entity voting rho=0.30 产生一个有趣的排序：SJ > logprob > FK ≈ entity-voting > exact-match。\n      FK 和 entity voting 在 rho 上接近（0.32 vs 0.30），但 entity voting 的 consensus F1 更高——\n      这说明 voting 作为 aggregation 策略有效，但作为 confidence signal 不如 FK。论文中应区分\n      \"signal for ranking\" 和 \"strategy for aggregation\" 两个维度。Voting consensus F1=0.681\n      接近 SJ selection F1=0.685 是一个微妙的发现——暗示 \"选最好的 sample\" 和 \"从多个 sample 中\n      合成\" 可能在 NER 上差不多，值得后续探索。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-015: evaluation_metrics_expansion\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: evaluation_metrics_expansion\n    plan_id: exp-015\n    description: >\n      对所有信号（SJ, FK, logprob, exact-match, entity-voting）在所有数据集上计算完整 metric suite：\n      Spearman ρ, AUROC, Kendall τ, calibration ECE, leave-one-out SJ。综合 dashboard。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Multi-metric dashboard: SciERC NER (T=0.7) ---\n      scierc_ner_dashboard:\n        SJ:            {rho: 0.39, auroc: 0.67, tau: 0.26, ece: 0.12}\n        FK:            {rho: 0.32, auroc: 0.62, tau: 0.21, ece: 0.15}\n        logprob:       {rho: 0.35, auroc: 0.66, tau: 0.24, ece: 0.10}\n        exact_match:   {rho: 0.20, auroc: 0.58, tau: 0.14, ece: 0.19}\n        entity_voting: {rho: 0.30, auroc: 0.63, tau: 0.20, ece: 0.14}\n        SJ_loo:        {rho: 0.37, auroc: 0.65, tau: 0.25, ece: 0.13}\n      # --- Multi-metric dashboard: SciERC RE (T=0.7) ---\n      scierc_re_dashboard:\n        SJ:            {rho: 0.234, auroc: 0.59, tau: 0.16, ece: 0.21}\n        FK:            {rho: 0.184, auroc: 0.56, tau: 0.13, ece: 0.23}\n        logprob:       {rho: 0.260, auroc: 0.60, tau: 0.18, ece: 0.18}\n        exact_match:   {rho: 0.120, auroc: 0.54, tau: 0.08, ece: 0.26}\n        entity_voting: {rho: 0.180, auroc: 0.56, tau: 0.12, ece: 0.22}\n      # --- Cross-dataset NER ρ summary ---\n      cross_dataset_rho:\n        SciERC:   {SJ: 0.39, FK: 0.32, logprob: 0.35, exact_match: 0.20, entity_voting: 0.30}\n        CoNLL:    {SJ: 0.33, FK: 0.26, logprob: 0.32, exact_match: 0.18, entity_voting: 0.27}\n        WNUT:     {SJ: 0.30, FK: 0.23, logprob: 0.31, exact_match: 0.15, entity_voting: 0.24}\n      # --- Cross-dataset NER AUROC summary ---\n      cross_dataset_auroc:\n        SciERC:   {SJ: 0.67, logprob: 0.66}\n        CoNLL:    {SJ: 0.64, logprob: 0.64}\n        WNUT:     {SJ: 0.62, logprob: 0.63}\n      # --- Leave-one-out SJ robustness ---\n      sj_loo_delta_rho: -0.02\n      sj_loo_delta_auroc: -0.02\n      sj_loo_conclusion: \"modest drop, no circularity concern\"\n      # --- Key cross-metric finding ---\n      metric_disagreement: >\n        ρ consistently favors SJ (3/3 datasets), but AUROC shows SJ ≈ logprob\n        on SciERC/CoNLL and logprob > SJ on WNUT. Calibration (ECE) favors\n        logprob on all datasets. This metric-dependent ranking complicates the\n        \"SJ is best\" narrative.\n    result_rationale: >\n      多指标扩展揭示了 median 档的核心复杂性：不同评估标准给出不同排序。ρ 衡量 fine-grained ranking\n      能力，SJ 一致胜出（因为 SJ 对 medium-difficulty instance 的 structural nuance 更敏感）。\n      AUROC 衡量 binary classification 能力（区分 good vs bad output），logprob 几乎追平 SJ\n      （因为 logprob 对 \"输出总体质量\" 的粗粒度判断已经足够好）。ECE 衡量校准性，logprob 天然更好\n      （因为 log-prob 本身就是 probability，而 SJ/FK 是距离度量需要额外校准）。Leave-one-out SJ\n      仅掉 0.02 rho，说明 evaluation circularity 不是主要 concern（SJ 用 all N samples 计算 vs\n      N-1 samples 差异很小）。这个多维度结果迫使论文采用 nuanced framing：\"SJ 在 ranking 上最优，\n      但在 practical 选择场景下与 logprob 差距不大\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-metric comparison — NER SciERC (T=0.7)\"\n        columns: [Signal, ρ, AUROC, τ, ECE, Rank(ρ), Rank(AUROC)]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ,            0.39, 0.67, 0.26, 0.12, 1, 1]\n          - [log-prob,      0.35, 0.66, 0.24, 0.10, 2, 2]\n          - [FK,            0.32, 0.62, 0.21, 0.15, 3, 4]\n          - [entity voting, 0.30, 0.63, 0.20, 0.14, 4, 3]\n          - [exact-match,   0.20, 0.58, 0.14, 0.19, 5, 5]\n          - [SJ (LOO),      0.37, 0.65, 0.25, 0.13, \"—\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-dataset NER ρ — SJ vs logprob\"\n        columns: [Dataset, ρ_SJ, ρ_logprob, Δ, \"Δ significant?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC,    0.39, 0.35, +0.04, \"Yes (p<0.05)\"]\n          - [CoNLL-2003, 0.33, 0.32, +0.01, \"No (p=0.38)\"]\n          - [WNUT-17,   0.30, 0.31, -0.01, \"No (p=0.42)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart: 5 signals × 4 metrics (ρ, AUROC, τ, 1-ECE), showing SJ and logprob occupy similar profile space\"\n      - \"Calibration reliability diagram: SJ vs logprob, showing logprob has better calibration (closer to diagonal)\"\n      - \"Heatmap: dataset × signal × metric, showing the inconsistent ranking pattern across datasets and metrics\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文最重要的综合分析表。核心发现：(1) SJ 在 ρ 上一致第一，但优势在不同数据集上从 +4pp\n      缩小到 -1pp；(2) AUROC 上 SJ 和 logprob 几乎无差（WNUT 上 logprob 反超）；(3) 校准性上\n      logprob 天然更好。论文不能声称 SJ 是全面最优——必须诚实呈现 \"which metric you choose\n      determines which signal wins\"。建议的 framing：SJ 作为 consistency metric 在 ranking 上\n      最优，但 logprob 在校准和 cost-effectiveness 上更优；两者互补而非替代。Leave-one-out 结果\n      解决 circularity concern，是 clean positive 结果。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-001: ner_n16_scierc\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: ner_n16_scierc\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      SciERC NER N=16 采样（ft_002_v2, T=0.7, seeds [42,123,456]），测试 rho 是否\n      突破 0.40 并提供 N-scaling 数据。Inference 同时输出 log-probs 供 exp-012 使用。\n    expected_results:\n      greedy_f1: 0.667\n      oracle_f1_n16: 0.789\n      headroom_n16: 0.122\n      rho_sj_full_n16: 0.41\n      rho_fk_full_n16: 0.29\n      rho_logprob_full_n16: 0.36\n      rho_sj_cond_n16: 0.42\n      rho_fk_cond_n16: 0.28\n      sj_minus_fk_full: 0.12\n      sj_minus_logprob_full: 0.05\n      n_full: 529\n      n_cond: 509\n      sample_f1_mean: 0.612\n      sample_f1_pct_zero: 11.5\n      p_sj_full: 2.1e-22\n      seed_robustness_rho_sj_std: 0.008\n      seed_robustness_rho_sj_range: [0.402, 0.418]\n    result_rationale: >\n      N=8→N=16 提供更稳定的 SJ 估计（pairwise comparison 从 C(8,2)=28 增至 C(16,2)=120），\n      降低 metric noise，rho 从 0.3875 小幅提升至 0.41。提升有限（+0.023），因为瓶颈不是 sample\n      count 而是 T=0.7 下模型的固有 diversity 上限——多数 instance 在 8 samples 时已充分覆盖\n      主要输出模式，额外 8 个 samples 只补充 tail modes。Oracle headroom 从 0.097→0.122 说明\n      N=16 确实捕获了更多 diverse outputs，但 diminishing returns 明显。logprob rho=0.36（vs\n      N=8 的 0.35）也小幅提升，说明 more samples 的平均 log-prob 更 stable。SJ - logprob 仍为\n      +0.05，与 N=8 一致。Multi-seed robustness std=0.008 说明结果稳定（rho 在 [0.40, 0.42]\n      区间），不依赖于特定随机种子。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: N-scaling comparison on SciERC NER\"\n        columns: [Metric, \"N=8 (pilot_005)\", N=16]\n        rows:\n          - [ρ_SJ (full),      0.3875, 0.41]\n          - [ρ_FK (full),      0.3211, 0.29]\n          - [ρ_logprob (full), 0.35,   0.36]\n          - [SJ − FK,          0.066,  0.12]\n          - [SJ − logprob,     0.04,   0.05]\n          - [Oracle F1,        0.759,  0.789]\n          - [Headroom,         0.097,  0.122]\n          - [Sample F1 mean,   0.624,  0.612]\n          - [\"% F1=0 samples\", 11.2,   11.5]\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-seed robustness (N=16)\"\n        columns: [Seed, ρ_SJ, ρ_FK, ρ_logprob]\n        rows:\n          - [42,  0.412, 0.291, 0.362]\n          - [123, 0.408, 0.288, 0.358]\n          - [456, 0.402, 0.285, 0.355]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: ρ vs N (N=2,4,8,16) for SJ, FK, logprob with bootstrap CI bands, showing diminishing returns\"\n    analysis: >\n      rho=0.41 统计显著高于 pilot_005 的 0.39（bootstrap CI 不重叠），但 effect size 不大。\n      N-scaling 在 N=8 后明显趋平，暗示 T=0.7 下 N=16 接近 saturation。SJ - logprob 从 0.04\n      提升至 0.05——more samples 对 SJ 略有利，因为 structural comparison 在 more diverse\n      samples 下更 informative。论文中应报告为 \"rho improves modestly with N, plateauing\n      around N=16\"。Multi-seed robustness 是 clean positive 结果。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-002: ner_conll2003\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: ner_conll2003\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on CoNLL-2003 (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。\n      4 类粗粒度 entity type (PER/LOC/ORG/MISC)。Cross-dataset generalization 验证。\n      Inference 同时捕获 log-probs。\n    expected_results:\n      finetune_ner_f1: 0.745\n      finetune_train_loss: 0.062\n      greedy_f1: 0.723\n      oracle_f1: 0.818\n      headroom: 0.095\n      rho_sj_full: 0.33\n      rho_fk_full: 0.26\n      rho_logprob_full: 0.32\n      rho_exact_match_full: 0.18\n      rho_entity_voting_full: 0.27\n      sj_minus_fk_full: 0.07\n      sj_minus_logprob_full: 0.01\n      rho_sj_cond: 0.34\n      rho_fk_cond: 0.25\n      n_full: 3453\n      n_cond: 3298\n      p_sj_full: 8.1e-28\n      p_sj_vs_logprob: 0.38\n      sample_f1_mean: 0.682\n      sample_f1_pct_zero: 5.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      CoNLL-2003 的 4 个粗粒度 entity type（PER/LOC/ORG/MISC）产生更 clean 的输出：type\n      confusion 少（PER 和 LOC 混淆概率远低于 SciERC 的 Method/Task 混淆），entity boundary\n      更清晰（新闻文本 vs 科学摘要）。模型 baseline F1 更高（0.72 vs 0.67）说明任务更简单。\n      rho_sj=0.33 低于 SciERC 的 0.41 的原因：higher baseline 意味着更多 instance 处于 ceiling\n      （F1>0.9），ceiling effect 压缩了 rank 差异。SJ>FK +7pp 是 solid result，证明 structural\n      metric 优势跨数据集成立。但 SJ vs logprob 仅 +0.01（p=0.38，不显著！），这是 median 档的\n      核心问题——CoNLL 上 SJ 和 logprob 统计上无差异。原因：CoNLL 任务简单，模型的 logprob 已经\n      很好地校准了输出质量，SJ 的 structural matching 几乎没有额外信息。大 test set（n=3453）\n      提供极高统计功效，使 \"不显著\" 的结论是 definitive 的，不是 power 问题。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: CoNLL-2003 NER all signals\"\n        columns: [Signal, ρ (full), ρ (cond), AUROC, τ]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ,            0.33, 0.34, 0.64, 0.22]\n          - [log-prob,      0.32, 0.33, 0.64, 0.22]\n          - [FK,            0.26, 0.25, 0.60, 0.17]\n          - [entity voting, 0.27, 0.27, 0.61, 0.18]\n          - [exact-match,   0.18, 0.18, 0.57, 0.12]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 5 signals on CoNLL, showing SJ and logprob nearly identical height\"\n    analysis: >\n      CoNLL 复现 SJ>FK（+7pp）但 SJ≈logprob（+1pp, p=0.38）。这是 median 档 \"partial replication\"\n      的具体体现：structural advantage over surface metrics replicates，but advantage over\n      model confidence does not。AUROC 完全打平（0.64 vs 0.64）。论文中可以 confidently 报告\n      \"SJ advantage over FK replicates on CoNLL-2003\" 但必须 acknowledge \"SJ does not\n      significantly outperform log-prob on this dataset\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-003: ner_wnut17\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: ner_wnut17\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on WNUT-17 (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。Social media\n      domain（6 entity types: corporation, creative-work, group, location, person, product）。\n      Cross-dataset generalization，最嘈杂的 domain。Inference 同时捕获 log-probs。\n    expected_results:\n      finetune_ner_f1: 0.52\n      finetune_train_loss: 0.11\n      greedy_f1: 0.495\n      oracle_f1: 0.62\n      headroom: 0.125\n      rho_sj_full: 0.30\n      rho_fk_full: 0.23\n      rho_logprob_full: 0.31\n      rho_exact_match_full: 0.15\n      rho_entity_voting_full: 0.24\n      sj_minus_fk_full: 0.07\n      sj_minus_logprob_full: -0.01\n      rho_sj_cond: 0.32\n      rho_fk_cond: 0.24\n      n_full: 1287\n      n_cond: 1105\n      p_sj_full: 4.2e-12\n      p_sj_vs_logprob: 0.42\n      sample_f1_mean: 0.43\n      sample_f1_pct_zero: 22.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      WNUT-17 的 social media 文本极度嘈杂：非正式拼写、省略、非标准 capitalization 导致 entity\n      boundary 极难准确标注，即使 fine-tune 后 greedy F1 也只有 ~0.50。SJ rho=0.30 在预期范围\n      [0.25, 0.35] 内，低于 SciERC (0.39) 但高于 exact-match (0.15)。关键发现：logprob rho=0.31\n      微弱反超 SJ（Δ=-0.01），虽然统计不显著（p=0.42），但方向上与 SciERC 相反。原因：WNUT 的高\n      noise level 导致模型的 boundary uncertainty 是主要 error source，而非 type confusion 或\n      structural error。在这种场景下，logprob 直接编码 \"模型对序列的整体不确定性\" 比 SJ 的\n      structural matching 更 relevant——因为 structural matching 计算的 entity overlap 在\n      noisy boundary 下也会失真（两个 sample 的 entity boundary 各偏一个 token，SJ 判为 partial\n      match 但实际都是错的）。SJ>FK +7pp 仍然成立，说明 \"structural > surface\" 的 hierarchy 不受\n      domain 影响，但 \"structural > model confidence\" 的 claim 在 noisy domain 不成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: WNUT-17 NER all signals\"\n        columns: [Signal, ρ (full), ρ (cond), AUROC, τ]\n        rows:\n          - [log-prob,      0.31, 0.33, 0.63, 0.21]\n          - [SJ,            0.30, 0.32, 0.62, 0.20]\n          - [FK,            0.23, 0.24, 0.58, 0.15]\n          - [entity voting, 0.24, 0.25, 0.59, 0.16]\n          - [exact-match,   0.15, 0.16, 0.55, 0.10]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-dataset summary — SJ vs logprob ranking\"\n        columns: [Dataset, \"#Types\", Domain, Greedy F1, ρ_SJ, ρ_logprob, \"SJ > logprob?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC,     6, scientific,    0.667, 0.39, 0.35, \"Yes (+0.04, p<0.05)\"]\n          - [CoNLL-2003, 4, news,          0.723, 0.33, 0.32, \"No (+0.01, p=0.38)\"]\n          - [WNUT-17,    6, social media,  0.495, 0.30, 0.31, \"No (−0.01, p=0.42)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-panel bar chart: SJ vs logprob ρ on SciERC / CoNLL / WNUT, showing the inconsistent ranking\"\n      - \"Scatter: noise level proxy (sample F1 variance) vs SJ-logprob delta across 3 datasets\"\n    analysis: >\n      WNUT 是 \"partial replication\" 的关键证据：SJ>FK 复现（3/3 datasets），但 SJ vs logprob\n      排序不一致（SciERC: SJ wins, CoNLL: tie, WNUT: logprob wins）。这迫使论文放弃 \"SJ is\n      the best signal\" 的简洁 claim，转向 \"SJ is the best consistency metric, complementary\n      to logprob\"。WNUT 作为 noisy domain 也提供了 \"when does SJ advantage disappear?\" 的\n      analytical content：当 boundary noise 而非 structural error 是主要 error source 时，\n      logprob 更 relevant。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-004: re_diagnostic_analysis\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: re_diagnostic_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-004\n    description: >\n      基于 pilot_004/005 数据：per-relation-type consistency breakdown，bootstrap CI，\n      conditional threshold sensitivity analysis，ALL 4 confidence signals on RE 的比较。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Per-relation-type SJ rho ---\n      per_type_rho_sj:\n        Used-for:     {n: 98,  rho: 0.32, ci: [0.14, 0.48]}\n        Feature-of:   {n: 62,  rho: 0.28, ci: [0.05, 0.48]}\n        Hyponym-of:   {n: 45,  rho: 0.25, ci: [-0.01, 0.48]}\n        Part-of:      {n: 38,  rho: 0.18, ci: [-0.13, 0.46]}\n        Compare:      {n: 32,  rho: 0.15, ci: [-0.21, 0.47]}\n        Conjunction:  {n: 51,  rho: 0.21, ci: [-0.06, 0.45]}\n        Evaluate-for: {n: 71,  rho: 0.22, ci: [0.00, 0.42]}\n      # --- All signals on RE full set ---\n      re_full_all_signals:\n        SJ:           {rho: 0.234, auroc: 0.59}\n        FK:           {rho: 0.184, auroc: 0.56}\n        logprob:      {rho: 0.260, auroc: 0.60}\n        exact_match:  {rho: 0.120, auroc: 0.54}\n      # --- All signals on RE conditional set ---\n      re_cond_all_signals:\n        SJ:           {rho: 0.372, auroc: 0.65}\n        FK:           {rho: 0.253, auroc: 0.59}\n        logprob:      {rho: 0.350, auroc: 0.64}\n        exact_match:  {rho: 0.150, auroc: 0.56}\n      # --- Threshold sensitivity (vary conditional exclusion criterion) ---\n      threshold_sensitivity:\n        greedy_f1_eq_0:  {n_excluded: 84, n_cond: 313, rho_sj_cond: 0.316}\n        greedy_f1_lt_01: {n_excluded: 112, n_cond: 285, rho_sj_cond: 0.345}\n        greedy_f1_lt_02: {n_excluded: 148, n_cond: 249, rho_sj_cond: 0.372}\n        all_zero_sample: {n_excluded: 96, n_cond: 301, rho_sj_cond: 0.372}\n        logprob_bottom_25pct: {n_excluded: 99, n_cond: 298, rho_sj_cond: 0.358}\n      # --- Bootstrap CI for key comparisons ---\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        re_sj_vs_fk_full_delta: {mean: 0.050, ci: [-0.02, 0.12]}\n        re_sj_vs_logprob_full_delta: {mean: -0.026, ci: [-0.10, 0.05]}\n        re_sj_vs_fk_cond_delta: {mean: 0.119, ci: [0.04, 0.20]}\n    result_rationale: >\n      Per-type 分析显示 high-frequency types (Used-for, Feature-of) rho 较高（0.28-0.32），\n      low-frequency types (Part-of, Compare) rho 极低（0.15-0.18），bootstrap CI 普遍很宽\n      （大多跨越 0），说明 per-type rho 估计极 noisy。所有信号在 RE full set 上均退化（max rho=0.26\n      by logprob），且 logprob 在 RE 上反超 SJ（0.26 vs 0.234），加强了 \"compound error 对所有\n      consistency-based 信号均有破坏性\" 的 narrative，但也说明 logprob 作为 task-agnostic 信号\n      在复杂任务上有微弱优势。Threshold sensitivity 分析显示 conditional rho 随 exclusion\n      threshold 单调增加（0.316→0.372），说明 \"conditional analysis\" 的结论依赖于 threshold\n      选择，但趋势一致——排除更多 low-capability instance 后 SJ 信号更强。Bootstrap CI 显示\n      RE 上 SJ vs FK 的 full-set delta CI 跨越 0（[-0.02, 0.12]），说明 RE 上 SJ>FK 在统计上\n      不 robust；而 conditional set 上 CI 不跨越 0（[0.04, 0.20]），说明 conditional 下 SJ\n      优势可靠。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: All signals on RE full vs conditional (T=0.7)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ (full)\", \"ρ (cond)\", \"Δ full-cond\", AUROC (full)]\n        rows:\n          - [logprob,      0.260, 0.350, +0.090, 0.60]\n          - [SJ,           0.234, 0.372, +0.138, 0.59]\n          - [FK,           0.184, 0.253, +0.069, 0.56]\n          - [exact-match,  0.120, 0.150, +0.030, 0.54]\n      - name: \"Table: Threshold sensitivity for conditional analysis\"\n        columns: [Exclusion criterion, n_excluded, n_cond, ρ_SJ_cond]\n        rows:\n          - [\"greedy F1 = 0\",   84,  313, 0.316]\n          - [\"greedy F1 < 0.1\", 112, 285, 0.345]\n          - [\"greedy F1 < 0.2\", 148, 249, 0.372]\n          - [\"all samples F1=0\", 96, 301, 0.372]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: per-relation-type rho_sj with bootstrap CI error bars, sorted by type frequency\"\n      - \"Line plot: conditional ρ_SJ vs exclusion threshold, showing monotonic increase with CI band\"\n      - \"Heatmap: 4 signals × 7 relation types, showing all signals degrade uniformly\"\n    analysis: >\n      RE diagnostic 的核心 takeaway：(1) ALL signals degrade on RE，不只是 SJ——logprob 在\n      full set 上甚至最强（0.26），(2) conditional analysis 中 SJ recovery 最大（Δ=0.138 vs\n      logprob Δ=0.090），说明 SJ 受 knowledge-gap instances 影响更大，(3) threshold sensitivity\n      显示结论方向 robust 但 magnitude 依赖 threshold 选择。论文中应呈现为 \"task-complexity\n      boundary applies to ALL confidence signals tested\" 的 universal finding，而非 SJ-specific\n      weakness。logprob 在 RE 上反超 SJ 加强了 Claim 2 的 generality。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-005: temperature_sensitivity_analysis\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: temperature_sensitivity_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      T=0.7 (pilot_005) vs T=1.0 (pilot_004) 对比，ALL confidence signals，NER + RE。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- NER ---\n      ner_t10_rho: {sj: 0.3825, fk: 0.259, logprob: 0.34, exact_match: 0.17, entity_voting: 0.28}\n      ner_t07_rho: {sj: 0.3875, fk: 0.3211, logprob: 0.35, exact_match: 0.20, entity_voting: 0.30}\n      ner_delta_rho: {sj: +0.005, fk: +0.062, logprob: +0.01, exact_match: +0.03, entity_voting: +0.02}\n      ner_t10_oracle_f1: 0.776\n      ner_t07_oracle_f1: 0.759\n      ner_t10_headroom: 0.109\n      ner_t07_headroom: 0.097\n      ner_t10_pct_zero: 12.2\n      ner_t07_pct_zero: 11.2\n      # --- RE ---\n      re_t10_rho: {sj: 0.244, fk: 0.278, logprob: 0.27, exact_match: 0.09, entity_voting: 0.19}\n      re_t07_rho: {sj: 0.234, fk: 0.184, logprob: 0.26, exact_match: 0.12, entity_voting: 0.18}\n      re_t10_cond_rho: {sj: 0.316, fk: 0.307, logprob: 0.33}\n      re_t07_cond_rho: {sj: 0.372, fk: 0.253, logprob: 0.35}\n      re_t10_pct_zero: 44.3\n      re_t07_pct_zero: 42.4\n      re_t10_all_zero_filtered: 84\n      re_t07_all_zero_filtered: 96\n    result_rationale: >\n      T=0.7 vs T=1.0 的 tradeoff 是 signal quality vs output diversity。NER 上 SJ 几乎不受\n      T 影响（Δ=+0.005），因为 SJ 的 type-grouped matching 对 minor boundary shifts 鲁棒。但\n      FK 变化大（Δ=+0.062！）：T=0.7 下 samples 更相似，FK 的 exact-match based agreement 提升\n      显著，但 FK rho 并未 correspondingly 提升太多——说明 FK 的 higher absolute value at T=0.7\n      更多反映 reduced diversity 而非 better discrimination。Logprob 的 T-sensitivity 很小\n      （Δ=+0.01），因为 logprob 来自 forward pass 不依赖 sampling temperature。RE 上 pattern\n      更复杂：SJ full rho 在 T=0.7 下反而降低（0.244→0.234），但 conditional rho 显著提升\n      （0.316→0.372），因为 T=0.7 使更多 borderline instance 输出 all-zero（96 vs 84），effectively\n      做了更 aggressive 的 knowledge-gap filtering。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Temperature sensitivity — NER (all signals)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ at T=1.0\", \"ρ at T=0.7\", Δ]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ,            0.383, 0.388, \"+0.005\"]\n          - [FK,            0.259, 0.321, \"+0.062\"]\n          - [log-prob,      0.34,  0.35,  \"+0.01\"]\n          - [exact-match,   0.17,  0.20,  \"+0.03\"]\n          - [entity voting, 0.28,  0.30,  \"+0.02\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Temperature sensitivity — RE (SJ, FK, logprob)\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ full T=1.0\", \"ρ full T=0.7\", \"ρ cond T=1.0\", \"ρ cond T=0.7\"]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ,      0.244, 0.234, 0.316, 0.372]\n          - [FK,      0.278, 0.184, 0.307, 0.253]\n          - [logprob, 0.270, 0.260, 0.330, 0.350]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2-panel: NER (left) all signals ρ at two T; RE (right) full vs cond ρ at two T\"\n      - \"Per-instance scatter: SJ at T=0.7 vs T=1.0, colored by F1 bucket\"\n    analysis: >\n      主要 takeaway：T 选择对 NER ρ 影响很小（SJ delta < 0.01），对 RE conditional ρ 影响较大\n      （SJ delta +0.056）。FK 是 T-sensitivity 最高的 signal，因为它基于 exact agreement 受\n      diversity 影响最大。Logprob 是 T-sensitivity 最低的（理论上应为零，微小差异来自 prompt\n      长度的 minor variation）。论文中作为 1-2 段 analysis 呈现，主要 takeaway：T=0.7 推荐为\n      default（NER 无影响，RE conditional 有提升），但 T 选择不是 critical hyperparameter。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-006: adaptive_compute_demo\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: adaptive_compute_demo\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      Best-of-N selection on ALL NER datasets + RE：SJ vs logprob vs FK vs exact-match\n      vs random vs greedy。覆盖 SciERC (N=16), CoNLL (N=8), WNUT (N=8), RE SciERC (N=8)。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- SciERC NER (N=16) ---\n      scierc_ner:\n        greedy:       0.667\n        random:       0.674\n        exact_match:  0.676\n        fk:           0.680\n        logprob:      0.688\n        sj:           0.692\n        oracle:       0.789\n        sj_over_greedy: 2.5\n        sj_over_logprob: 0.4\n        sj_headroom_capture_pct: 20.5\n        logprob_headroom_capture_pct: 17.2\n      # --- CoNLL NER (N=8) ---\n      conll_ner:\n        greedy:       0.723\n        random:       0.731\n        fk:           0.734\n        logprob:      0.739\n        sj:           0.741\n        oracle:       0.818\n        sj_over_greedy: 1.8\n        sj_over_logprob: 0.2\n      # --- WNUT NER (N=8) ---\n      wnut_ner:\n        greedy:       0.495\n        random:       0.506\n        fk:           0.510\n        logprob:      0.520\n        sj:           0.518\n        oracle:       0.620\n        sj_over_greedy: 2.3\n        sj_over_logprob: -0.2\n        logprob_beats_sj: true\n      # --- RE SciERC (N=8, negative) ---\n      scierc_re:\n        greedy:       0.421\n        random:       0.425\n        fk:           0.426\n        sj:           0.430\n        logprob:      0.434\n        oracle:       0.588\n        sj_over_greedy: 0.9\n        logprob_over_greedy: 1.3\n        logprob_beats_sj: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best-of-N 结果直接反映了 ranking quality（rho）到 practical F1 gain 的转化。SciERC 上\n      SJ gain=+2.5pp（headroom capture 20.5%）是 3 个 NER 数据集中最好的，对应最高的 rho=0.41。\n      但 SJ vs logprob 仅 +0.4pp on SciERC——这意味着 SJ 的 \"额外 structural info\" 只贡献了\n      0.4pp 的实际 F1 改善，reviewer 会问：这 0.4pp 值得 16x 推理成本吗？CoNLL 上 SJ vs logprob\n      仅 +0.2pp（essentially equivalent），WNUT 上 logprob 反超 SJ by 0.2pp。跨数据集模式：\n      SJ 一致优于 FK 和 random（3/3 datasets），但 SJ vs logprob 不一致（1/3 SJ wins marginally,\n      1/3 tie, 1/3 logprob wins marginally）。RE 上所有信号的 gain 都小（<1.5pp），且 logprob\n      最好（+1.3pp），确认 RE 上 consistency-based selection 价值有限。整体 best-of-N gain\n      在 [1.8, 2.5] pp 范围，与 median tier 的 [1.5, 3.5] 一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Best-of-N F1 comparison across datasets\"\n        columns: [Strategy, SciERC NER, CoNLL NER, WNUT NER, SciERC RE]\n        rows:\n          - [Greedy,      0.667, 0.723, 0.495, 0.421]\n          - [Random,      0.674, 0.731, 0.506, 0.425]\n          - [exact-match, 0.676, \"—\",   \"—\",   \"—\"]\n          - [FK,          0.680, 0.734, 0.510, 0.426]\n          - [log-prob,    0.688, 0.739, 0.520, 0.434]\n          - [SJ,          0.692, 0.741, 0.518, 0.430]\n          - [Oracle,      0.789, 0.818, 0.620, 0.588]\n      - name: \"Table: SJ vs logprob F1 gain over greedy\"\n        columns: [Dataset, SJ gain, logprob gain, \"SJ − logprob\", \"SJ better?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [SciERC NER, +2.5pp, +2.1pp, +0.4pp, \"Marginal\"]\n          - [CoNLL NER,  +1.8pp, +1.6pp, +0.2pp, \"No (trivial)\"]\n          - [WNUT NER,   +2.3pp, +2.5pp, \"−0.2pp\", \"No (logprob wins)\"]\n          - [SciERC RE,  +0.9pp, +1.3pp, \"−0.4pp\", \"No (logprob wins)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4-panel bar chart: one panel per dataset, showing F1 by strategy\"\n      - \"Line plot: SJ gain vs logprob gain across datasets, with 45-degree reference line\"\n    analysis: >\n      Adaptive compute demo 是论文最 practical 的结果但也最 underwhelming。SJ 一致 beat FK\n      和 random 但 vs logprob 的优势 inconsistent across datasets。+2.5pp max gain（SciERC）\n      是 technically meaningful 但不 dramatic。WNUT 和 RE 上 logprob 反超 SJ 是 clear evidence\n      that \"SJ is not universally the best selection signal\"。论文中应呈现为 complete table\n      with honest reporting，frame 为 \"SJ provides the most consistent gains across\n      conditions, but log-prob is a strong competitor at zero additional inference cost\"。\n      Ensemble (SJ + logprob) 是 natural follow-up that should be explored.\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-007: ner_multi_model (LLaMA)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: ner_multi_model\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on SciERC (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。\n      Cross-model validation。Inference 同时捕获 log-probs。\n    expected_results:\n      finetune_ner_f1: 0.63\n      finetune_train_loss: 0.092\n      greedy_f1: 0.601\n      oracle_f1: 0.748\n      headroom: 0.147\n      rho_sj_full: 0.33\n      rho_fk_full: 0.26\n      rho_logprob_full: 0.32\n      rho_exact_match_full: 0.16\n      rho_entity_voting_full: 0.25\n      sj_minus_fk_full: 0.07\n      sj_minus_logprob_full: 0.01\n      rho_sj_cond: 0.35\n      rho_fk_cond: 0.25\n      n_full: 529\n      n_cond: 488\n      p_sj_full: 5.6e-15\n      p_sj_vs_logprob: 0.36\n      sample_f1_mean: 0.52\n      sample_f1_pct_zero: 17.1\n      sj_beats_logprob_conclusive: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B 的 SciERC fine-tune 弱于 Qwen3-8B（greedy F1 0.60 vs 0.67），因为\n      LLaMA 的 instruction following 和 structured output 能力略差（Qwen3 在代码/结构化任务上\n      经过更多优化）。rho_sj=0.33 低于 Qwen 的 0.41，但 SJ>FK +7pp 仍显著成立，证明\n      \"structural > surface consistency\" 是 model-agnostic finding。SJ vs logprob 差距 +0.01\n      （p=0.36，不显著），与 Qwen 上的 +0.04 方向一致但更弱。llama_sj_beats_logprob 判定为\n      inconclusive，与 median tier 预期一致。rho 降低的主要原因：LLaMA lower baseline\n      performance 意味着更多 instance 在 \"inability\" 区间（all-zero 17.1% vs 11.2%），\n      这些 instance dilute overall correlation。更大的 headroom（0.147 vs 0.097）说明\n      LLaMA 的 stochastic samples 更 diverse（weaker model = more variable outputs），\n      暗示 SJ-based selection 在 weaker model 上有更大 potential 但当前 correlation 不足\n      以充分 exploit 这个 headroom。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-model comparison on SciERC NER (N=8, T=0.7)\"\n        columns: [Metric, Qwen3-8B, LLaMA-3.1-8B]\n        rows:\n          - [Greedy F1,      0.667, 0.601]\n          - [ρ_SJ (full),    0.39,  0.33]\n          - [ρ_FK (full),    0.32,  0.26]\n          - [ρ_logprob,      0.35,  0.32]\n          - [SJ − FK,        +7pp,  +7pp]\n          - [SJ − logprob,   +4pp,  +1pp]\n          - [Oracle F1,      0.759, 0.748]\n          - [Headroom,       0.097, 0.147]\n          - [\"% F1=0 samples\", 11.2, 17.1]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 5 signals for Qwen vs LLaMA, showing consistent SJ>FK but inconsistent SJ vs logprob\"\n    analysis: >\n      Multi-model 结果 addresses R2 但 mixed message：SJ>FK 是 model-agnostic（两个 model\n      均 +7pp），但 SJ vs logprob 从 Qwen 的 +4pp（significant）降至 LLaMA 的 +1pp\n      （not significant）。这与 median tier 完全一致——SJ 的 structural advantage 在不同\n      model 上不 robust relative to logprob。论文中应诚实报告：\"The SJ advantage over FK\n      is model-agnostic (+7pp on both models), but the advantage over log-prob is\n      model-dependent and not consistently significant.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-008: re_n16_confirmation (P1)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: re_n16_confirmation\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      RE N=16 on SciERC (ft_002_v2, T=0.7) 确认 negative finding with higher statistical power。\n    expected_results:\n      greedy_f1: 0.421\n      oracle_f1_n16: 0.628\n      headroom_n16: 0.207\n      rho_sj_full_n16: 0.25\n      rho_fk_full_n16: 0.20\n      rho_logprob_full_n16: 0.28\n      rho_exact_match_full_n16: 0.13\n      rho_sj_cond_n16: 0.34\n      rho_fk_cond_n16: 0.27\n      rho_logprob_cond_n16: 0.36\n      sj_beats_fk_full: true\n      logprob_beats_sj_full: true\n      logprob_beats_sj_cond: true\n      n_full: 397\n      n_cond: 298\n      all_zero_count: 99\n      pct_zero_samples: 41.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      RE N=16 的 full rho_sj=0.25 vs N=8 的 0.234，提升极小（+0.016），因为 compound error\n      propagation 不因 more samples 缓解——16 个 samples 产生的 span-level SJ 仍无法区分\n      \"不确定 head entity\" vs \"不确定 relation type\" vs \"根本不知道这个 relation\"。Logprob\n      在 RE N=16 上仍然最强（rho=0.28），且 conditional 上也领先（0.36 vs SJ 0.34），这在\n      N=8 时已有迹象但 N=16 下更 definitive。所有信号的 max rho=0.28（logprob），在 median\n      tier 范围 [0.22, 0.32] 内。Oracle headroom 从 0.167→0.207 说明 N=16 确实覆盖了更多\n      RE output modes，但 selection signals 都不够好来 exploit 这个 headroom。Conditional\n      rho 在 N=16 下未有大幅提升（SJ: 0.372→0.34，甚至微降），因为更多 samples 并未帮助\n      区分 boundary cases——反而可能因为 N=16 下 all-zero 的 threshold 更 noisy。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: RE N-scaling — all signals\"\n        columns: [Signal, \"ρ full N=8\", \"ρ full N=16\", \"ρ cond N=8\", \"ρ cond N=16\"]\n        rows:\n          - [logprob,     0.260, 0.280, 0.350, 0.360]\n          - [SJ,          0.234, 0.250, 0.372, 0.340]\n          - [FK,          0.184, 0.200, 0.253, 0.270]\n          - [exact-match, 0.120, 0.130, 0.150, 0.160]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side: NER N=16 vs RE N=16, showing stark contrast in signal quality\"\n    analysis: >\n      RE N=16 confirms Claim 2 with higher statistical power：compound error propagation\n      是 fundamental bottleneck。Logprob 在 RE 上一致最优（full 和 cond 均领先）是重要发现——\n      说明在复杂任务上 model's internal confidence 比 any external consistency metric 更\n      informative。论文中直接写：\"Increasing N from 8 to 16 yields negligible improvement\n      in RE full-set correlation for any signal tested, confirming that the degradation\n      is structural rather than statistical.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-009: capability_stratification (P1)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: capability_stratification\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      按 difficulty strata（greedy F1 buckets + 独立 proxy: sentence length, entity count）\n      分层分析 rho，验证 inverted-U pattern。NER + RE。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- NER strata (greedy F1 buckets, N=16) ---\n      ner_strata:\n        high_f1_gt_08:   {n: 185, rho_sj: 0.14, rho_logprob: 0.12, ci: \"[0.02, 0.26]\"}\n        medium_f1_04_08: {n: 212, rho_sj: 0.45, rho_logprob: 0.38, ci: \"[0.34, 0.55]\"}\n        low_f1_lt_04:    {n: 132, rho_sj: 0.22, rho_logprob: 0.20, ci: \"[0.06, 0.38]\"}\n      # --- RE strata ---\n      re_strata:\n        high_f1_gt_06:   {n: 88,  rho_sj: 0.12, ci: \"[-0.09, 0.32]\"}\n        medium_f1_02_06: {n: 135, rho_sj: 0.31, ci: \"[0.16, 0.45]\"}\n        low_f1_lt_02:    {n: 174, rho_sj: 0.16, ci: \"[0.02, 0.30]\"}\n      # --- Independent proxy: entity count ---\n      ner_entity_count_proxy:\n        low_entities_0_2:   {n: 180, rho_sj: 0.18}\n        medium_entities_3_5: {n: 210, rho_sj: 0.42}\n        high_entities_6plus: {n: 139, rho_sj: 0.28}\n      ner_peak_stratum: \"medium (F1 0.4-0.8)\"\n      re_peak_stratum: \"medium (F1 0.2-0.6)\"\n      boundary_sharpness: \"fuzzy — 10-15pp overlap between strata CIs\"\n      independent_proxy_confirms_inverted_u: true\n      proxy_correlation_with_f1_bucket: 0.58\n    result_rationale: >\n      Inverted-U 形状的根本原因：High stratum（easy instances）的 F1 和 SJ 都高且 variance 低，\n      ceiling effect 压缩 rank 差异（rho_sj=0.14）；Low stratum（hard instances）model 基本\n      fail，SJ 接近 random（rho_sj=0.22）。Medium stratum 同时有足够 variance 和 genuine\n      uncertainty，使 SJ discriminate 最有效（rho_sj=0.45）。在 medium stratum 内 SJ 明显\n      优于 logprob（0.45 vs 0.38），说明 SJ 的 structural info 在 \"model 有能力但不确定\" 的\n      sweet spot 上最有价值。独立 proxy（entity count）也呈现 inverted-U（low: 0.18, medium:\n      0.42, high: 0.28），且与 F1 bucket 的 correlation=0.58——moderate correlation 说明\n      entity count 是 reasonable 但 imperfect 的 independent proxy，inverted-U 不完全是\n      F1 bucket 的 circular artifact。但 boundary 很 fuzzy：strata CI 大幅重叠\n      （bootstrap CI width ~0.08-0.12），无法画出 clean cutoff。RE 的 pattern 更极端——\n      Low stratum 极大（n=174），反映 model capability 的 fundamental limitation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: NER ρ_SJ by difficulty stratum (N=16)\"\n        columns: [Stratum, F1 range, n, ρ_SJ, ρ_logprob, \"95% CI (SJ)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Easy,   \">0.8\",   185, 0.14, 0.12, \"[0.02, 0.26]\"]\n          - [Medium, \"0.4-0.8\", 212, 0.45, 0.38, \"[0.34, 0.55]\"]\n          - [Hard,   \"<0.4\",   132, 0.22, 0.20, \"[0.06, 0.38]\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Independent proxy (entity count) — NER\"\n        columns: [Entity count, n, ρ_SJ]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0-2 (few)\",   180, 0.18]\n          - [\"3-5 (medium)\", 210, 0.42]\n          - [\"6+ (many)\",   139, 0.28]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2-panel inverted-U: ρ_SJ and ρ_logprob vs stratum for NER (left) and RE (right) with CI ribbons\"\n      - \"Scatter: entity count vs greedy F1, colored by SJ rank accuracy, showing the sweet spot visually\"\n    analysis: >\n      Inverted-U 是 strongest analytical finding：解释了 \"为什么 overall ρ 只有 0.41——因为\n      easy 和 hard instances dilute the signal\"。Medium stratum 内 SJ 明显优于 logprob\n      （0.45 vs 0.38，+7pp）说明 SJ 在 sweet spot 上有独特价值——这是论文中最能 justify\n      SJ 的 analysis。Independent proxy 基本 confirms pattern 但不 definitive（r=0.58）。\n      论文中应诚实 frame：\"The inverted-U pattern is consistent across difficulty proxies\n      but boundaries are fuzzy; SJ's advantage over log-prob is concentrated in the\n      medium-difficulty stratum where genuine uncertainty, rather than inability,\n      drives output variation.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-010: selection_curves (P2)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: selection_curves\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      Best-of-N selection curves for N=1,2,4,8,16，all confidence signals，SciERC NER。\n    expected_results:\n      curves_sj:      {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.673, n4: 0.680, n8: 0.686, n16: 0.692}\n      curves_logprob:  {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.672, n4: 0.679, n8: 0.684, n16: 0.688}\n      curves_fk:      {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.670, n4: 0.675, n8: 0.678, n16: 0.680}\n      curves_entity_voting: {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.670, n4: 0.674, n8: 0.677, n16: 0.679}\n      curves_exact_match: {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.669, n4: 0.672, n8: 0.675, n16: 0.676}\n      curves_rand:    {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.669, n4: 0.671, n8: 0.673, n16: 0.674}\n      curves_oracle:  {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.710, n4: 0.745, n8: 0.776, n16: 0.789}\n      sj_logprob_gap_n4: 0.001\n      sj_logprob_gap_n8: 0.002\n      sj_logprob_gap_n16: 0.004\n    result_rationale: >\n      Selection curves 显示所有 practical signals 都远低于 oracle——oracle 在 N=16 时 F1=0.789\n      而 SJ 仅 0.692，gap=0.097pp。SJ 在所有 N 上 consistently outperform 其他信号，但\n      SJ-logprob gap 极小（N=4: 0.1pp, N=8: 0.2pp, N=16: 0.4pp），只有在 N≥8 时才开始\n      visible。Gap 随 N 增大是因为 more samples 给 SJ 的 structural comparison 更多\n      information，而 logprob 的 mean 在 N>4 后趋于 stable。所有 curves 呈 diminishing\n      returns，且 practical signals 的 curve 在 N=8 后几乎 flat——说明当前 signal quality\n      下 N>16 不会有 meaningful gain。Oracle curve 持续上升说明 bottleneck 是 selection\n      accuracy 而非 sample diversity。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: F1 vs N for 7 strategies with CI bands. Oracle rises steeply; others cluster near bottom. Inset zoom on N=8-16 range showing SJ-logprob gap\"\n    analysis: >\n      这张图的 visual impact 取决于 presentation。If zoomed to full range，SJ/FK/logprob/random\n      看起来一样。Inset zoom 是必须的。Key message：\"All signals capture only a fraction of\n      oracle headroom; SJ consistently leads but the margin over logprob is slim.\"\n      建议在论文中作为 Figure 而非 Table 呈现（Dream flagged table-only presentation）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # exp-011: ner_ood_robustness (P2)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: ner_ood_robustness\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      Cross-domain transfer：WNUT fine-tuned model applied to SciERC test set (domain shift\n      from social media → scientific text)，测试 consistency signal 在 OOD setting 下的鲁棒性。\n    expected_results:\n      ood_greedy_f1: 0.32\n      ood_oracle_f1: 0.48\n      ood_headroom: 0.16\n      ood_rho_sj_full: 0.22\n      ood_rho_fk_full: 0.18\n      ood_rho_logprob_full: 0.25\n      ood_rho_exact_match_full: 0.10\n      ood_sj_minus_fk: 0.04\n      ood_sj_minus_logprob: -0.03\n      ood_n: 529\n      ood_pct_zero: 28.4\n      in_domain_comparison:\n        wnut_in_domain_rho_sj: 0.30\n        scierc_ood_rho_sj: 0.22\n        delta: -0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      OOD（WNUT model → SciERC data）产生 severe domain shift：social media 训练的模型对\n      scientific entity types（Method, Task, Material 等）几乎没有 concept，greedy F1 仅 0.32。\n      rho_sj=0.22 比 in-domain WNUT（0.30）降低 0.08，因为 domain shift 导致 systematic error\n      而非 random uncertainty——model 一致地 fail on scientific entities，产生 high SJ（samples\n      一致地错）但 low F1，破坏 SJ-accuracy correlation。Logprob 在 OOD 上仍然最强（0.25），\n      因为 logprob 对 OOD text 的 low confidence 更 faithfully 反映了 model 的 inability。\n      SJ vs logprob = -0.03（logprob wins），与 WNUT in-domain 的 -0.01 方向一致但更 extreme。\n      这进一步收窄了 SJ 的 applicable scope：not only dataset-dependent (WNUT vs SciERC)\n      but also domain-sensitive (in-domain vs OOD)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: In-domain vs OOD consistency signal robustness\"\n        columns: [Setting, Greedy F1, ρ_SJ, ρ_logprob, ρ_FK, \"SJ−logprob\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"WNUT in-domain\",     0.495, 0.30, 0.31, 0.23, \"−0.01\"]\n          - [\"WNUT→SciERC (OOD)\",  0.320, 0.22, 0.25, 0.18, \"−0.03\"]\n          - [\"SciERC in-domain\",   0.667, 0.39, 0.35, 0.32, \"+0.04\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: in-domain vs OOD ρ for all signals, showing uniform degradation\"\n    analysis: >\n      OOD 结果是 negative 但 informative。Uniform degradation across all signals 说明 OOD\n      不是 SJ-specific problem。但 logprob 在 OOD 下 relative advantage 增大——从 in-domain\n      的 -0.01 到 OOD 的 -0.03——说明 model confidence 在 unfamiliar domain 上是更 reliable\n      的 proxy than structural consistency。论文中作为 \"limitations\" 呈现：consistency signals\n      degrade under domain shift, with structural signals (SJ) degrading slightly more\n      than model confidence (logprob)。P2 优先级，时间紧可 cut。\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":755,"newStart":1,"newLines":987,"lines":[" tier: median","-narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 从 \"SJ is a general strong signal\" 收窄为 \"SJ is a consistently","-  better signal than FK,  with effect size varying by dataset characteristics\"。SciERC","-  N=16 小幅提升证明方向对，但跨数据集一强一弱 迫使叙事转向分析 dataset properties 对 SJ 效果的影响（entity density,","-  type granularity, label noise）。 弱数据集（OntoNotes）不丢掉，作为 boundary condition 的 empirical","-  evidence。 Claim 2 保持但加 \"the boundary is fuzzy\" caveat：RE conditional rho 偏低（~0.33），难以宣称","-  clean separation。 Adaptive compute 从 headline 降为 supporting experiment（+1.8pp 不够","-  dramatic）。 Multi-model（exp-007）补救跨数据集弱点，证明 effect 不是 Qwen-specific。 标题软化为 \"When","-  Does Structural Self-Consistency Work? An Empirical Study on IE Test-Time Scaling\"。","-  EMNLP Findings 是 realistic target，Main 偏紧。","+narrative_guidance: >","+  Claim 1 降级为 systematic comparison 贡献：SJ 是最优 consistency metric（显著优于 FK +7-12pp 和","+  exact-match +19pp），但与零成本 log-prob 互补而非替代（SJ - logprob 仅 +0.04 on SciERC，CoNLL 上","+  打平，WNUT 上 logprob 微弱反超）。核心 reframe：首次在结构化预测 TTS 中系统比较四类置信信号，","+  发现 (a) 结构一致性 > 表面一致性，(b) log-prob 是意外强 baseline 表明模型已内化部分一致性信息，","+  (c) SJ+logprob ensemble 可能是最优组合（new highlight）。跨数据集 2/3 复现 SJ>FK，但 SJ vs logprob","+  排序不一致破坏了 \"SJ 是最优信号\" 的简洁叙事。Claim 2 保持：所有信号在 RE 上均退化，logprob 在 RE","+  上甚至略优于 SJ，加强了 task-complexity boundary 的普适性——不是 SJ 特有的问题，而是 consistency-based","+  TTS 的根本局限。多指标结果不一致（ρ 上 SJ 微优但 AUROC 上 logprob 近乎打平）进一步复杂化了 ranking。","+  标题方向：\"Structural vs. Statistical Confidence: A Systematic Comparison of Self-Consistency","+  Signals for Information Extraction Test-Time Scaling\"。目标 EMNLP Main/Findings 均可，","+  Findings 更 realistic。补充 SJ+logprob ensemble 作为 forward-looking contribution。"," ","-  '"," imagined_experiments:","-- name: ner_n16_scierc","-  plan_id: exp-001","-  description: SciERC NER N=16 采样，测试 rho 是否突破 0.40 并提供 N-scaling 数据","-  expected_results:","-    greedy_f1: 0.6671","-    oracle_f1_n16: 0.789","-    headroom_n16: 0.122","-    rho_sj_full_n16: 0.41","-    rho_fk_full_n16: 0.29","-    rho_sj_cond_n16: 0.42","-    rho_fk_cond_n16: 0.28","-    sj_minus_fk_full: 0.12","-    n_full: 529","-    n_cond: 509","-    sample_f1_mean: 0.612","-    sample_f1_pct_zero: 11.5","-    p_sj_full: 2.1e-22","-  result_rationale: 'N=8→N=16 提供更稳定的 SJ 估计（每个 instance 的 pairwise comparison 从 C(8,2)=28","-    增至 C(16,2)=120）， 降低了 metric noise，使 rho 从 0.3825 小幅提升至 0.41。但提升幅度有限（+0.03），因为瓶颈不是","-    sample  count 而是 T=0.7 下模型的固有 diversity 上限——多数 instance 在 8 samples 时已充分覆盖主要输出模式，","-    额外 8 个 samples 只补充了 tail modes。Oracle headroom 从 0.109→0.122 说明 N=16 确实捕获了更多  diverse","-    outputs，但 diminishing returns 明显。这个 rho=0.41 够发 paper 但不 dramatic——reviewer 会  质疑","-    rho=0.41 vs 0.38 的 practical significance。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-012: baseline_logprob (MAKE-OR-BREAK)","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: baseline_logprob","+    plan_id: exp-012","+    description: >","+      对 pilot_004 (T=1.0) 和 pilot_005 (T=0.7) 的所有 stochastic samples 做 vLLM forward pass","+      提取 sequence log-probability，计算 mean log-prob per instance，与 F1 做 Spearman ρ / AUROC / τ。","+      覆盖 NER 和 RE。这是决定论文贡献强度的关键实验。","+    expected_results:","+      # --- NER SciERC (T=0.7, pilot_005 baseline) ---","+      ner_t07_logprob_rho_full: 0.35","+      ner_t07_logprob_rho_cond: 0.36","+      ner_t07_logprob_p_full: 3.2e-17","+      ner_t07_logprob_auroc: 0.66","+      ner_t07_logprob_tau: 0.24","+      ner_t07_logprob_calibration_ece: 0.10","+      ner_t07_sj_minus_logprob_rho: 0.04","+      ner_t07_sj_minus_logprob_auroc: 0.01","+      # --- NER SciERC (T=1.0, pilot_004 baseline) ---","+      ner_t10_logprob_rho_full: 0.34","+      ner_t10_logprob_rho_cond: 0.35","+      ner_t10_sj_minus_logprob_rho: 0.04","+      # --- RE SciERC (T=0.7) ---","+      re_t07_logprob_rho_full: 0.26","+      re_t07_logprob_rho_cond: 0.35","+      re_t07_logprob_auroc: 0.60","+      re_t07_logprob_tau: 0.18","+      re_t07_logprob_beats_sj_full: true","+      re_t07_sj_minus_logprob_full: -0.026","+      # --- RE SciERC (T=1.0) ---","+      re_t10_logprob_rho_full: 0.27","+      re_t10_logprob_rho_cond: 0.33","+      re_t10_logprob_beats_sj_full: true","+    result_rationale: >","+      Log-prob 是强 baseline 的根本原因：sequence log-prob 直接编码了模型对整个输出序列的置信度，","+      而 LLM 在 SFT 后已经部分学会了 \"高置信 = 高质量\"。NER 上 logprob rho=0.35 低于 SJ 的 0.39，","+      差距 +0.04 统计显著（bootstrap CI 不重叠，n=529）但 effect size 小——reviewer 会质疑 0.04 的","+      delta 是否 justify 16x inference cost。AUROC 差距更小（0.67 vs 0.66），说明在 binary","+      classification（good/bad output）任务上两者几乎等价——SJ 的优势主要在 ranking 的 fine-grained","+      层面。RE 上 logprob rho=0.26 反超 SJ 的 0.234，原因：log-prob 不受 compound error propagation","+      影响，它对整个序列统一评分，不依赖于 span-level structural matching；而 SJ 的 set-based","+      comparison 在 RE 上因 span confusion 失去 discriminative power。这是 median 档的核心张力——","+      SJ 在 NER 上微弱领先，在 RE 上反而落后，使 \"SJ 是最优信号\" 的叙事不成立，必须 reframe 为","+      \"SJ 是最优 consistency metric，与 log-prob 互补\"。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: Log-prob vs SJ on SciERC (T=0.7)\"","+        columns: [Signal, NER ρ, NER AUROC, NER τ, RE ρ (full), RE ρ (cond)]","+        rows:","+          - [SJ,      0.39,  0.67, 0.26, 0.234, 0.372]","+          - [FK,      0.32,  0.62, 0.21, 0.184, 0.253]","+          - [log-prob, 0.35, 0.66, 0.24, 0.260, 0.350]","+      - name: \"Table: SJ minus log-prob delta by task\"","+        columns: [Task, Δρ, Δ AUROC, Δτ, \"SJ wins?\"]","+        rows:","+          - [NER (full),  +0.04,  +0.01, +0.02, \"Yes (weak)\"]","+          - [NER (cond),  +0.03,  +0.01, +0.02, \"Yes (weak)\"]","+          - [RE (full),  -0.026,  -0.02, -0.02, \"No\"]","+          - [RE (cond),  +0.022,  +0.01, +0.01, \"Marginal\"]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"Scatter plot: log-prob vs F1 for NER instances (n=529), colored by SJ quartile, showing partial overlap between high-logprob and high-SJ instances\"","+      - \"2-panel correlation heatmap: NER (left) and RE (right), showing pairwise ρ between all signals (SJ, FK, logprob, F1)\"","+    analysis: >","+      这是论文命运的分水岭。SJ 在 NER 上 Δρ=+0.04 的优势 real 但 modest，reviewer 会计算","+      16x inference cost / 0.04 rho gain = 每单位 rho 提升成本极高。AUROC 近乎打平（0.67 vs 0.66）","+      是更大的问题——它意味着 SJ 在 \"能否区分好坏输出\" 这个 practical 问题上几乎不比 log-prob 好。","+      RE 上 logprob 反超 SJ 是 unexpected 但 interpretable：logprob 是 task-agnostic 的全局信号，","+      不受 structured matching 在复杂任务上的退化影响。论文 reframe 策略：(1) SJ 是 best consistency","+      metric（vs FK, exact-match），(2) logprob 是 surprisingly strong baseline 揭示模型已内化","+      consistency 信息，(3) 两类信号捕获不同维度 → ensemble 是 natural next step。"," ","-    '","-  tables:","-  - name: 'Table: N-scaling comparison on SciERC NER'","-    columns:","-    - Metric","-    - N=8 (pilot_004)","-    - N=16","-    rows:","-    - - rho_sj (full)","-      - 0.3825","-      - 0.41","-    - - rho_fk (full)","-      - 0.259","-      - 0.29","-    - - SJ - FK delta","-      - 0.1235","-      - 0.12","-    - - Oracle F1","-      - 0.7756","-      - 0.789","-    - - Headroom","-      - 0.1085","-      - 0.122","-    - - Sample F1 mean","-      - 0.6084","-      - 0.612","-    - - '% F1=0 samples'","-      - 12.19","-      - 11.5","-  figures_description:","-  - 'Line plot: rho_sj and rho_fk vs N (N=2,4,8,16), showing diminishing returns curve","-    with error bars from bootstrap'","-  analysis: 'rho=0.41 统计显著高于 0.38（bootstrap CI 不重叠），但 effect size 不大。N-scaling curve  在","-    N=8 后明显趋平，暗示 T=0.7 下 N=16 接近 saturation。这限制了 \"more samples = better\"  的叙事。论文中应报告为","-    \"rho improves modestly with N, plateauing around N=16\"，而非  oversell 这个增量。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-013: baseline_exact_match","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: baseline_exact_match","+    plan_id: exp-013","+    description: >","+      对 pilot_004/005 的 N=8 stochastic samples 计算 exact-match voting rate（有多少 sample pairs","+      产生完全相同的 entity/relation set），用 voting rate 与 F1 计算 ρ/AUROC/τ。","+    expected_results:","+      # --- NER SciERC (T=0.7, pilot_005) ---","+      ner_t07_exact_match_rate_mean: 0.14","+      ner_t07_exact_match_rate_std: 0.22","+      ner_t07_exact_match_rho_full: 0.20","+      ner_t07_exact_match_rho_cond: 0.21","+      ner_t07_exact_match_p_full: 3.8e-06","+      ner_t07_exact_match_auroc: 0.58","+      ner_t07_exact_match_tau: 0.14","+      ner_t07_pct_zero_exact_match: 52.4","+      # --- NER SciERC (T=1.0, pilot_004) ---","+      ner_t10_exact_match_rate_mean: 0.09","+      ner_t10_exact_match_rho_full: 0.17","+      ner_t10_pct_zero_exact_match: 61.3","+      # --- RE SciERC (T=0.7) ---","+      re_t07_exact_match_rate_mean: 0.04","+      re_t07_exact_match_rho_full: 0.12","+      re_t07_exact_match_rho_cond: 0.14","+      re_t07_exact_match_auroc: 0.54","+      re_t07_pct_zero_exact_match: 78.6","+      # --- RE SciERC (T=1.0) ---","+      re_t10_exact_match_rate_mean: 0.02","+      re_t10_exact_match_rho_full: 0.09","+      re_t10_pct_zero_exact_match: 84.1","+    result_rationale: >","+      Exact-match 是 Wang et al. (2023) self-consistency 的直接类比，但在 structured output 上","+      表现最差，原因清晰：IE 输出包含多个实体/关系，每个的 boundary、type、text 都必须完全一致才算","+      exact match。在 N=8 T=0.7 下 NER 平均只有 14% 的 sample pairs 完全匹配（52% instance 的","+      exact match rate = 0），因为即使模型 \"大致正确\"，boundary 差一个 token 就判为不匹配。这导致","+      exact-match voting rate 是一个极度 sparse 的信号，大量 instance 被挤在 rate=0 处无法区分。","+      rho=0.20 显著低于 SJ（0.39）和 logprob（0.35），清楚展示了 \"surface exact match 不适合","+      structured prediction\" 的论点。RE 更极端——78.6% instance 的 exact match rate = 0，","+      因为 relation triplet 完全匹配的概率极低。这是 paper 中最清晰的 negative baseline，支撑","+      \"need structured comparison\" 的动机。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: Exact-match voting statistics on SciERC\"","+        columns: [Task, T, mean rate, \"% rate=0\", ρ (full), AUROC]","+        rows:","+          - [NER, 0.7, 0.14, 52.4%, 0.20, 0.58]","+          - [NER, 1.0, 0.09, 61.3%, 0.17, 0.55]","+          - [RE,  0.7, 0.04, 78.6%, 0.12, 0.54]","+          - [RE,  1.0, 0.02, 84.1%, 0.09, 0.52]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"Histogram: distribution of exact-match rate across instances (NER), showing heavy spike at 0 and thin tail\"","+    analysis: >","+      Exact-match 是最弱 baseline，这对论文叙事有利——它清晰证明了 \"原始 self-consistency 直接应用于","+      structured output 效果差，需要 set-aware metric\"。SJ vs exact-match 的 Δρ=+0.19 是论文中","+      最大的 effect size，比 SJ vs logprob 的 +0.04 convincing 得多。建议在论文中用 exact-match","+      作为 \"naive baseline\" 来 motivate SJ 的 design。"," ","-    '","-- name: ner_conll2003","-  plan_id: exp-002","-  description: CoNLL-2003 NER 跨数据集验证（fine-tune + N=8 pilot）","-  expected_results:","-    finetune_ner_f1: 0.745","-    finetune_train_loss: 0.065","-    greedy_f1: 0.723","-    oracle_f1: 0.821","-    headroom: 0.098","-    rho_sj_full: 0.37","-    rho_fk_full: 0.3","-    sj_minus_fk_full: 0.07","-    rho_sj_cond: 0.38","-    rho_fk_cond: 0.29","-    n_full: 3250","-    n_cond: 3105","-    p_sj_full: 1.8e-30","-    sample_f1_mean: 0.68","-    sample_f1_pct_zero: 6.2","-  result_rationale: 'CoNLL-2003 的 4 个粗粒度 entity type（PER/LOC/ORG/MISC）产生更 clean 的","-    SJ 信号： type confusion 少（PER 和 LOC 混淆概率远低于 SciERC 的 Method/Task 混淆），entity boundary  更清晰（新闻文本","-    vs 科学摘要）。模型 baseline F1 更高（0.72 vs 0.67）说明任务更简单， 但 rho 反而只有 0.37（低于 SciERC 的 0.41），因为","-    higher baseline 意味着更多 instance  处于 ceiling（F1>0.9），这些 instance 的 SJ 和 F1 都高但贡献不到","-    rank correlation。 SJ>FK +7pp 是 solid result，证明 structural metric 优势跨数据集成立。这是 \"好\"","-    的  跨数据集结果。N=3250（CoNLL test set 更大）提供极高统计功效。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-014: baseline_entity_voting","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: baseline_entity_voting","+    plan_id: exp-014","+    description: >","+      Entity-level majority voting：对 N=8 samples 中每个 entity mention 统计出现频次，以 threshold","+      ≥ N/2 = 4 构建 consensus entity set，以 consensus 置信度（mean frequency/N）作为 instance-level","+      signal 与 F1 做 correlation。同时比较 voting consensus F1 vs SJ-selected sample F1。","+    expected_results:","+      # --- NER SciERC (T=0.7, pilot_005) ---","+      ner_t07_entity_voting_rho_full: 0.30","+      ner_t07_entity_voting_rho_cond: 0.31","+      ner_t07_entity_voting_p_full: 1.4e-12","+      ner_t07_entity_voting_auroc: 0.63","+      ner_t07_entity_voting_tau: 0.20","+      ner_t07_voting_consensus_f1: 0.681","+      ner_t07_sj_selected_f1: 0.685","+      ner_t07_greedy_f1: 0.662","+      ner_t07_voting_vs_greedy_gain: 1.9","+      ner_t07_sj_vs_voting_f1_gain: 0.4","+      # --- NER SciERC (T=1.0, pilot_004) ---","+      ner_t10_entity_voting_rho_full: 0.28","+      ner_t10_voting_consensus_f1: 0.676","+      # --- RE SciERC (T=0.7) ---","+      re_t07_entity_voting_rho_full: 0.18","+      re_t07_entity_voting_auroc: 0.56","+      re_t07_relation_voting_consensus_f1: 0.405","+    result_rationale: >","+      Entity voting 是 exact-match 的 \"partial credit\" 版本——不要求整个 sample 完全匹配，而是","+      逐 entity 统计 agreement。rho=0.30 居于 SJ（0.39）和 exact-match（0.20）之间，因为它捕获了","+      entity-level 的 partial consistency 但丢失了 entity 间的 structural relationship（SJ 的","+      type-grouped matching 保留了 type-aware 比较）。Voting consensus F1=0.681 接近 SJ selection","+      F1=0.685（差仅 0.4pp），说明 entity voting 作为一种 ensemble/aggregation 策略效果不差——但","+      voting 构建的是 \"合成\" 输出（从多个 sample 中拼接 entities），而 SJ selection 选择的是","+      单个 \"最好的\" sample，两种策略的比较维度不同。RE 上 entity voting rho=0.18 远低于 NER 的","+      0.30，因为 relation voting 需要 head+tail+type 三重匹配，且 relation boundary 远比 entity","+      模糊。论文中 entity voting 是 \"intermediate complexity\" baseline：比 exact-match 强，","+      比 SJ 弱，提供了 \"metric complexity vs signal quality\" 的 gradient。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: Entity voting vs other signals (NER SciERC T=0.7)\"","+        columns: [Signal, ρ (full), AUROC, τ]","+        rows:","+          - [SJ,             0.39, 0.67, 0.26]","+          - [log-prob,       0.35, 0.66, 0.24]","+          - [entity voting,  0.30, 0.63, 0.20]","+          - [FK,             0.32, 0.62, 0.21]","+          - [exact-match,    0.20, 0.58, 0.14]","+      - name: \"Table: Voting consensus F1 vs selection F1\"","+        columns: [Strategy, F1, Gain vs Greedy]","+        rows:","+          - [Greedy (T=0),        0.662, \"—\"]","+          - [Voting consensus,    0.681, +1.9pp]","+          - [SJ selection,        0.685, +2.3pp]","+          - [Oracle,              0.759, +9.7pp]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"Bar chart: 5 signals ranked by ρ (SJ > logprob > FK > entity-voting > exact-match), with CI bars\"","+      - \"Scatter: entity voting confidence vs SJ score per instance, showing moderate correlation (r~0.6)\"","+    analysis: >","+      Entity voting rho=0.30 产生一个有趣的排序：SJ > logprob > FK ≈ entity-voting > exact-match。","+      FK 和 entity voting 在 rho 上接近（0.32 vs 0.30），但 entity voting 的 consensus F1 更高——","+      这说明 voting 作为 aggregation 策略有效，但作为 confidence signal 不如 FK。论文中应区分","+      \"signal for ranking\" 和 \"strategy for aggregation\" 两个维度。Voting consensus F1=0.681","+      接近 SJ selection F1=0.685 是一个微妙的发现——暗示 \"选最好的 sample\" 和 \"从多个 sample 中","+      合成\" 可能在 NER 上差不多，值得后续探索。"," ","-    '","-  tables:","-  - name: 'Table: CoNLL-2003 NER consistency metrics'","-    columns:","-    - Metric","-    - SJ","-    - FK","-    rows:","-    - - rho (full set)","-      - 0.37","-      - 0.3","-    - - rho (conditional)","-      - 0.38","-      - 0.29","-    - - p-value (full)","-      - '1.8e-30'","-      - '4.2e-18'","-  figures_description:","-  - 'Bar chart: rho_sj vs rho_fk across SciERC, CoNLL-2003, and OntoNotes, showing","-    cross-dataset pattern'","-  analysis: 'CoNLL 复现了 SJ>FK 的核心发现，delta=7pp 与 SciERC 的 12pp 一致方向。rho 绝对值较低  可归因于","-    CoNLL 的 lower variance（task 更简单，less room for the metric to discriminate）。 论文中可以","-    confidently 报告 \"SJ advantage replicates on CoNLL-2003\"。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-015: evaluation_metrics_expansion","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: evaluation_metrics_expansion","+    plan_id: exp-015","+    description: >","+      对所有信号（SJ, FK, logprob, exact-match, entity-voting）在所有数据集上计算完整 metric suite：","+      Spearman ρ, AUROC, Kendall τ, calibration ECE, leave-one-out SJ。综合 dashboard。","+    expected_results:","+      # --- Multi-metric dashboard: SciERC NER (T=0.7) ---","+      scierc_ner_dashboard:","+        SJ:            {rho: 0.39, auroc: 0.67, tau: 0.26, ece: 0.12}","+        FK:            {rho: 0.32, auroc: 0.62, tau: 0.21, ece: 0.15}","+        logprob:       {rho: 0.35, auroc: 0.66, tau: 0.24, ece: 0.10}","+        exact_match:   {rho: 0.20, auroc: 0.58, tau: 0.14, ece: 0.19}","+        entity_voting: {rho: 0.30, auroc: 0.63, tau: 0.20, ece: 0.14}","+        SJ_loo:        {rho: 0.37, auroc: 0.65, tau: 0.25, ece: 0.13}","+      # --- Multi-metric dashboard: SciERC RE (T=0.7) ---","+      scierc_re_dashboard:","+        SJ:            {rho: 0.234, auroc: 0.59, tau: 0.16, ece: 0.21}","+        FK:            {rho: 0.184, auroc: 0.56, tau: 0.13, ece: 0.23}","+        logprob:       {rho: 0.260, auroc: 0.60, tau: 0.18, ece: 0.18}","+        exact_match:   {rho: 0.120, auroc: 0.54, tau: 0.08, ece: 0.26}","+        entity_voting: {rho: 0.180, auroc: 0.56, tau: 0.12, ece: 0.22}","+      # --- Cross-dataset NER ρ summary ---","+      cross_dataset_rho:","+        SciERC:   {SJ: 0.39, FK: 0.32, logprob: 0.35, exact_match: 0.20, entity_voting: 0.30}","+        CoNLL:    {SJ: 0.33, FK: 0.26, logprob: 0.32, exact_match: 0.18, entity_voting: 0.27}","+        WNUT:     {SJ: 0.30, FK: 0.23, logprob: 0.31, exact_match: 0.15, entity_voting: 0.24}","+      # --- Cross-dataset NER AUROC summary ---","+      cross_dataset_auroc:","+        SciERC:   {SJ: 0.67, logprob: 0.66}","+        CoNLL:    {SJ: 0.64, logprob: 0.64}","+        WNUT:     {SJ: 0.62, logprob: 0.63}","+      # --- Leave-one-out SJ robustness ---","+      sj_loo_delta_rho: -0.02","+      sj_loo_delta_auroc: -0.02","+      sj_loo_conclusion: \"modest drop, no circularity concern\"","+      # --- Key cross-metric finding ---","+      metric_disagreement: >","+        ρ consistently favors SJ (3/3 datasets), but AUROC shows SJ ≈ logprob","+        on SciERC/CoNLL and logprob > SJ on WNUT. Calibration (ECE) favors","+        logprob on all datasets. This metric-dependent ranking complicates the","+        \"SJ is best\" narrative.","+    result_rationale: >","+      多指标扩展揭示了 median 档的核心复杂性：不同评估标准给出不同排序。ρ 衡量 fine-grained ranking","+      能力，SJ 一致胜出（因为 SJ 对 medium-difficulty instance 的 structural nuance 更敏感）。","+      AUROC 衡量 binary classification 能力（区分 good vs bad output），logprob 几乎追平 SJ","+      （因为 logprob 对 \"输出总体质量\" 的粗粒度判断已经足够好）。ECE 衡量校准性，logprob 天然更好","+      （因为 log-prob 本身就是 probability，而 SJ/FK 是距离度量需要额外校准）。Leave-one-out SJ","+      仅掉 0.02 rho，说明 evaluation circularity 不是主要 concern（SJ 用 all N samples 计算 vs","+      N-1 samples 差异很小）。这个多维度结果迫使论文采用 nuanced framing：\"SJ 在 ranking 上最优，","+      但在 practical 选择场景下与 logprob 差距不大\"。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: Multi-metric comparison — NER SciERC (T=0.7)\"","+        columns: [Signal, ρ, AUROC, τ, ECE, Rank(ρ), Rank(AUROC)]","+        rows:","+          - [SJ,            0.39, 0.67, 0.26, 0.12, 1, 1]","+          - [log-prob,      0.35, 0.66, 0.24, 0.10, 2, 2]","+          - [FK,            0.32, 0.62, 0.21, 0.15, 3, 4]","+          - [entity voting, 0.30, 0.63, 0.20, 0.14, 4, 3]","+          - [exact-match,   0.20, 0.58, 0.14, 0.19, 5, 5]","+          - [SJ (LOO),      0.37, 0.65, 0.25, 0.13, \"—\", \"—\"]","+      - name: \"Table: Cross-dataset NER ρ — SJ vs logprob\"","+        columns: [Dataset, ρ_SJ, ρ_logprob, Δ, \"Δ significant?\"]","+        rows:","+          - [SciERC,    0.39, 0.35, +0.04, \"Yes (p<0.05)\"]","+          - [CoNLL-2003, 0.33, 0.32, +0.01, \"No (p=0.38)\"]","+          - [WNUT-17,   0.30, 0.31, -0.01, \"No (p=0.42)\"]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"Radar chart: 5 signals × 4 metrics (ρ, AUROC, τ, 1-ECE), showing SJ and logprob occupy similar profile space\"","+      - \"Calibration reliability diagram: SJ vs logprob, showing logprob has better calibration (closer to diagonal)\"","+      - \"Heatmap: dataset × signal × metric, showing the inconsistent ranking pattern across datasets and metrics\"","+    analysis: >","+      这是论文最重要的综合分析表。核心发现：(1) SJ 在 ρ 上一致第一，但优势在不同数据集上从 +4pp","+      缩小到 -1pp；(2) AUROC 上 SJ 和 logprob 几乎无差（WNUT 上 logprob 反超）；(3) 校准性上","+      logprob 天然更好。论文不能声称 SJ 是全面最优——必须诚实呈现 \"which metric you choose","+      determines which signal wins\"。建议的 framing：SJ 作为 consistency metric 在 ranking 上","+      最优，但 logprob 在校准和 cost-effectiveness 上更优；两者互补而非替代。Leave-one-out 结果","+      解决 circularity concern，是 clean positive 结果。"," ","-    '","-- name: ner_ontonotes","-  plan_id: exp-003","-  description: OntoNotes 5.0 NER 跨数据集验证（fine-tune + N=8 pilot）","-  expected_results:","-    finetune_ner_f1: 0.618","-    finetune_train_loss: 0.092","-    greedy_f1: 0.583","-    oracle_f1: 0.685","-    headroom: 0.102","-    rho_sj_full: 0.29","-    rho_fk_full: 0.26","-    sj_minus_fk_full: 0.03","-    rho_sj_cond: 0.31","-    rho_fk_cond: 0.27","-    n_full: 8262","-    n_cond: 7480","-    p_sj_full: 3.1e-15","-    sample_f1_mean: 0.51","-    sample_f1_pct_zero: 15.8","-  result_rationale: 'OntoNotes 的 18 个 fine-grained entity types 严重削弱 SJ 信号。核心问题：type","-    confusion  inflate SJ without reflecting accuracy。例如模型在不同 samples 中将同一 span 标为","-    GPE/LOC/FAC， SJ 看到 span overlap 给出中等分数，但 strict F1 全部判错。这种 \"structurally similar","-    but  semantically wrong\" 的 pattern 在 SciERC（6 types）和 CoNLL（4 types）中影响小，在 OntoNotes","-    中  成为主要 noise source。rho=0.29 统计显著（p<1e-14，得益于大 test set），但 SJ>FK 仅 3pp， reviewer","-    会质疑 practical significance。这是叙事中的 \"弱\" 数据集，但正好提供了分析  \"what dataset properties affect","-    SJ effectiveness\" 的素材。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-001: ner_n16_scierc","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: ner_n16_scierc","+    plan_id: exp-001","+    description: >","+      SciERC NER N=16 采样（ft_002_v2, T=0.7, seeds [42,123,456]），测试 rho 是否","+      突破 0.40 并提供 N-scaling 数据。Inference 同时输出 log-probs 供 exp-012 使用。","+    expected_results:","+      greedy_f1: 0.667","+      oracle_f1_n16: 0.789","+      headroom_n16: 0.122","+      rho_sj_full_n16: 0.41","+      rho_fk_full_n16: 0.29","+      rho_logprob_full_n16: 0.36","+      rho_sj_cond_n16: 0.42","+      rho_fk_cond_n16: 0.28","+      sj_minus_fk_full: 0.12","+      sj_minus_logprob_full: 0.05","+      n_full: 529","+      n_cond: 509","+      sample_f1_mean: 0.612","+      sample_f1_pct_zero: 11.5","+      p_sj_full: 2.1e-22","+      seed_robustness_rho_sj_std: 0.008","+      seed_robustness_rho_sj_range: [0.402, 0.418]","+    result_rationale: >","+      N=8→N=16 提供更稳定的 SJ 估计（pairwise comparison 从 C(8,2)=28 增至 C(16,2)=120），","+      降低 metric noise，rho 从 0.3875 小幅提升至 0.41。提升有限（+0.023），因为瓶颈不是 sample","+      count 而是 T=0.7 下模型的固有 diversity 上限——多数 instance 在 8 samples 时已充分覆盖","+      主要输出模式，额外 8 个 samples 只补充 tail modes。Oracle headroom 从 0.097→0.122 说明","+      N=16 确实捕获了更多 diverse outputs，但 diminishing returns 明显。logprob rho=0.36（vs","+      N=8 的 0.35）也小幅提升，说明 more samples 的平均 log-prob 更 stable。SJ - logprob 仍为","+      +0.05，与 N=8 一致。Multi-seed robustness std=0.008 说明结果稳定（rho 在 [0.40, 0.42]","+      区间），不依赖于特定随机种子。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: N-scaling comparison on SciERC NER\"","+        columns: [Metric, \"N=8 (pilot_005)\", N=16]","+        rows:","+          - [ρ_SJ (full),      0.3875, 0.41]","+          - [ρ_FK (full),      0.3211, 0.29]","+          - [ρ_logprob (full), 0.35,   0.36]","+          - [SJ − FK,          0.066,  0.12]","+          - [SJ − logprob,     0.04,   0.05]","+          - [Oracle F1,        0.759,  0.789]","+          - [Headroom,         0.097,  0.122]","+          - [Sample F1 mean,   0.624,  0.612]","+          - [\"% F1=0 samples\", 11.2,   11.5]","+      - name: \"Table: Multi-seed robustness (N=16)\"","+        columns: [Seed, ρ_SJ, ρ_FK, ρ_logprob]","+        rows:","+          - [42,  0.412, 0.291, 0.362]","+          - [123, 0.408, 0.288, 0.358]","+          - [456, 0.402, 0.285, 0.355]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"Line plot: ρ vs N (N=2,4,8,16) for SJ, FK, logprob with bootstrap CI bands, showing diminishing returns\"","+    analysis: >","+      rho=0.41 统计显著高于 pilot_005 的 0.39（bootstrap CI 不重叠），但 effect size 不大。","+      N-scaling 在 N=8 后明显趋平，暗示 T=0.7 下 N=16 接近 saturation。SJ - logprob 从 0.04","+      提升至 0.05——more samples 对 SJ 略有利，因为 structural comparison 在 more diverse","+      samples 下更 informative。论文中应报告为 \"rho improves modestly with N, plateauing","+      around N=16\"。Multi-seed robustness 是 clean positive 结果。"," ","-    '","-  tables:","-  - name: 'Table: OntoNotes NER consistency metrics'","-    columns:","-    - Metric","-    - SJ","-    - FK","-    rows:","-    - - rho (full set)","-      - 0.29","-      - 0.26","-    - - rho (conditional)","-      - 0.31","-      - 0.27","-    - - p-value (full)","-      - '3.1e-15'","-      - '5.7e-12'","-  - name: 'Table: Cross-dataset comparison summary'","-    columns:","-    - Dataset","-    - '#Types'","-    - Greedy F1","-    - rho_sj","-    - SJ-FK delta","-    rows:","-    - - SciERC","-      - 6","-      - 0.667","-      - 0.41","-      - +12pp","-    - - CoNLL-2003","-      - 4","-      - 0.723","-      - 0.37","-      - +7pp","-    - - OntoNotes","-      - 18","-      - 0.583","-      - 0.29","-      - +3pp","-  figures_description:","-  - 'Scatter plot: #entity_types vs rho_sj across three datasets, suggesting type","-    granularity as moderating factor'","-  - 'Scatter plot: entity density (entities/sentence) vs rho_sj, exploring alternative","-    explanations'","-  analysis: 'OntoNotes 是必须正面面对的弱结果。叙事策略：将三个数据集排列为 type granularity 的 gradient  （4→6→18","-    types），分析 rho 随 type 数增加的下降趋势。论点：SJ 的优势在于捕捉 structural  overlap，但当 type confusion","-    成为主要 error source 时，structural overlap 不再是 accuracy  的 good proxy。这为 SJ 的适用条件提供了","-    principled 解释，将弱结果转化为 analytical contribution。 但 reviewer 仍可能指出只有 3 个数据点的 trend","-    不够 convincing。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-002: ner_conll2003","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: ner_conll2003","+    plan_id: exp-002","+    description: >","+      Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on CoNLL-2003 (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。","+      4 类粗粒度 entity type (PER/LOC/ORG/MISC)。Cross-dataset generalization 验证。","+      Inference 同时捕获 log-probs。","+    expected_results:","+      finetune_ner_f1: 0.745","+      finetune_train_loss: 0.062","+      greedy_f1: 0.723","+      oracle_f1: 0.818","+      headroom: 0.095","+      rho_sj_full: 0.33","+      rho_fk_full: 0.26","+      rho_logprob_full: 0.32","+      rho_exact_match_full: 0.18","+      rho_entity_voting_full: 0.27","+      sj_minus_fk_full: 0.07","+      sj_minus_logprob_full: 0.01","+      rho_sj_cond: 0.34","+      rho_fk_cond: 0.25","+      n_full: 3453","+      n_cond: 3298","+      p_sj_full: 8.1e-28","+      p_sj_vs_logprob: 0.38","+      sample_f1_mean: 0.682","+      sample_f1_pct_zero: 5.8","+    result_rationale: >","+      CoNLL-2003 的 4 个粗粒度 entity type（PER/LOC/ORG/MISC）产生更 clean 的输出：type","+      confusion 少（PER 和 LOC 混淆概率远低于 SciERC 的 Method/Task 混淆），entity boundary","+      更清晰（新闻文本 vs 科学摘要）。模型 baseline F1 更高（0.72 vs 0.67）说明任务更简单。","+      rho_sj=0.33 低于 SciERC 的 0.41 的原因：higher baseline 意味着更多 instance 处于 ceiling","+      （F1>0.9），ceiling effect 压缩了 rank 差异。SJ>FK +7pp 是 solid result，证明 structural","+      metric 优势跨数据集成立。但 SJ vs logprob 仅 +0.01（p=0.38，不显著！），这是 median 档的","+      核心问题——CoNLL 上 SJ 和 logprob 统计上无差异。原因：CoNLL 任务简单，模型的 logprob 已经","+      很好地校准了输出质量，SJ 的 structural matching 几乎没有额外信息。大 test set（n=3453）","+      提供极高统计功效，使 \"不显著\" 的结论是 definitive 的，不是 power 问题。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: CoNLL-2003 NER all signals\"","+        columns: [Signal, ρ (full), ρ (cond), AUROC, τ]","+        rows:","+          - [SJ,            0.33, 0.34, 0.64, 0.22]","+          - [log-prob,      0.32, 0.33, 0.64, 0.22]","+          - [FK,            0.26, 0.25, 0.60, 0.17]","+          - [entity voting, 0.27, 0.27, 0.61, 0.18]","+          - [exact-match,   0.18, 0.18, 0.57, 0.12]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"Grouped bar chart: 5 signals on CoNLL, showing SJ and logprob nearly identical height\"","+    analysis: >","+      CoNLL 复现 SJ>FK（+7pp）但 SJ≈logprob（+1pp, p=0.38）。这是 median 档 \"partial replication\"","+      的具体体现：structural advantage over surface metrics replicates，but advantage over","+      model confidence does not。AUROC 完全打平（0.64 vs 0.64）。论文中可以 confidently 报告","+      \"SJ advantage over FK replicates on CoNLL-2003\" 但必须 acknowledge \"SJ does not","+      significantly outperform log-prob on this dataset\"。"," ","-    '","-- name: re_diagnostic_analysis","-  plan_id: exp-004","-  description: 基于 pilot_004/005 数据的 per-relation-type consistency 分析","-  expected_results:","-    per_type_rho_sj:","-      Used-for: 0.32","-      Feature-of: 0.28","-      Hyponym-of: 0.25","-      Part-of: 0.18","-      Compare: 0.15","-      Conjunction: 0.21","-      Evaluate-for: 0.22","-    per_type_n:","-      Used-for: 98","-      Feature-of: 62","-      Hyponym-of: 45","-      Part-of: 38","-      Compare: 32","-      Conjunction: 51","-      Evaluate-for: 71","-    max_type_rho: 0.32","-    min_type_rho: 0.15","-    correlation_type_freq_vs_rho: 0.61","-    correlation_type_arity_vs_rho: -0.34","-  result_rationale: 'High-frequency types（Used-for, Feature-of）有更多 training examples","-    和 evaluation instances， model 对这些 type 的输出更稳定，SJ 估计也更 reliable，因此 rho 更高（0.28-0.32）。","-    Low-frequency types（Part-of, Compare）rho 极低（0.15-0.18），原因双重：(1) 模型对这些 type  本身","-    capability 差，大量 all-zero outputs 导致 SJ 无法区分 uncertainty vs inability； (2) sample","-    size 小（n=32-38），rho 估计 noisy。整体 pattern 支持 \"compound error +  frequency\" 叙事但不够","-    crisp——type frequency 和 rho 的 correlation 只有 0.61，说明  frequency 不是唯一 driver。reviewer","-    会指出 confounds（type frequency 和 type inherent  difficulty 高度相关）。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-003: ner_wnut17","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: ner_wnut17","+    plan_id: exp-003","+    description: >","+      Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on WNUT-17 (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。Social media","+      domain（6 entity types: corporation, creative-work, group, location, person, product）。","+      Cross-dataset generalization，最嘈杂的 domain。Inference 同时捕获 log-probs。","+    expected_results:","+      finetune_ner_f1: 0.52","+      finetune_train_loss: 0.11","+      greedy_f1: 0.495","+      oracle_f1: 0.62","+      headroom: 0.125","+      rho_sj_full: 0.30","+      rho_fk_full: 0.23","+      rho_logprob_full: 0.31","+      rho_exact_match_full: 0.15","+      rho_entity_voting_full: 0.24","+      sj_minus_fk_full: 0.07","+      sj_minus_logprob_full: -0.01","+      rho_sj_cond: 0.32","+      rho_fk_cond: 0.24","+      n_full: 1287","+      n_cond: 1105","+      p_sj_full: 4.2e-12","+      p_sj_vs_logprob: 0.42","+      sample_f1_mean: 0.43","+      sample_f1_pct_zero: 22.6","+    result_rationale: >","+      WNUT-17 的 social media 文本极度嘈杂：非正式拼写、省略、非标准 capitalization 导致 entity","+      boundary 极难准确标注，即使 fine-tune 后 greedy F1 也只有 ~0.50。SJ rho=0.30 在预期范围","+      [0.25, 0.35] 内，低于 SciERC (0.39) 但高于 exact-match (0.15)。关键发现：logprob rho=0.31","+      微弱反超 SJ（Δ=-0.01），虽然统计不显著（p=0.42），但方向上与 SciERC 相反。原因：WNUT 的高","+      noise level 导致模型的 boundary uncertainty 是主要 error source，而非 type confusion 或","+      structural error。在这种场景下，logprob 直接编码 \"模型对序列的整体不确定性\" 比 SJ 的","+      structural matching 更 relevant——因为 structural matching 计算的 entity overlap 在","+      noisy boundary 下也会失真（两个 sample 的 entity boundary 各偏一个 token，SJ 判为 partial","+      match 但实际都是错的）。SJ>FK +7pp 仍然成立，说明 \"structural > surface\" 的 hierarchy 不受","+      domain 影响，但 \"structural > model confidence\" 的 claim 在 noisy domain 不成立。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: WNUT-17 NER all signals\"","+        columns: [Signal, ρ (full), ρ (cond), AUROC, τ]","+        rows:","+          - [log-prob,      0.31, 0.33, 0.63, 0.21]","+          - [SJ,            0.30, 0.32, 0.62, 0.20]","+          - [FK,            0.23, 0.24, 0.58, 0.15]","+          - [entity voting, 0.24, 0.25, 0.59, 0.16]","+          - [exact-match,   0.15, 0.16, 0.55, 0.10]","+      - name: \"Table: Cross-dataset summary — SJ vs logprob ranking\"","+        columns: [Dataset, \"#Types\", Domain, Greedy F1, ρ_SJ, ρ_logprob, \"SJ > logprob?\"]","+        rows:","+          - [SciERC,     6, scientific,    0.667, 0.39, 0.35, \"Yes (+0.04, p<0.05)\"]","+          - [CoNLL-2003, 4, news,          0.723, 0.33, 0.32, \"No (+0.01, p=0.38)\"]","+          - [WNUT-17,    6, social media,  0.495, 0.30, 0.31, \"No (−0.01, p=0.42)\"]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"3-panel bar chart: SJ vs logprob ρ on SciERC / CoNLL / WNUT, showing the inconsistent ranking\"","+      - \"Scatter: noise level proxy (sample F1 variance) vs SJ-logprob delta across 3 datasets\"","+    analysis: >","+      WNUT 是 \"partial replication\" 的关键证据：SJ>FK 复现（3/3 datasets），但 SJ vs logprob","+      排序不一致（SciERC: SJ wins, CoNLL: tie, WNUT: logprob wins）。这迫使论文放弃 \"SJ is","+      the best signal\" 的简洁 claim，转向 \"SJ is the best consistency metric, complementary","+      to logprob\"。WNUT 作为 noisy domain 也提供了 \"when does SJ advantage disappear?\" 的","+      analytical content：当 boundary noise 而非 structural error 是主要 error source 时，","+      logprob 更 relevant。"," ","-    '","-  tables:","-  - name: 'Table: Per-relation-type SJ rho on SciERC RE'","-    columns:","-    - Relation Type","-    - n","-    - rho_sj","-    - '% all-zero'","-    rows:","-    - - Used-for","-      - 98","-      - 0.32","-      - 35","-    - - Evaluate-for","-      - 71","-      - 0.22","-      - 42","-    - - Feature-of","-      - 62","-      - 0.28","-      - 40","-    - - Conjunction","-      - 51","-      - 0.21","-      - 48","-    - - Hyponym-of","-      - 45","-      - 0.25","-      - 52","-    - - Part-of","-      - 38","-      - 0.18","-      - 58","-    - - Compare","-      - 32","-      - 0.15","-      - 62","-  figures_description:","-  - 'Bar chart: rho_sj by relation type, sorted by frequency, with error bars from","-    bootstrap CI'","-  - 'Scatter: type frequency vs rho_sj with regression line (R^2 annotated)'","-  analysis: '分析方向对但 story 不够 clean。Type frequency 是 main predictor 但 R^2 只有 ~0.37，","-    需要补充 qualitative analysis（e.g. Compare 和 Part-of 是 inherently ambiguous types）。","-    论文中应呈现为 \"exploratory analysis suggesting frequency and type ambiguity as  moderating","-    factors\"，不能 overclaim causal relationship。作为 diagnostic 的 supporting  evidence","-    足够，但不能独立支撑一个 sub-claim。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-004: re_diagnostic_analysis","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: re_diagnostic_analysis","+    plan_id: exp-004","+    description: >","+      基于 pilot_004/005 数据：per-relation-type consistency breakdown，bootstrap CI，","+      conditional threshold sensitivity analysis，ALL 4 confidence signals on RE 的比较。","+    expected_results:","+      # --- Per-relation-type SJ rho ---","+      per_type_rho_sj:","+        Used-for:     {n: 98,  rho: 0.32, ci: [0.14, 0.48]}","+        Feature-of:   {n: 62,  rho: 0.28, ci: [0.05, 0.48]}","+        Hyponym-of:   {n: 45,  rho: 0.25, ci: [-0.01, 0.48]}","+        Part-of:      {n: 38,  rho: 0.18, ci: [-0.13, 0.46]}","+        Compare:      {n: 32,  rho: 0.15, ci: [-0.21, 0.47]}","+        Conjunction:  {n: 51,  rho: 0.21, ci: [-0.06, 0.45]}","+        Evaluate-for: {n: 71,  rho: 0.22, ci: [0.00, 0.42]}","+      # --- All signals on RE full set ---","+      re_full_all_signals:","+        SJ:           {rho: 0.234, auroc: 0.59}","+        FK:           {rho: 0.184, auroc: 0.56}","+        logprob:      {rho: 0.260, auroc: 0.60}","+        exact_match:  {rho: 0.120, auroc: 0.54}","+      # --- All signals on RE conditional set ---","+      re_cond_all_signals:","+        SJ:           {rho: 0.372, auroc: 0.65}","+        FK:           {rho: 0.253, auroc: 0.59}","+        logprob:      {rho: 0.350, auroc: 0.64}","+        exact_match:  {rho: 0.150, auroc: 0.56}","+      # --- Threshold sensitivity (vary conditional exclusion criterion) ---","+      threshold_sensitivity:","+        greedy_f1_eq_0:  {n_excluded: 84, n_cond: 313, rho_sj_cond: 0.316}","+        greedy_f1_lt_01: {n_excluded: 112, n_cond: 285, rho_sj_cond: 0.345}","+        greedy_f1_lt_02: {n_excluded: 148, n_cond: 249, rho_sj_cond: 0.372}","+        all_zero_sample: {n_excluded: 96, n_cond: 301, rho_sj_cond: 0.372}","+        logprob_bottom_25pct: {n_excluded: 99, n_cond: 298, rho_sj_cond: 0.358}","+      # --- Bootstrap CI for key comparisons ---","+      bootstrap_ci:","+        re_sj_vs_fk_full_delta: {mean: 0.050, ci: [-0.02, 0.12]}","+        re_sj_vs_logprob_full_delta: {mean: -0.026, ci: [-0.10, 0.05]}","+        re_sj_vs_fk_cond_delta: {mean: 0.119, ci: [0.04, 0.20]}","+    result_rationale: >","+      Per-type 分析显示 high-frequency types (Used-for, Feature-of) rho 较高（0.28-0.32），","+      low-frequency types (Part-of, Compare) rho 极低（0.15-0.18），bootstrap CI 普遍很宽","+      （大多跨越 0），说明 per-type rho 估计极 noisy。所有信号在 RE full set 上均退化（max rho=0.26","+      by logprob），且 logprob 在 RE 上反超 SJ（0.26 vs 0.234），加强了 \"compound error 对所有","+      consistency-based 信号均有破坏性\" 的 narrative，但也说明 logprob 作为 task-agnostic 信号","+      在复杂任务上有微弱优势。Threshold sensitivity 分析显示 conditional rho 随 exclusion","+      threshold 单调增加（0.316→0.372），说明 \"conditional analysis\" 的结论依赖于 threshold","+      选择，但趋势一致——排除更多 low-capability instance 后 SJ 信号更强。Bootstrap CI 显示","+      RE 上 SJ vs FK 的 full-set delta CI 跨越 0（[-0.02, 0.12]），说明 RE 上 SJ>FK 在统计上","+      不 robust；而 conditional set 上 CI 不跨越 0（[0.04, 0.20]），说明 conditional 下 SJ","+      优势可靠。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: All signals on RE full vs conditional (T=0.7)\"","+        columns: [Signal, \"ρ (full)\", \"ρ (cond)\", \"Δ full-cond\", AUROC (full)]","+        rows:","+          - [logprob,      0.260, 0.350, +0.090, 0.60]","+          - [SJ,           0.234, 0.372, +0.138, 0.59]","+          - [FK,           0.184, 0.253, +0.069, 0.56]","+          - [exact-match,  0.120, 0.150, +0.030, 0.54]","+      - name: \"Table: Threshold sensitivity for conditional analysis\"","+        columns: [Exclusion criterion, n_excluded, n_cond, ρ_SJ_cond]","+        rows:","+          - [\"greedy F1 = 0\",   84,  313, 0.316]","+          - [\"greedy F1 < 0.1\", 112, 285, 0.345]","+          - [\"greedy F1 < 0.2\", 148, 249, 0.372]","+          - [\"all samples F1=0\", 96, 301, 0.372]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"Bar chart: per-relation-type rho_sj with bootstrap CI error bars, sorted by type frequency\"","+      - \"Line plot: conditional ρ_SJ vs exclusion threshold, showing monotonic increase with CI band\"","+      - \"Heatmap: 4 signals × 7 relation types, showing all signals degrade uniformly\"","+    analysis: >","+      RE diagnostic 的核心 takeaway：(1) ALL signals degrade on RE，不只是 SJ——logprob 在","+      full set 上甚至最强（0.26），(2) conditional analysis 中 SJ recovery 最大（Δ=0.138 vs","+      logprob Δ=0.090），说明 SJ 受 knowledge-gap instances 影响更大，(3) threshold sensitivity","+      显示结论方向 robust 但 magnitude 依赖 threshold 选择。论文中应呈现为 \"task-complexity","+      boundary applies to ALL confidence signals tested\" 的 universal finding，而非 SJ-specific","+      weakness。logprob 在 RE 上反超 SJ 加强了 Claim 2 的 generality。"," ","-    '","-- name: temperature_sensitivity_analysis","-  plan_id: exp-005","-  description: T=0.7 vs T=1.0 系统比较（NER + RE），分析 signal-noise tradeoff","-  expected_results:","-    ner_t10_rho_sj_full: 0.3825","-    ner_t10_rho_sj_cond: 0.3762","-    ner_t10_oracle_f1: 0.7756","-    ner_t10_headroom: 0.1085","-    ner_t10_pct_zero: 12.19","-    ner_t07_rho_sj_full: 0.39","-    ner_t07_rho_sj_cond: 0.4","-    ner_t07_oracle_f1: 0.755","-    ner_t07_headroom: 0.088","-    ner_t07_pct_zero: 9.5","-    re_t10_rho_sj_full: 0.2441","-    re_t10_rho_sj_cond: 0.3161","-    re_t10_pct_zero: 44.3","-    re_t10_all_zero_filtered: 84","-    re_t07_rho_sj_full: 0.228","-    re_t07_rho_sj_cond: 0.34","-    re_t07_pct_zero: 51.2","-    re_t07_all_zero_filtered: 105","-  result_rationale: 'T=0.7 vs T=1.0 的 tradeoff 是 signal quality vs output diversity。NER","-    在 T=0.7 下  rho 略高（0.39 vs 0.38），因为 lower T 减少了 random noise（fewer spurious entity  predictions），使","-    SJ 更 reflective of genuine structural agreement。但 oracle headroom  下降（0.088 vs","-    0.109），因为 samples 更 homogeneous，限制了 best-of-N 的上限。 RE 的 pattern 更极端：T=0.7 使 all-zero","-    instances 增加（84→105），因为 lower T 让  model 更 decisively 输出 nothing（而非 T=1.0 下偶尔","-    hallucinate 出 relation）， 但 conditional set 的 rho 提升（0.316→0.34），说明 T=0.7 更好地 separates","-    \"can''t do\"  from \"uncertain\"。整体 effect 是 modest 的，reviewer 会认为 T 的选择是 hyperparameter  tuning","-    而非 insight。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-005: temperature_sensitivity_analysis","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: temperature_sensitivity_analysis","+    plan_id: exp-005","+    description: >","+      T=0.7 (pilot_005) vs T=1.0 (pilot_004) 对比，ALL confidence signals，NER + RE。","+    expected_results:","+      # --- NER ---","+      ner_t10_rho: {sj: 0.3825, fk: 0.259, logprob: 0.34, exact_match: 0.17, entity_voting: 0.28}","+      ner_t07_rho: {sj: 0.3875, fk: 0.3211, logprob: 0.35, exact_match: 0.20, entity_voting: 0.30}","+      ner_delta_rho: {sj: +0.005, fk: +0.062, logprob: +0.01, exact_match: +0.03, entity_voting: +0.02}","+      ner_t10_oracle_f1: 0.776","+      ner_t07_oracle_f1: 0.759","+      ner_t10_headroom: 0.109","+      ner_t07_headroom: 0.097","+      ner_t10_pct_zero: 12.2","+      ner_t07_pct_zero: 11.2","+      # --- RE ---","+      re_t10_rho: {sj: 0.244, fk: 0.278, logprob: 0.27, exact_match: 0.09, entity_voting: 0.19}","+      re_t07_rho: {sj: 0.234, fk: 0.184, logprob: 0.26, exact_match: 0.12, entity_voting: 0.18}","+      re_t10_cond_rho: {sj: 0.316, fk: 0.307, logprob: 0.33}","+      re_t07_cond_rho: {sj: 0.372, fk: 0.253, logprob: 0.35}","+      re_t10_pct_zero: 44.3","+      re_t07_pct_zero: 42.4","+      re_t10_all_zero_filtered: 84","+      re_t07_all_zero_filtered: 96","+    result_rationale: >","+      T=0.7 vs T=1.0 的 tradeoff 是 signal quality vs output diversity。NER 上 SJ 几乎不受","+      T 影响（Δ=+0.005），因为 SJ 的 type-grouped matching 对 minor boundary shifts 鲁棒。但","+      FK 变化大（Δ=+0.062！）：T=0.7 下 samples 更相似，FK 的 exact-match based agreement 提升","+      显著，但 FK rho 并未 correspondingly 提升太多——说明 FK 的 higher absolute value at T=0.7","+      更多反映 reduced diversity 而非 better discrimination。Logprob 的 T-sensitivity 很小","+      （Δ=+0.01），因为 logprob 来自 forward pass 不依赖 sampling temperature。RE 上 pattern","+      更复杂：SJ full rho 在 T=0.7 下反而降低（0.244→0.234），但 conditional rho 显著提升","+      （0.316→0.372），因为 T=0.7 使更多 borderline instance 输出 all-zero（96 vs 84），effectively","+      做了更 aggressive 的 knowledge-gap filtering。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: Temperature sensitivity — NER (all signals)\"","+        columns: [Signal, \"ρ at T=1.0\", \"ρ at T=0.7\", Δ]","+        rows:","+          - [SJ,            0.383, 0.388, \"+0.005\"]","+          - [FK,            0.259, 0.321, \"+0.062\"]","+          - [log-prob,      0.34,  0.35,  \"+0.01\"]","+          - [exact-match,   0.17,  0.20,  \"+0.03\"]","+          - [entity voting, 0.28,  0.30,  \"+0.02\"]","+      - name: \"Table: Temperature sensitivity — RE (SJ, FK, logprob)\"","+        columns: [Signal, \"ρ full T=1.0\", \"ρ full T=0.7\", \"ρ cond T=1.0\", \"ρ cond T=0.7\"]","+        rows:","+          - [SJ,      0.244, 0.234, 0.316, 0.372]","+          - [FK,      0.278, 0.184, 0.307, 0.253]","+          - [logprob, 0.270, 0.260, 0.330, 0.350]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"2-panel: NER (left) all signals ρ at two T; RE (right) full vs cond ρ at two T\"","+      - \"Per-instance scatter: SJ at T=0.7 vs T=1.0, colored by F1 bucket\"","+    analysis: >","+      主要 takeaway：T 选择对 NER ρ 影响很小（SJ delta < 0.01），对 RE conditional ρ 影响较大","+      （SJ delta +0.056）。FK 是 T-sensitivity 最高的 signal，因为它基于 exact agreement 受","+      diversity 影响最大。Logprob 是 T-sensitivity 最低的（理论上应为零，微小差异来自 prompt","+      长度的 minor variation）。论文中作为 1-2 段 analysis 呈现，主要 takeaway：T=0.7 推荐为","+      default（NER 无影响，RE conditional 有提升），但 T 选择不是 critical hyperparameter。"," ","-    '","-  tables:","-  - name: 'Table: Temperature sensitivity (NER)'","-    columns:","-    - Metric","-    - T=1.0","-    - T=0.7","-    - Delta","-    rows:","-    - - rho_sj (full)","-      - 0.3825","-      - 0.39","-      - '+0.008'","-    - - rho_sj (cond)","-      - 0.3762","-      - 0.4","-      - '+0.024'","-    - - Oracle F1","-      - 0.7756","-      - 0.755","-      - '-0.021'","-    - - Headroom","-      - 0.1085","-      - 0.088","-      - '-0.021'","-    - - '% F1=0 samples'","-      - 12.19","-      - 9.5","-      - '-2.7'","-  - name: 'Table: Temperature sensitivity (RE)'","-    columns:","-    - Metric","-    - T=1.0","-    - T=0.7","-    - Delta","-    rows:","-    - - rho_sj (full)","-      - 0.2441","-      - 0.228","-      - '-0.016'","-    - - rho_sj (cond)","-      - 0.3161","-      - 0.34","-      - '+0.024'","-    - - All-zero instances","-      - 84","-      - 105","-      - '+21'","-    - - '% F1=0 samples'","-      - 44.3","-      - 51.2","-      - '+6.9'","-  figures_description:","-  - '2-panel figure: left=NER rho vs T with headroom overlay; right=RE rho (full vs","-    cond) vs T'","-  - Scatter of per-instance SJ at T=0.7 vs T=1.0, colored by F1 bucket, showing how","-    T affects different difficulty strata","-  analysis: 'Signal-noise tradeoff 存在但 effect size 小。NER 上 T 选择几乎无关紧要（delta<0.01 on","-    full rho）。 RE 上 conditional rho 的提升更 notable（+0.024），支持 \"T=0.7 helps separate","-    uncertainty from  inability\" 的叙事。但 reviewer 会 argue 这只是 trivially 在做 threshold","-    tuning。 论文中最好作为 1-2 段 analysis 呈现，不值得单独一个 section。主要 takeaway：T 的选择对 NER  影响小，对","-    RE 的 conditional analysis 有 moderate 影响，推荐 T=0.7 作为 default。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-006: adaptive_compute_demo","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: adaptive_compute_demo","+    plan_id: exp-006","+    description: >","+      Best-of-N selection on ALL NER datasets + RE：SJ vs logprob vs FK vs exact-match","+      vs random vs greedy。覆盖 SciERC (N=16), CoNLL (N=8), WNUT (N=8), RE SciERC (N=8)。","+    expected_results:","+      # --- SciERC NER (N=16) ---","+      scierc_ner:","+        greedy:       0.667","+        random:       0.674","+        exact_match:  0.676","+        fk:           0.680","+        logprob:      0.688","+        sj:           0.692","+        oracle:       0.789","+        sj_over_greedy: 2.5","+        sj_over_logprob: 0.4","+        sj_headroom_capture_pct: 20.5","+        logprob_headroom_capture_pct: 17.2","+      # --- CoNLL NER (N=8) ---","+      conll_ner:","+        greedy:       0.723","+        random:       0.731","+        fk:           0.734","+        logprob:      0.739","+        sj:           0.741","+        oracle:       0.818","+        sj_over_greedy: 1.8","+        sj_over_logprob: 0.2","+      # --- WNUT NER (N=8) ---","+      wnut_ner:","+        greedy:       0.495","+        random:       0.506","+        fk:           0.510","+        logprob:      0.520","+        sj:           0.518","+        oracle:       0.620","+        sj_over_greedy: 2.3","+        sj_over_logprob: -0.2","+        logprob_beats_sj: true","+      # --- RE SciERC (N=8, negative) ---","+      scierc_re:","+        greedy:       0.421","+        random:       0.425","+        fk:           0.426","+        sj:           0.430","+        logprob:      0.434","+        oracle:       0.588","+        sj_over_greedy: 0.9","+        logprob_over_greedy: 1.3","+        logprob_beats_sj: true","+    result_rationale: >","+      Best-of-N 结果直接反映了 ranking quality（rho）到 practical F1 gain 的转化。SciERC 上","+      SJ gain=+2.5pp（headroom capture 20.5%）是 3 个 NER 数据集中最好的，对应最高的 rho=0.41。","+      但 SJ vs logprob 仅 +0.4pp on SciERC——这意味着 SJ 的 \"额外 structural info\" 只贡献了","+      0.4pp 的实际 F1 改善，reviewer 会问：这 0.4pp 值得 16x 推理成本吗？CoNLL 上 SJ vs logprob","+      仅 +0.2pp（essentially equivalent），WNUT 上 logprob 反超 SJ by 0.2pp。跨数据集模式：","+      SJ 一致优于 FK 和 random（3/3 datasets），但 SJ vs logprob 不一致（1/3 SJ wins marginally,","+      1/3 tie, 1/3 logprob wins marginally）。RE 上所有信号的 gain 都小（<1.5pp），且 logprob","+      最好（+1.3pp），确认 RE 上 consistency-based selection 价值有限。整体 best-of-N gain","+      在 [1.8, 2.5] pp 范围，与 median tier 的 [1.5, 3.5] 一致。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: Best-of-N F1 comparison across datasets\"","+        columns: [Strategy, SciERC NER, CoNLL NER, WNUT NER, SciERC RE]","+        rows:","+          - [Greedy,      0.667, 0.723, 0.495, 0.421]","+          - [Random,      0.674, 0.731, 0.506, 0.425]","+          - [exact-match, 0.676, \"—\",   \"—\",   \"—\"]","+          - [FK,          0.680, 0.734, 0.510, 0.426]","+          - [log-prob,    0.688, 0.739, 0.520, 0.434]","+          - [SJ,          0.692, 0.741, 0.518, 0.430]","+          - [Oracle,      0.789, 0.818, 0.620, 0.588]","+      - name: \"Table: SJ vs logprob F1 gain over greedy\"","+        columns: [Dataset, SJ gain, logprob gain, \"SJ − logprob\", \"SJ better?\"]","+        rows:","+          - [SciERC NER, +2.5pp, +2.1pp, +0.4pp, \"Marginal\"]","+          - [CoNLL NER,  +1.8pp, +1.6pp, +0.2pp, \"No (trivial)\"]","+          - [WNUT NER,   +2.3pp, +2.5pp, \"−0.2pp\", \"No (logprob wins)\"]","+          - [SciERC RE,  +0.9pp, +1.3pp, \"−0.4pp\", \"No (logprob wins)\"]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"4-panel bar chart: one panel per dataset, showing F1 by strategy\"","+      - \"Line plot: SJ gain vs logprob gain across datasets, with 45-degree reference line\"","+    analysis: >","+      Adaptive compute demo 是论文最 practical 的结果但也最 underwhelming。SJ 一致 beat FK","+      和 random 但 vs logprob 的优势 inconsistent across datasets。+2.5pp max gain（SciERC）","+      是 technically meaningful 但不 dramatic。WNUT 和 RE 上 logprob 反超 SJ 是 clear evidence","+      that \"SJ is not universally the best selection signal\"。论文中应呈现为 complete table","+      with honest reporting，frame 为 \"SJ provides the most consistent gains across","+      conditions, but log-prob is a strong competitor at zero additional inference cost\"。","+      Ensemble (SJ + logprob) 是 natural follow-up that should be explored."," ","-    '","-- name: adaptive_compute_demo","-  plan_id: exp-006","-  description: NER TTS improvement demo：SJ vs FK vs random vs greedy selection","-  expected_results:","-    greedy_f1: 0.6671","-    sj_selection_f1: 0.685","-    fk_selection_f1: 0.677","-    random_selection_f1: 0.674","-    oracle_selection_f1: 0.789","-    sj_gain_over_greedy: 1.8","-    fk_gain_over_greedy: 1.0","-    random_gain_over_greedy: 0.7","-    sj_headroom_capture_pct: 14.8","-    fk_headroom_capture_pct: 8.2","-    sj_vs_fk_gain: 0.8","-  result_rationale: 'SJ-based selection 的 +1.8pp gain 源自 rho=0.41 的不完美 ranking：SJ","-    能识别出 roughly 15%  的 oracle headroom。这个 gain 是 real 但 modest 的原因：(1) rho=0.41 意味着","-    SJ ranking  和 actual accuracy ranking 只有 moderate agreement；(2) 很多 high-SJ instance","-    本身已经接近  greedy performance（ceiling effect）；(3) low-SJ instance 中确实有 bad samples","-    但 greedy  就是比任何 sample 好（model confidence 准确时 greedy > stochastic）。FK 的 +1.0pp","-    更弱， 因为 FK 的 lower rho（0.29）意味着更差的 ranking ability。SJ>FK gain 仅 0.8pp， reviewer","-    会质疑这是否 justify 使用更复杂的 structured metric。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-007: ner_multi_model (LLaMA)","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: ner_multi_model","+    plan_id: exp-007","+    description: >","+      Fine-tune LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on SciERC (LoRA) + NER pilot (N=8, T=0.7)。","+      Cross-model validation。Inference 同时捕获 log-probs。","+    expected_results:","+      finetune_ner_f1: 0.63","+      finetune_train_loss: 0.092","+      greedy_f1: 0.601","+      oracle_f1: 0.748","+      headroom: 0.147","+      rho_sj_full: 0.33","+      rho_fk_full: 0.26","+      rho_logprob_full: 0.32","+      rho_exact_match_full: 0.16","+      rho_entity_voting_full: 0.25","+      sj_minus_fk_full: 0.07","+      sj_minus_logprob_full: 0.01","+      rho_sj_cond: 0.35","+      rho_fk_cond: 0.25","+      n_full: 529","+      n_cond: 488","+      p_sj_full: 5.6e-15","+      p_sj_vs_logprob: 0.36","+      sample_f1_mean: 0.52","+      sample_f1_pct_zero: 17.1","+      sj_beats_logprob_conclusive: false","+    result_rationale: >","+      LLaMA-3.1-8B 的 SciERC fine-tune 弱于 Qwen3-8B（greedy F1 0.60 vs 0.67），因为","+      LLaMA 的 instruction following 和 structured output 能力略差（Qwen3 在代码/结构化任务上","+      经过更多优化）。rho_sj=0.33 低于 Qwen 的 0.41，但 SJ>FK +7pp 仍显著成立，证明","+      \"structural > surface consistency\" 是 model-agnostic finding。SJ vs logprob 差距 +0.01","+      （p=0.36，不显著），与 Qwen 上的 +0.04 方向一致但更弱。llama_sj_beats_logprob 判定为","+      inconclusive，与 median tier 预期一致。rho 降低的主要原因：LLaMA lower baseline","+      performance 意味着更多 instance 在 \"inability\" 区间（all-zero 17.1% vs 11.2%），","+      这些 instance dilute overall correlation。更大的 headroom（0.147 vs 0.097）说明","+      LLaMA 的 stochastic samples 更 diverse（weaker model = more variable outputs），","+      暗示 SJ-based selection 在 weaker model 上有更大 potential 但当前 correlation 不足","+      以充分 exploit 这个 headroom。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: Cross-model comparison on SciERC NER (N=8, T=0.7)\"","+        columns: [Metric, Qwen3-8B, LLaMA-3.1-8B]","+        rows:","+          - [Greedy F1,      0.667, 0.601]","+          - [ρ_SJ (full),    0.39,  0.33]","+          - [ρ_FK (full),    0.32,  0.26]","+          - [ρ_logprob,      0.35,  0.32]","+          - [SJ − FK,        +7pp,  +7pp]","+          - [SJ − logprob,   +4pp,  +1pp]","+          - [Oracle F1,      0.759, 0.748]","+          - [Headroom,       0.097, 0.147]","+          - [\"% F1=0 samples\", 11.2, 17.1]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"Grouped bar chart: 5 signals for Qwen vs LLaMA, showing consistent SJ>FK but inconsistent SJ vs logprob\"","+    analysis: >","+      Multi-model 结果 addresses R2 但 mixed message：SJ>FK 是 model-agnostic（两个 model","+      均 +7pp），但 SJ vs logprob 从 Qwen 的 +4pp（significant）降至 LLaMA 的 +1pp","+      （not significant）。这与 median tier 完全一致——SJ 的 structural advantage 在不同","+      model 上不 robust relative to logprob。论文中应诚实报告：\"The SJ advantage over FK","+      is model-agnostic (+7pp on both models), but the advantage over log-prob is","+      model-dependent and not consistently significant.\""," ","-    '","-  tables:","-  - name: 'Table: Adaptive compute comparison on SciERC NER (N=16)'","-    columns:","-    - Strategy","-    - F1","-    - Gain vs Greedy","-    - '% Oracle Headroom'","-    rows:","-    - - Greedy (T=0)","-      - 0.6671","-      - —","-      - —","-    - - Random sample","-      - 0.674","-      - +0.7pp","-      - 5.7%","-    - - FK selection","-      - 0.677","-      - +1.0pp","-      - 8.2%","-    - - SJ selection","-      - 0.685","-      - +1.8pp","-      - 14.8%","-    - - Oracle","-      - 0.789","-      - +12.2pp","-      - 100%","-  figures_description:","-  - Bar chart with 5 strategies, F1 on y-axis, oracle headroom capture % annotated","-  - 'Scatter plot: per-instance SJ rank vs oracle rank, showing moderate but imperfect","-    correlation'","-  analysis: '+1.8pp 是 technically solid 但叙事上不够 compelling 作为 headline result。14.8%","-    的 oracle  headroom capture 说明 SJ 作为 selection signal 还远不够好——85% 的潜力未被利用。论文中  应","-    frame 为 \"SJ provides modest but consistent improvement over baselines, suggesting  room","-    for better consistency metrics\"。作为 supporting experiment 有说服力，但不能 carry  the paper。如果","-    reviewer R4 质疑 \"no actual TTS improvement\"，+1.8pp 的回答只是 marginal  satisfactory。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-008: re_n16_confirmation (P1)","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: re_n16_confirmation","+    plan_id: exp-008","+    description: >","+      RE N=16 on SciERC (ft_002_v2, T=0.7) 确认 negative finding with higher statistical power。","+    expected_results:","+      greedy_f1: 0.421","+      oracle_f1_n16: 0.628","+      headroom_n16: 0.207","+      rho_sj_full_n16: 0.25","+      rho_fk_full_n16: 0.20","+      rho_logprob_full_n16: 0.28","+      rho_exact_match_full_n16: 0.13","+      rho_sj_cond_n16: 0.34","+      rho_fk_cond_n16: 0.27","+      rho_logprob_cond_n16: 0.36","+      sj_beats_fk_full: true","+      logprob_beats_sj_full: true","+      logprob_beats_sj_cond: true","+      n_full: 397","+      n_cond: 298","+      all_zero_count: 99","+      pct_zero_samples: 41.8","+    result_rationale: >","+      RE N=16 的 full rho_sj=0.25 vs N=8 的 0.234，提升极小（+0.016），因为 compound error","+      propagation 不因 more samples 缓解——16 个 samples 产生的 span-level SJ 仍无法区分","+      \"不确定 head entity\" vs \"不确定 relation type\" vs \"根本不知道这个 relation\"。Logprob","+      在 RE N=16 上仍然最强（rho=0.28），且 conditional 上也领先（0.36 vs SJ 0.34），这在","+      N=8 时已有迹象但 N=16 下更 definitive。所有信号的 max rho=0.28（logprob），在 median","+      tier 范围 [0.22, 0.32] 内。Oracle headroom 从 0.167→0.207 说明 N=16 确实覆盖了更多","+      RE output modes，但 selection signals 都不够好来 exploit 这个 headroom。Conditional","+      rho 在 N=16 下未有大幅提升（SJ: 0.372→0.34，甚至微降），因为更多 samples 并未帮助","+      区分 boundary cases——反而可能因为 N=16 下 all-zero 的 threshold 更 noisy。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: RE N-scaling — all signals\"","+        columns: [Signal, \"ρ full N=8\", \"ρ full N=16\", \"ρ cond N=8\", \"ρ cond N=16\"]","+        rows:","+          - [logprob,     0.260, 0.280, 0.350, 0.360]","+          - [SJ,          0.234, 0.250, 0.372, 0.340]","+          - [FK,          0.184, 0.200, 0.253, 0.270]","+          - [exact-match, 0.120, 0.130, 0.150, 0.160]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"Side-by-side: NER N=16 vs RE N=16, showing stark contrast in signal quality\"","+    analysis: >","+      RE N=16 confirms Claim 2 with higher statistical power：compound error propagation","+      是 fundamental bottleneck。Logprob 在 RE 上一致最优（full 和 cond 均领先）是重要发现——","+      说明在复杂任务上 model's internal confidence 比 any external consistency metric 更","+      informative。论文中直接写：\"Increasing N from 8 to 16 yields negligible improvement","+      in RE full-set correlation for any signal tested, confirming that the degradation","+      is structural rather than statistical.\""," ","-    '","-- name: ner_multi_model","-  plan_id: exp-007","-  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B on SciERC NER，验证 effect 跨模型泛化","-  expected_results:","-    finetune_ner_f1: 0.635","-    finetune_train_loss: 0.088","-    greedy_f1: 0.601","-    oracle_f1: 0.748","-    headroom: 0.147","-    rho_sj_full: 0.35","-    rho_fk_full: 0.28","-    sj_minus_fk_full: 0.07","-    rho_sj_cond: 0.36","-    rho_fk_cond: 0.27","-    n_full: 529","-    n_cond: 495","-    p_sj_full: 8.4e-17","-    sample_f1_mean: 0.52","-    sample_f1_pct_zero: 16.3","-  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-3.1-8B 的 SciERC fine-tune 比 Qwen3-8B 弱（greedy F1 0.60 vs","-    0.67），因为  LLaMA 的 instruction following 和 structured output 能力不如 Qwen3。rho_sj=0.35  低于","-    Qwen 的 0.41，但 SJ>FK 的 advantage 依然显著（+7pp），说明 \"structural metric  优于 surface metric\"","-    这个 finding 是 model-agnostic 的。rho 较低的原因：LLaMA 的  lower baseline performance 意味着更多","-    instance 处于 \"inability\" 区间（all-zero 比例  更高），这些 instance dilute 了 overall correlation。SJ>FK","-    delta 从 12pp 降至 7pp  也符合预期：weaker model 的 output 更 noisy，SJ 的 structural sensitivity","-    优势被  noise 部分抵消。作为 model-agnosticism 的 evidence 是 sufficient 但不 compelling。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-009: capability_stratification (P1)","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: capability_stratification","+    plan_id: exp-009","+    description: >","+      按 difficulty strata（greedy F1 buckets + 独立 proxy: sentence length, entity count）","+      分层分析 rho，验证 inverted-U pattern。NER + RE。","+    expected_results:","+      # --- NER strata (greedy F1 buckets, N=16) ---","+      ner_strata:","+        high_f1_gt_08:   {n: 185, rho_sj: 0.14, rho_logprob: 0.12, ci: \"[0.02, 0.26]\"}","+        medium_f1_04_08: {n: 212, rho_sj: 0.45, rho_logprob: 0.38, ci: \"[0.34, 0.55]\"}","+        low_f1_lt_04:    {n: 132, rho_sj: 0.22, rho_logprob: 0.20, ci: \"[0.06, 0.38]\"}","+      # --- RE strata ---","+      re_strata:","+        high_f1_gt_06:   {n: 88,  rho_sj: 0.12, ci: \"[-0.09, 0.32]\"}","+        medium_f1_02_06: {n: 135, rho_sj: 0.31, ci: \"[0.16, 0.45]\"}","+        low_f1_lt_02:    {n: 174, rho_sj: 0.16, ci: \"[0.02, 0.30]\"}","+      # --- Independent proxy: entity count ---","+      ner_entity_count_proxy:","+        low_entities_0_2:   {n: 180, rho_sj: 0.18}","+        medium_entities_3_5: {n: 210, rho_sj: 0.42}","+        high_entities_6plus: {n: 139, rho_sj: 0.28}","+      ner_peak_stratum: \"medium (F1 0.4-0.8)\"","+      re_peak_stratum: \"medium (F1 0.2-0.6)\"","+      boundary_sharpness: \"fuzzy — 10-15pp overlap between strata CIs\"","+      independent_proxy_confirms_inverted_u: true","+      proxy_correlation_with_f1_bucket: 0.58","+    result_rationale: >","+      Inverted-U 形状的根本原因：High stratum（easy instances）的 F1 和 SJ 都高且 variance 低，","+      ceiling effect 压缩 rank 差异（rho_sj=0.14）；Low stratum（hard instances）model 基本","+      fail，SJ 接近 random（rho_sj=0.22）。Medium stratum 同时有足够 variance 和 genuine","+      uncertainty，使 SJ discriminate 最有效（rho_sj=0.45）。在 medium stratum 内 SJ 明显","+      优于 logprob（0.45 vs 0.38），说明 SJ 的 structural info 在 \"model 有能力但不确定\" 的","+      sweet spot 上最有价值。独立 proxy（entity count）也呈现 inverted-U（low: 0.18, medium:","+      0.42, high: 0.28），且与 F1 bucket 的 correlation=0.58——moderate correlation 说明","+      entity count 是 reasonable 但 imperfect 的 independent proxy，inverted-U 不完全是","+      F1 bucket 的 circular artifact。但 boundary 很 fuzzy：strata CI 大幅重叠","+      （bootstrap CI width ~0.08-0.12），无法画出 clean cutoff。RE 的 pattern 更极端——","+      Low stratum 极大（n=174），反映 model capability 的 fundamental limitation。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: NER ρ_SJ by difficulty stratum (N=16)\"","+        columns: [Stratum, F1 range, n, ρ_SJ, ρ_logprob, \"95% CI (SJ)\"]","+        rows:","+          - [Easy,   \">0.8\",   185, 0.14, 0.12, \"[0.02, 0.26]\"]","+          - [Medium, \"0.4-0.8\", 212, 0.45, 0.38, \"[0.34, 0.55]\"]","+          - [Hard,   \"<0.4\",   132, 0.22, 0.20, \"[0.06, 0.38]\"]","+      - name: \"Table: Independent proxy (entity count) — NER\"","+        columns: [Entity count, n, ρ_SJ]","+        rows:","+          - [\"0-2 (few)\",   180, 0.18]","+          - [\"3-5 (medium)\", 210, 0.42]","+          - [\"6+ (many)\",   139, 0.28]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"2-panel inverted-U: ρ_SJ and ρ_logprob vs stratum for NER (left) and RE (right) with CI ribbons\"","+      - \"Scatter: entity count vs greedy F1, colored by SJ rank accuracy, showing the sweet spot visually\"","+    analysis: >","+      Inverted-U 是 strongest analytical finding：解释了 \"为什么 overall ρ 只有 0.41——因为","+      easy 和 hard instances dilute the signal\"。Medium stratum 内 SJ 明显优于 logprob","+      （0.45 vs 0.38，+7pp）说明 SJ 在 sweet spot 上有独特价值——这是论文中最能 justify","+      SJ 的 analysis。Independent proxy 基本 confirms pattern 但不 definitive（r=0.58）。","+      论文中应诚实 frame：\"The inverted-U pattern is consistent across difficulty proxies","+      but boundaries are fuzzy; SJ's advantage over log-prob is concentrated in the","+      medium-difficulty stratum where genuine uncertainty, rather than inability,","+      drives output variation.\""," ","-    '","-  tables:","-  - name: 'Table: Multi-model comparison on SciERC NER (N=8)'","-    columns:","-    - Metric","-    - Qwen3-8B","-    - LLaMA-3.1-8B","-    rows:","-    - - Greedy F1","-      - 0.667","-      - 0.601","-    - - rho_sj (full)","-      - 0.41","-      - 0.35","-    - - rho_fk (full)","-      - 0.29","-      - 0.28","-    - - SJ - FK delta","-      - +12pp","-      - +7pp","-    - - Oracle F1","-      - 0.789","-      - 0.748","-    - - Headroom","-      - 0.122","-      - 0.147","-  figures_description:","-  - 'Grouped bar chart: rho_sj and rho_fk for Qwen vs LLaMA side by side'","-  analysis: 'Multi-model 结果 addresses R2 concern 但不是 strong refutation。SJ>FK 的方向一致  是","-    positive signal，但 delta 从 12→7pp 和 rho 从 0.41→0.35 的下降留下了 \"效果  是否 robust across","-    stronger/weaker models\" 的疑问。如果有 budget，加一个 70B model  或 GPT-4-class model 会更有说服力，但","-    P1 优先级下 8B-class 两个 model 是合理 scope。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-010: selection_curves (P2)","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: selection_curves","+    plan_id: exp-010","+    description: >","+      Best-of-N selection curves for N=1,2,4,8,16，all confidence signals，SciERC NER。","+    expected_results:","+      curves_sj:      {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.673, n4: 0.680, n8: 0.686, n16: 0.692}","+      curves_logprob:  {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.672, n4: 0.679, n8: 0.684, n16: 0.688}","+      curves_fk:      {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.670, n4: 0.675, n8: 0.678, n16: 0.680}","+      curves_entity_voting: {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.670, n4: 0.674, n8: 0.677, n16: 0.679}","+      curves_exact_match: {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.669, n4: 0.672, n8: 0.675, n16: 0.676}","+      curves_rand:    {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.669, n4: 0.671, n8: 0.673, n16: 0.674}","+      curves_oracle:  {n1: 0.667, n2: 0.710, n4: 0.745, n8: 0.776, n16: 0.789}","+      sj_logprob_gap_n4: 0.001","+      sj_logprob_gap_n8: 0.002","+      sj_logprob_gap_n16: 0.004","+    result_rationale: >","+      Selection curves 显示所有 practical signals 都远低于 oracle——oracle 在 N=16 时 F1=0.789","+      而 SJ 仅 0.692，gap=0.097pp。SJ 在所有 N 上 consistently outperform 其他信号，但","+      SJ-logprob gap 极小（N=4: 0.1pp, N=8: 0.2pp, N=16: 0.4pp），只有在 N≥8 时才开始","+      visible。Gap 随 N 增大是因为 more samples 给 SJ 的 structural comparison 更多","+      information，而 logprob 的 mean 在 N>4 后趋于 stable。所有 curves 呈 diminishing","+      returns，且 practical signals 的 curve 在 N=8 后几乎 flat——说明当前 signal quality","+      下 N>16 不会有 meaningful gain。Oracle curve 持续上升说明 bottleneck 是 selection","+      accuracy 而非 sample diversity。","+    tables: []","+    figures_description:","+      - \"Line plot: F1 vs N for 7 strategies with CI bands. Oracle rises steeply; others cluster near bottom. Inset zoom on N=8-16 range showing SJ-logprob gap\"","+    analysis: >","+      这张图的 visual impact 取决于 presentation。If zoomed to full range，SJ/FK/logprob/random","+      看起来一样。Inset zoom 是必须的。Key message：\"All signals capture only a fraction of","+      oracle headroom; SJ consistently leads but the margin over logprob is slim.\"","+      建议在论文中作为 Figure 而非 Table 呈现（Dream flagged table-only presentation）。"," ","-    '","-- name: re_n16_confirmation","-  plan_id: exp-008","-  description: RE N=16 on SciERC 确认 negative finding","-  expected_results:","-    greedy_f1: 0.4208","-    oracle_f1_n16: 0.625","-    headroom_n16: 0.204","-    rho_sj_full_n16: 0.26","-    rho_fk_full_n16: 0.29","-    rho_sj_cond_n16: 0.33","-    rho_fk_cond_n16: 0.3","-    sj_beats_fk_full: false","-    sj_beats_fk_cond: true","-    n_full: 397","-    n_cond: 305","-    all_zero_count: 92","-    pct_zero_samples: 42.1","-  result_rationale: 'RE N=16 的 full rho_sj=0.26 vs N=8 的 0.244，提升极小（+0.016），因为 RE","-    的 fundamental  problem（compound error propagation）不会因为 more samples 而缓解——16 个","-    samples 产生的  span-level SJ 仍然无法区分 \"model 不确定 head entity\" vs \"model 不确定 relation","-    type\"  vs \"model 根本不知道这个 relation\"。Conditional rho=0.33 在 median range 内（[0.28,","-    0.36]）， 比 N=8 的 0.316 略好，但 \"fuzzy boundary\" 的 caveat 明显——conditional set 的划分依赖  all-zero","-    threshold，不同 threshold 会得到不同结果。SJ 在 full set 仍然输给 FK（0.26 vs 0.29）， 而 conditional","-    set 上 SJ 小幅领先（0.33 vs 0.30），这个 pattern 与 N=8 一致， confirms the diagnostic finding","-    with higher statistical power。","-","-    '","-  tables:","-  - name: 'Table: RE N-scaling comparison on SciERC'","-    columns:","-    - Metric","-    - N=8 (pilot_004)","-    - N=16","-    rows:","-    - - rho_sj (full)","-      - 0.2441","-      - 0.26","-    - - rho_fk (full)","-      - 0.2782","-      - 0.29","-    - - rho_sj (cond)","-      - 0.3161","-      - 0.33","-    - - rho_fk (cond)","-      - 0.3067","-      - 0.3","-    - - SJ beats FK (full)","-      - 'No'","-      - 'No'","-    - - SJ beats FK (cond)","-      - 'Yes'","-      - 'Yes'","-    - - All-zero instances","-      - 84","-      - 92","-  figures_description:","-  - Side-by-side comparison with NER N=16 table, highlighting the NER-RE divergence","-    pattern","-  analysis: 'RE N=16 的 marginal improvement 完美 confirms Claim 2：compound error propagation  是","-    structural bottleneck，不是 sample size problem。论文中可以直接写 \"increasing N  from 8 to","-    16 yields negligible improvement in RE full-set correlation (+0.016),  confirming","-    that the degradation is fundamental rather than statistical\"。 Conditional rho=0.33","-    is a valid but modest signal，需要 caveat about threshold sensitivity。","-","-    '","-- name: capability_stratification","-  plan_id: exp-009","-  description: 按 difficulty strata 分析 rho 变化（NER + RE）","-  expected_results:","-    ner_strata:","-      high_f1_gt_08:","-        n: 185","-        rho_sj: 0.14","-      medium_f1_04_08:","-        n: 212","-        rho_sj: 0.44","-      low_f1_lt_04:","-        n: 132","-        rho_sj: 0.22","-    re_strata:","-      high_f1_gt_06:","-        n: 88","-        rho_sj: 0.12","-      medium_f1_02_06:","-        n: 135","-        rho_sj: 0.31","-      low_f1_lt_02:","-        n: 174","-        rho_sj: 0.16","-    ner_peak_stratum: medium (0.4-0.8)","-    re_peak_stratum: medium (0.2-0.6)","-    boundary_sharpness: fuzzy — 10-15pp overlap between strata CIs","-  result_rationale: 'rho 呈现 inverted-U 形状的原因：High stratum（easy instances）的 F1 和 SJ","-    都高且 variance 低， ceiling effect 压缩了 rank 差异；Low stratum（hard instances）的 model","-    基本 fail， SJ 接近 random，无 discriminative power。只有 Medium stratum 同时有足够 variance","-    和  genuine uncertainty，使 SJ 能 discriminate。但在 median tier 下 boundary 是 fuzzy 的：","-    strata 之间的 rho CI 大幅重叠（bootstrap CI width ~0.08-0.12），无法画出 clean cutoff。 RE 的","-    pattern 更极端——Low stratum 极大（n=174），反映 model capability 的 fundamental  限制。这支持 Claim","-    2 但需要 \"the boundary is fuzzy\" 的 caveat。","-","-    '","-  tables:","-  - name: 'Table: NER rho_sj by difficulty stratum'","-    columns:","-    - Stratum","-    - F1 range","-    - n","-    - rho_sj","-    - 95% CI","-    rows:","-    - - Easy","-      - '>0.8'","-      - 185","-      - 0.14","-      - '[0.02, 0.26]'","-    - - Medium","-      - 0.4-0.8","-      - 212","-      - 0.44","-      - '[0.33, 0.54]'","-    - - Hard","-      - <0.4","-      - 132","-      - 0.22","-      - '[0.06, 0.38]'","-  - name: 'Table: RE rho_sj by difficulty stratum'","-    columns:","-    - Stratum","-    - F1 range","-    - n","-    - rho_sj","-    - 95% CI","-    rows:","-    - - Easy","-      - '>0.6'","-      - 88","-      - 0.12","-      - '[-0.09, 0.32]'","-    - - Medium","-      - 0.2-0.6","-      - 135","-      - 0.31","-      - '[0.16, 0.45]'","-    - - Hard","-      - <0.2","-      - 174","-      - 0.16","-      - '[0.02, 0.30]'","-  figures_description:","-  - '2-panel inverted-U plot: rho_sj vs difficulty stratum for NER (left) and RE (right)","-    with CI ribbons'","-  analysis: 'Inverted-U pattern 是 strongest analytical finding：明确解释了 \"为什么 overall","-    rho 只有  0.41——因为 easy 和 hard instances dilute the signal\"。Medium stratum 的 rho=0.44（NER）","-    说明 SJ 在 sweet spot 上的 discriminative power 是合理的。但 fuzzy boundaries 限制了  practical","-    guidance 的 precision——论文不能说 \"只在 F1 0.4-0.8 的 instance 上用 SJ\"， 因为 you don''t know","-    F1 at test time。这个分析是 diagnostic contribution 的核心， 但需要 honest framing about the","-    boundary fuzziness。","-","-    '","-- name: selection_curves","-  plan_id: exp-010","-  description: Best-of-N selection curves (N=1,2,4,8,16) for SJ vs FK vs random","-  expected_results:","-    curves_sj:","-      n1: 0.6671","-      n2: 0.672","-      n4: 0.678","-      n8: 0.683","-      n16: 0.685","-    curves_fk:","-      n1: 0.6671","-      n2: 0.67","-      n4: 0.674","-      n8: 0.676","-      n16: 0.677","-    curves_rand:","-      n1: 0.6671","-      n2: 0.669","-      n4: 0.671","-      n8: 0.673","-      n16: 0.674","-    curves_oracle:","-      n1: 0.6671","-      n2: 0.71","-      n4: 0.745","-      n8: 0.776","-      n16: 0.789","-    sj_fk_gap_at_n16: 0.008","-    sj_fk_gap_at_n8: 0.007","-  result_rationale: 'Selection curves 显示 SJ 在所有 N 上 consistently outperform FK 和 random，但","-    gap  modest：N=16 时 SJ vs FK 仅 0.8pp。Curves 都呈现 diminishing returns，与 oracle curve  的","-    gap 在 N 增大时反而 widen——说明 more samples 主要增加了 oracle ceiling（more diverse  outputs","-    to choose from），但 SJ 的 selection ability 没有 proportionally 提升。 SJ-FK gap 随 N 微增（从","-    N=4 的 0.4pp 到 N=16 的 0.8pp），因为 more samples 让 SJ  的 structural comparison 更 stable。","-","-    '","-  tables: []","-  figures_description:","-  - 'Line plot: F1 vs N for 4 strategies (SJ, FK, random, oracle) with shaded CI bands.","-    Oracle curve rises steeply; SJ/FK/random cluster near the bottom, gap best visible","-    in inset zoom'","-  analysis: '这张图的问题是 SJ/FK/random 三条线 visually 太接近，只有 inset/zoom 才能看到差异。 Oracle curve","-    远在上方，强调了 selection 的 headroom 还很大。最佳 framing： \"SJ consistently outperforms alternatives,","-    but current correlation levels limit headroom  capture to ~15%\"。作为 P2 visualization，informative","-    但不 critical for acceptance。","-","-    '","-- name: ner_ood_robustness","-  plan_id: exp-011","-  description: OntoNotes 域内 vs 域外 NER consistency signal 鲁棒性","-  expected_results:","-    in_domain_rho_sj: 0.29","-    ood_rho_sj: 0.24","-    in_domain_greedy_f1: 0.583","-    ood_greedy_f1: 0.51","-    ood_sj_minus_fk: 0.02","-    ood_rho_fk: 0.22","-    ood_n: ~1200","-    ood_pct_zero: 22.5","-  result_rationale: 'OOD 的 rho 从 in-domain 的 0.29 降至 0.24，因为 domain shift 引入了 systematic","-    error  pattern 而非 random uncertainty——model 在 OOD domain 上 consistently 犯同类错误（e.g.,  新闻训练的","-    model 在 broadcast/weblog 上 systematically miss informal entity mentions）， 这种 systematic","-    error 产生 high consistency（samples 一致地错）但 low accuracy， 破坏了 SJ-accuracy correlation。SJ>FK","-    仅 2pp，在 practical 意义上可忽略。 这进一步收窄了 SJ 的 applicable scope：不仅受 type granularity 影响，还受","-    domain match 影响。","-","-    '","-  tables:","-  - name: 'Table: In-domain vs OOD on OntoNotes NER'","-    columns:","-    - Setting","-    - Greedy F1","-    - rho_sj","-    - rho_fk","-    - SJ-FK","-    rows:","-    - - In-domain (nw)","-      - 0.583","-      - 0.29","-      - 0.26","-      - +3pp","-    - - OOD (bc/wb)","-      - 0.51","-      - 0.24","-      - 0.22","-      - +2pp","-  figures_description:","-  - 'Paired bar chart: in-domain vs OOD rho for SJ and FK'","-  analysis: OOD 结果是 median tier 的 additional risk factor。与 OntoNotes in-domain 的弱结果叠加，","-    叙事被进一步压缩。但也提供了额外 analysis angle：systematic vs random error 对 consistency  signal","-    的不同影响。论文中作为 \"limitations & future work\" section 的 content 是 appropriate， 但不能作为","-    positive contribution。P2 优先级下如果时间紧可以 cut。","+  # ============================================================","+  # exp-011: ner_ood_robustness (P2)","+  # ============================================================","+  - name: ner_ood_robustness","+    plan_id: exp-011","+    description: >","+      Cross-domain transfer：WNUT fine-tuned model applied to SciERC test set (domain shift","+      from social media → scientific text)，测试 consistency signal 在 OOD setting 下的鲁棒性。","+    expected_results:","+      ood_greedy_f1: 0.32","+      ood_oracle_f1: 0.48","+      ood_headroom: 0.16","+      ood_rho_sj_full: 0.22","+      ood_rho_fk_full: 0.18","+      ood_rho_logprob_full: 0.25","+      ood_rho_exact_match_full: 0.10","+      ood_sj_minus_fk: 0.04","+      ood_sj_minus_logprob: -0.03","+      ood_n: 529","+      ood_pct_zero: 28.4","+      in_domain_comparison:","+        wnut_in_domain_rho_sj: 0.30","+        scierc_ood_rho_sj: 0.22","+        delta: -0.08","+    result_rationale: >","+      OOD（WNUT model → SciERC data）产生 severe domain shift：social media 训练的模型对","+      scientific entity types（Method, Task, Material 等）几乎没有 concept，greedy F1 仅 0.32。","+      rho_sj=0.22 比 in-domain WNUT（0.30）降低 0.08，因为 domain shift 导致 systematic error","+      而非 random uncertainty——model 一致地 fail on scientific entities，产生 high SJ（samples","+      一致地错）但 low F1，破坏 SJ-accuracy correlation。Logprob 在 OOD 上仍然最强（0.25），","+      因为 logprob 对 OOD text 的 low confidence 更 faithfully 反映了 model 的 inability。","+      SJ vs logprob = -0.03（logprob wins），与 WNUT in-domain 的 -0.01 方向一致但更 extreme。","+      这进一步收窄了 SJ 的 applicable scope：not only dataset-dependent (WNUT vs SciERC)","+      but also domain-sensitive (in-domain vs OOD)。","+    tables:","+      - name: \"Table: In-domain vs OOD consistency signal robustness\"","+        columns: [Setting, Greedy F1, ρ_SJ, ρ_logprob, ρ_FK, \"SJ−logprob\"]","+        rows:","+          - [\"WNUT in-domain\",     0.495, 0.30, 0.31, 0.23, \"−0.01\"]","+          - [\"WNUT→SciERC (OOD)\",  0.320, 0.22, 0.25, 0.18, \"−0.03\"]","+          - [\"SciERC in-domain\",   0.667, 0.39, 0.35, 0.32, \"+0.04\"]","+    figures_description:","+      - \"Paired bar chart: in-domain vs OOD ρ for all signals, showing uniform degradation\"","+    analysis: >","+      OOD 结果是 negative 但 informative。Uniform degradation across all signals 说明 OOD","+      不是 SJ-specific problem。但 logprob 在 OOD 下 relative advantage 增大——从 in-domain","+      的 -0.01 到 OOD 的 -0.03——说明 model confidence 在 unfamiliar domain 上是更 reliable","+      的 proxy than structural consistency。论文中作为 \"limitations\" 呈现：consistency signals","+      degrade under domain shift, with structural signals (SJ) degrading slightly more","+      than model confidence (logprob)。P2 优先级，时间紧可 cut。"]}],"originalFile":"tier: median\nnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 从 \"SJ is a general strong signal\" 收窄为 \"SJ is a consistently\n  better signal than FK,  with effect size varying by dataset characteristics\"。SciERC\n  N=16 小幅提升证明方向对，但跨数据集一强一弱 迫使叙事转向分析 dataset properties 对 SJ 效果的影响（entity density,\n  type granularity, label noise）。 弱数据集（OntoNotes）不丢掉，作为 boundary condition 的 empirical\n  evidence。 Claim 2 保持但加 \"the boundary is fuzzy\" caveat：RE conditional rho 偏低（~0.33），难以宣称\n  clean separation。 Adaptive compute 从 headline 降为 supporting experiment（+1.8pp 不够\n  dramatic）。 Multi-model（exp-007）补救跨数据集弱点，证明 effect 不是 Qwen-specific。 标题软化为 \"When\n  Does Structural Self-Consistency Work? An Empirical Study on IE Test-Time Scaling\"。\n  EMNLP Findings 是 realistic target，Main 偏紧。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: ner_n16_scierc\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: SciERC NER N=16 采样，测试 rho 是否突破 0.40 并提供 N-scaling 数据\n  expected_results:\n    greedy_f1: 0.6671\n    oracle_f1_n16: 0.789\n    headroom_n16: 0.122\n    rho_sj_full_n16: 0.41\n    rho_fk_full_n16: 0.29\n    rho_sj_cond_n16: 0.42\n    rho_fk_cond_n16: 0.28\n    sj_minus_fk_full: 0.12\n    n_full: 529\n    n_cond: 509\n    sample_f1_mean: 0.612\n    sample_f1_pct_zero: 11.5\n    p_sj_full: 2.1e-22\n  result_rationale: 'N=8→N=16 提供更稳定的 SJ 估计（每个 instance 的 pairwise comparison 从 C(8,2)=28\n    增至 C(16,2)=120）， 降低了 metric noise，使 rho 从 0.3825 小幅提升至 0.41。但提升幅度有限（+0.03），因为瓶颈不是\n    sample  count 而是 T=0.7 下模型的固有 diversity 上限——多数 instance 在 8 samples 时已充分覆盖主要输出模式，\n    额外 8 个 samples 只补充了 tail modes。Oracle headroom 从 0.109→0.122 说明 N=16 确实捕获了更多  diverse\n    outputs，但 diminishing returns 明显。这个 rho=0.41 够发 paper 但不 dramatic——reviewer 会  质疑\n    rho=0.41 vs 0.38 的 practical significance。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: N-scaling comparison on SciERC NER'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - N=8 (pilot_004)\n    - N=16\n    rows:\n    - - rho_sj (full)\n      - 0.3825\n      - 0.41\n    - - rho_fk (full)\n      - 0.259\n      - 0.29\n    - - SJ - FK delta\n      - 0.1235\n      - 0.12\n    - - Oracle F1\n      - 0.7756\n      - 0.789\n    - - Headroom\n      - 0.1085\n      - 0.122\n    - - Sample F1 mean\n      - 0.6084\n      - 0.612\n    - - '% F1=0 samples'\n      - 12.19\n      - 11.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: rho_sj and rho_fk vs N (N=2,4,8,16), showing diminishing returns curve\n    with error bars from bootstrap'\n  analysis: 'rho=0.41 统计显著高于 0.38（bootstrap CI 不重叠），但 effect size 不大。N-scaling curve  在\n    N=8 后明显趋平，暗示 T=0.7 下 N=16 接近 saturation。这限制了 \"more samples = better\"  的叙事。论文中应报告为\n    \"rho improves modestly with N, plateauing around N=16\"，而非  oversell 这个增量。\n\n    '\n- name: ner_conll2003\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: CoNLL-2003 NER 跨数据集验证（fine-tune + N=8 pilot）\n  expected_results:\n    finetune_ner_f1: 0.745\n    finetune_train_loss: 0.065\n    greedy_f1: 0.723\n    oracle_f1: 0.821\n    headroom: 0.098\n    rho_sj_full: 0.37\n    rho_fk_full: 0.3\n    sj_minus_fk_full: 0.07\n    rho_sj_cond: 0.38\n    rho_fk_cond: 0.29\n    n_full: 3250\n    n_cond: 3105\n    p_sj_full: 1.8e-30\n    sample_f1_mean: 0.68\n    sample_f1_pct_zero: 6.2\n  result_rationale: 'CoNLL-2003 的 4 个粗粒度 entity type（PER/LOC/ORG/MISC）产生更 clean 的\n    SJ 信号： type confusion 少（PER 和 LOC 混淆概率远低于 SciERC 的 Method/Task 混淆），entity boundary  更清晰（新闻文本\n    vs 科学摘要）。模型 baseline F1 更高（0.72 vs 0.67）说明任务更简单， 但 rho 反而只有 0.37（低于 SciERC 的 0.41），因为\n    higher baseline 意味着更多 instance  处于 ceiling（F1>0.9），这些 instance 的 SJ 和 F1 都高但贡献不到\n    rank correlation。 SJ>FK +7pp 是 solid result，证明 structural metric 优势跨数据集成立。这是 \"好\"\n    的  跨数据集结果。N=3250（CoNLL test set 更大）提供极高统计功效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: CoNLL-2003 NER consistency metrics'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - SJ\n    - FK\n    rows:\n    - - rho (full set)\n      - 0.37\n      - 0.3\n    - - rho (conditional)\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.29\n    - - p-value (full)\n      - '1.8e-30'\n      - '4.2e-18'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: rho_sj vs rho_fk across SciERC, CoNLL-2003, and OntoNotes, showing\n    cross-dataset pattern'\n  analysis: 'CoNLL 复现了 SJ>FK 的核心发现，delta=7pp 与 SciERC 的 12pp 一致方向。rho 绝对值较低  可归因于\n    CoNLL 的 lower variance（task 更简单，less room for the metric to discriminate）。 论文中可以\n    confidently 报告 \"SJ advantage replicates on CoNLL-2003\"。\n\n    '\n- name: ner_ontonotes\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: OntoNotes 5.0 NER 跨数据集验证（fine-tune + N=8 pilot）\n  expected_results:\n    finetune_ner_f1: 0.618\n    finetune_train_loss: 0.092\n    greedy_f1: 0.583\n    oracle_f1: 0.685\n    headroom: 0.102\n    rho_sj_full: 0.29\n    rho_fk_full: 0.26\n    sj_minus_fk_full: 0.03\n    rho_sj_cond: 0.31\n    rho_fk_cond: 0.27\n    n_full: 8262\n    n_cond: 7480\n    p_sj_full: 3.1e-15\n    sample_f1_mean: 0.51\n    sample_f1_pct_zero: 15.8\n  result_rationale: 'OntoNotes 的 18 个 fine-grained entity types 严重削弱 SJ 信号。核心问题：type\n    confusion  inflate SJ without reflecting accuracy。例如模型在不同 samples 中将同一 span 标为\n    GPE/LOC/FAC， SJ 看到 span overlap 给出中等分数，但 strict F1 全部判错。这种 \"structurally similar\n    but  semantically wrong\" 的 pattern 在 SciERC（6 types）和 CoNLL（4 types）中影响小，在 OntoNotes\n    中  成为主要 noise source。rho=0.29 统计显著（p<1e-14，得益于大 test set），但 SJ>FK 仅 3pp， reviewer\n    会质疑 practical significance。这是叙事中的 \"弱\" 数据集，但正好提供了分析  \"what dataset properties affect\n    SJ effectiveness\" 的素材。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: OntoNotes NER consistency metrics'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - SJ\n    - FK\n    rows:\n    - - rho (full set)\n      - 0.29\n      - 0.26\n    - - rho (conditional)\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.27\n    - - p-value (full)\n      - '3.1e-15'\n      - '5.7e-12'\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-dataset comparison summary'\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - '#Types'\n    - Greedy F1\n    - rho_sj\n    - SJ-FK delta\n    rows:\n    - - SciERC\n      - 6\n      - 0.667\n      - 0.41\n      - +12pp\n    - - CoNLL-2003\n      - 4\n      - 0.723\n      - 0.37\n      - +7pp\n    - - OntoNotes\n      - 18\n      - 0.583\n      - 0.29\n      - +3pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: #entity_types vs rho_sj across three datasets, suggesting type\n    granularity as moderating factor'\n  - 'Scatter plot: entity density (entities/sentence) vs rho_sj, exploring alternative\n    explanations'\n  analysis: 'OntoNotes 是必须正面面对的弱结果。叙事策略：将三个数据集排列为 type granularity 的 gradient  （4→6→18\n    types），分析 rho 随 type 数增加的下降趋势。论点：SJ 的优势在于捕捉 structural  overlap，但当 type confusion\n    成为主要 error source 时，structural overlap 不再是 accuracy  的 good proxy。这为 SJ 的适用条件提供了\n    principled 解释，将弱结果转化为 analytical contribution。 但 reviewer 仍可能指出只有 3 个数据点的 trend\n    不够 convincing。\n\n    '\n- name: re_diagnostic_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: 基于 pilot_004/005 数据的 per-relation-type consistency 分析\n  expected_results:\n    per_type_rho_sj:\n      Used-for: 0.32\n      Feature-of: 0.28\n      Hyponym-of: 0.25\n      Part-of: 0.18\n      Compare: 0.15\n      Conjunction: 0.21\n      Evaluate-for: 0.22\n    per_type_n:\n      Used-for: 98\n      Feature-of: 62\n      Hyponym-of: 45\n      Part-of: 38\n      Compare: 32\n      Conjunction: 51\n      Evaluate-for: 71\n    max_type_rho: 0.32\n    min_type_rho: 0.15\n    correlation_type_freq_vs_rho: 0.61\n    correlation_type_arity_vs_rho: -0.34\n  result_rationale: 'High-frequency types（Used-for, Feature-of）有更多 training examples\n    和 evaluation instances， model 对这些 type 的输出更稳定，SJ 估计也更 reliable，因此 rho 更高（0.28-0.32）。\n    Low-frequency types（Part-of, Compare）rho 极低（0.15-0.18），原因双重：(1) 模型对这些 type  本身\n    capability 差，大量 all-zero outputs 导致 SJ 无法区分 uncertainty vs inability； (2) sample\n    size 小（n=32-38），rho 估计 noisy。整体 pattern 支持 \"compound error +  frequency\" 叙事但不够\n    crisp——type frequency 和 rho 的 correlation 只有 0.61，说明  frequency 不是唯一 driver。reviewer\n    会指出 confounds（type frequency 和 type inherent  difficulty 高度相关）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Per-relation-type SJ rho on SciERC RE'\n    columns:\n    - Relation Type\n    - n\n    - rho_sj\n    - '% all-zero'\n    rows:\n    - - Used-for\n      - 98\n      - 0.32\n      - 35\n    - - Evaluate-for\n      - 71\n      - 0.22\n      - 42\n    - - Feature-of\n      - 62\n      - 0.28\n      - 40\n    - - Conjunction\n      - 51\n      - 0.21\n      - 48\n    - - Hyponym-of\n      - 45\n      - 0.25\n      - 52\n    - - Part-of\n      - 38\n      - 0.18\n      - 58\n    - - Compare\n      - 32\n      - 0.15\n      - 62\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: rho_sj by relation type, sorted by frequency, with error bars from\n    bootstrap CI'\n  - 'Scatter: type frequency vs rho_sj with regression line (R^2 annotated)'\n  analysis: '分析方向对但 story 不够 clean。Type frequency 是 main predictor 但 R^2 只有 ~0.37，\n    需要补充 qualitative analysis（e.g. Compare 和 Part-of 是 inherently ambiguous types）。\n    论文中应呈现为 \"exploratory analysis suggesting frequency and type ambiguity as  moderating\n    factors\"，不能 overclaim causal relationship。作为 diagnostic 的 supporting  evidence\n    足够，但不能独立支撑一个 sub-claim。\n\n    '\n- name: temperature_sensitivity_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: T=0.7 vs T=1.0 系统比较（NER + RE），分析 signal-noise tradeoff\n  expected_results:\n    ner_t10_rho_sj_full: 0.3825\n    ner_t10_rho_sj_cond: 0.3762\n    ner_t10_oracle_f1: 0.7756\n    ner_t10_headroom: 0.1085\n    ner_t10_pct_zero: 12.19\n    ner_t07_rho_sj_full: 0.39\n    ner_t07_rho_sj_cond: 0.4\n    ner_t07_oracle_f1: 0.755\n    ner_t07_headroom: 0.088\n    ner_t07_pct_zero: 9.5\n    re_t10_rho_sj_full: 0.2441\n    re_t10_rho_sj_cond: 0.3161\n    re_t10_pct_zero: 44.3\n    re_t10_all_zero_filtered: 84\n    re_t07_rho_sj_full: 0.228\n    re_t07_rho_sj_cond: 0.34\n    re_t07_pct_zero: 51.2\n    re_t07_all_zero_filtered: 105\n  result_rationale: 'T=0.7 vs T=1.0 的 tradeoff 是 signal quality vs output diversity。NER\n    在 T=0.7 下  rho 略高（0.39 vs 0.38），因为 lower T 减少了 random noise（fewer spurious entity  predictions），使\n    SJ 更 reflective of genuine structural agreement。但 oracle headroom  下降（0.088 vs\n    0.109），因为 samples 更 homogeneous，限制了 best-of-N 的上限。 RE 的 pattern 更极端：T=0.7 使 all-zero\n    instances 增加（84→105），因为 lower T 让  model 更 decisively 输出 nothing（而非 T=1.0 下偶尔\n    hallucinate 出 relation）， 但 conditional set 的 rho 提升（0.316→0.34），说明 T=0.7 更好地 separates\n    \"can''t do\"  from \"uncertain\"。整体 effect 是 modest 的，reviewer 会认为 T 的选择是 hyperparameter  tuning\n    而非 insight。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Temperature sensitivity (NER)'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - T=1.0\n    - T=0.7\n    - Delta\n    rows:\n    - - rho_sj (full)\n      - 0.3825\n      - 0.39\n      - '+0.008'\n    - - rho_sj (cond)\n      - 0.3762\n      - 0.4\n      - '+0.024'\n    - - Oracle F1\n      - 0.7756\n      - 0.755\n      - '-0.021'\n    - - Headroom\n      - 0.1085\n      - 0.088\n      - '-0.021'\n    - - '% F1=0 samples'\n      - 12.19\n      - 9.5\n      - '-2.7'\n  - name: 'Table: Temperature sensitivity (RE)'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - T=1.0\n    - T=0.7\n    - Delta\n    rows:\n    - - rho_sj (full)\n      - 0.2441\n      - 0.228\n      - '-0.016'\n    - - rho_sj (cond)\n      - 0.3161\n      - 0.34\n      - '+0.024'\n    - - All-zero instances\n      - 84\n      - 105\n      - '+21'\n    - - '% F1=0 samples'\n      - 44.3\n      - 51.2\n      - '+6.9'\n  figures_description:\n  - '2-panel figure: left=NER rho vs T with headroom overlay; right=RE rho (full vs\n    cond) vs T'\n  - Scatter of per-instance SJ at T=0.7 vs T=1.0, colored by F1 bucket, showing how\n    T affects different difficulty strata\n  analysis: 'Signal-noise tradeoff 存在但 effect size 小。NER 上 T 选择几乎无关紧要（delta<0.01 on\n    full rho）。 RE 上 conditional rho 的提升更 notable（+0.024），支持 \"T=0.7 helps separate\n    uncertainty from  inability\" 的叙事。但 reviewer 会 argue 这只是 trivially 在做 threshold\n    tuning。 论文中最好作为 1-2 段 analysis 呈现，不值得单独一个 section。主要 takeaway：T 的选择对 NER  影响小，对\n    RE 的 conditional analysis 有 moderate 影响，推荐 T=0.7 作为 default。\n\n    '\n- name: adaptive_compute_demo\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: NER TTS improvement demo：SJ vs FK vs random vs greedy selection\n  expected_results:\n    greedy_f1: 0.6671\n    sj_selection_f1: 0.685\n    fk_selection_f1: 0.677\n    random_selection_f1: 0.674\n    oracle_selection_f1: 0.789\n    sj_gain_over_greedy: 1.8\n    fk_gain_over_greedy: 1.0\n    random_gain_over_greedy: 0.7\n    sj_headroom_capture_pct: 14.8\n    fk_headroom_capture_pct: 8.2\n    sj_vs_fk_gain: 0.8\n  result_rationale: 'SJ-based selection 的 +1.8pp gain 源自 rho=0.41 的不完美 ranking：SJ\n    能识别出 roughly 15%  的 oracle headroom。这个 gain 是 real 但 modest 的原因：(1) rho=0.41 意味着\n    SJ ranking  和 actual accuracy ranking 只有 moderate agreement；(2) 很多 high-SJ instance\n    本身已经接近  greedy performance（ceiling effect）；(3) low-SJ instance 中确实有 bad samples\n    但 greedy  就是比任何 sample 好（model confidence 准确时 greedy > stochastic）。FK 的 +1.0pp\n    更弱， 因为 FK 的 lower rho（0.29）意味着更差的 ranking ability。SJ>FK gain 仅 0.8pp， reviewer\n    会质疑这是否 justify 使用更复杂的 structured metric。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Adaptive compute comparison on SciERC NER (N=16)'\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - F1\n    - Gain vs Greedy\n    - '% Oracle Headroom'\n    rows:\n    - - Greedy (T=0)\n      - 0.6671\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Random sample\n      - 0.674\n      - +0.7pp\n      - 5.7%\n    - - FK selection\n      - 0.677\n      - +1.0pp\n      - 8.2%\n    - - SJ selection\n      - 0.685\n      - +1.8pp\n      - 14.8%\n    - - Oracle\n      - 0.789\n      - +12.2pp\n      - 100%\n  figures_description:\n  - Bar chart with 5 strategies, F1 on y-axis, oracle headroom capture % annotated\n  - 'Scatter plot: per-instance SJ rank vs oracle rank, showing moderate but imperfect\n    correlation'\n  analysis: '+1.8pp 是 technically solid 但叙事上不够 compelling 作为 headline result。14.8%\n    的 oracle  headroom capture 说明 SJ 作为 selection signal 还远不够好——85% 的潜力未被利用。论文中  应\n    frame 为 \"SJ provides modest but consistent improvement over baselines, suggesting  room\n    for better consistency metrics\"。作为 supporting experiment 有说服力，但不能 carry  the paper。如果\n    reviewer R4 质疑 \"no actual TTS improvement\"，+1.8pp 的回答只是 marginal  satisfactory。\n\n    '\n- name: ner_multi_model\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B on SciERC NER，验证 effect 跨模型泛化\n  expected_results:\n    finetune_ner_f1: 0.635\n    finetune_train_loss: 0.088\n    greedy_f1: 0.601\n    oracle_f1: 0.748\n    headroom: 0.147\n    rho_sj_full: 0.35\n    rho_fk_full: 0.28\n    sj_minus_fk_full: 0.07\n    rho_sj_cond: 0.36\n    rho_fk_cond: 0.27\n    n_full: 529\n    n_cond: 495\n    p_sj_full: 8.4e-17\n    sample_f1_mean: 0.52\n    sample_f1_pct_zero: 16.3\n  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-3.1-8B 的 SciERC fine-tune 比 Qwen3-8B 弱（greedy F1 0.60 vs\n    0.67），因为  LLaMA 的 instruction following 和 structured output 能力不如 Qwen3。rho_sj=0.35  低于\n    Qwen 的 0.41，但 SJ>FK 的 advantage 依然显著（+7pp），说明 \"structural metric  优于 surface metric\"\n    这个 finding 是 model-agnostic 的。rho 较低的原因：LLaMA 的  lower baseline performance 意味着更多\n    instance 处于 \"inability\" 区间（all-zero 比例  更高），这些 instance dilute 了 overall correlation。SJ>FK\n    delta 从 12pp 降至 7pp  也符合预期：weaker model 的 output 更 noisy，SJ 的 structural sensitivity\n    优势被  noise 部分抵消。作为 model-agnosticism 的 evidence 是 sufficient 但不 compelling。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Multi-model comparison on SciERC NER (N=8)'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Qwen3-8B\n    - LLaMA-3.1-8B\n    rows:\n    - - Greedy F1\n      - 0.667\n      - 0.601\n    - - rho_sj (full)\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.35\n    - - rho_fk (full)\n      - 0.29\n      - 0.28\n    - - SJ - FK delta\n      - +12pp\n      - +7pp\n    - - Oracle F1\n      - 0.789\n      - 0.748\n    - - Headroom\n      - 0.122\n      - 0.147\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: rho_sj and rho_fk for Qwen vs LLaMA side by side'\n  analysis: 'Multi-model 结果 addresses R2 concern 但不是 strong refutation。SJ>FK 的方向一致  是\n    positive signal，但 delta 从 12→7pp 和 rho 从 0.41→0.35 的下降留下了 \"效果  是否 robust across\n    stronger/weaker models\" 的疑问。如果有 budget，加一个 70B model  或 GPT-4-class model 会更有说服力，但\n    P1 优先级下 8B-class 两个 model 是合理 scope。\n\n    '\n- name: re_n16_confirmation\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: RE N=16 on SciERC 确认 negative finding\n  expected_results:\n    greedy_f1: 0.4208\n    oracle_f1_n16: 0.625\n    headroom_n16: 0.204\n    rho_sj_full_n16: 0.26\n    rho_fk_full_n16: 0.29\n    rho_sj_cond_n16: 0.33\n    rho_fk_cond_n16: 0.3\n    sj_beats_fk_full: false\n    sj_beats_fk_cond: true\n    n_full: 397\n    n_cond: 305\n    all_zero_count: 92\n    pct_zero_samples: 42.1\n  result_rationale: 'RE N=16 的 full rho_sj=0.26 vs N=8 的 0.244，提升极小（+0.016），因为 RE\n    的 fundamental  problem（compound error propagation）不会因为 more samples 而缓解——16 个\n    samples 产生的  span-level SJ 仍然无法区分 \"model 不确定 head entity\" vs \"model 不确定 relation\n    type\"  vs \"model 根本不知道这个 relation\"。Conditional rho=0.33 在 median range 内（[0.28,\n    0.36]）， 比 N=8 的 0.316 略好，但 \"fuzzy boundary\" 的 caveat 明显——conditional set 的划分依赖  all-zero\n    threshold，不同 threshold 会得到不同结果。SJ 在 full set 仍然输给 FK（0.26 vs 0.29）， 而 conditional\n    set 上 SJ 小幅领先（0.33 vs 0.30），这个 pattern 与 N=8 一致， confirms the diagnostic finding\n    with higher statistical power。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: RE N-scaling comparison on SciERC'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - N=8 (pilot_004)\n    - N=16\n    rows:\n    - - rho_sj (full)\n      - 0.2441\n      - 0.26\n    - - rho_fk (full)\n      - 0.2782\n      - 0.29\n    - - rho_sj (cond)\n      - 0.3161\n      - 0.33\n    - - rho_fk (cond)\n      - 0.3067\n      - 0.3\n    - - SJ beats FK (full)\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n    - - SJ beats FK (cond)\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - All-zero instances\n      - 84\n      - 92\n  figures_description:\n  - Side-by-side comparison with NER N=16 table, highlighting the NER-RE divergence\n    pattern\n  analysis: 'RE N=16 的 marginal improvement 完美 confirms Claim 2：compound error propagation  是\n    structural bottleneck，不是 sample size problem。论文中可以直接写 \"increasing N  from 8 to\n    16 yields negligible improvement in RE full-set correlation (+0.016),  confirming\n    that the degradation is fundamental rather than statistical\"。 Conditional rho=0.33\n    is a valid but modest signal，需要 caveat about threshold sensitivity。\n\n    '\n- name: capability_stratification\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 按 difficulty strata 分析 rho 变化（NER + RE）\n  expected_results:\n    ner_strata:\n      high_f1_gt_08:\n        n: 185\n        rho_sj: 0.14\n      medium_f1_04_08:\n        n: 212\n        rho_sj: 0.44\n      low_f1_lt_04:\n        n: 132\n        rho_sj: 0.22\n    re_strata:\n      high_f1_gt_06:\n        n: 88\n        rho_sj: 0.12\n      medium_f1_02_06:\n        n: 135\n        rho_sj: 0.31\n      low_f1_lt_02:\n        n: 174\n        rho_sj: 0.16\n    ner_peak_stratum: medium (0.4-0.8)\n    re_peak_stratum: medium (0.2-0.6)\n    boundary_sharpness: fuzzy — 10-15pp overlap between strata CIs\n  result_rationale: 'rho 呈现 inverted-U 形状的原因：High stratum（easy instances）的 F1 和 SJ\n    都高且 variance 低， ceiling effect 压缩了 rank 差异；Low stratum（hard instances）的 model\n    基本 fail， SJ 接近 random，无 discriminative power。只有 Medium stratum 同时有足够 variance\n    和  genuine uncertainty，使 SJ 能 discriminate。但在 median tier 下 boundary 是 fuzzy 的：\n    strata 之间的 rho CI 大幅重叠（bootstrap CI width ~0.08-0.12），无法画出 clean cutoff。 RE 的\n    pattern 更极端——Low stratum 极大（n=174），反映 model capability 的 fundamental  限制。这支持 Claim\n    2 但需要 \"the boundary is fuzzy\" 的 caveat。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: NER rho_sj by difficulty stratum'\n    columns:\n    - Stratum\n    - F1 range\n    - n\n    - rho_sj\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - Easy\n      - '>0.8'\n      - 185\n      - 0.14\n      - '[0.02, 0.26]'\n    - - Medium\n      - 0.4-0.8\n      - 212\n      - 0.44\n      - '[0.33, 0.54]'\n    - - Hard\n      - <0.4\n      - 132\n      - 0.22\n      - '[0.06, 0.38]'\n  - name: 'Table: RE rho_sj by difficulty stratum'\n    columns:\n    - Stratum\n    - F1 range\n    - n\n    - rho_sj\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - Easy\n      - '>0.6'\n      - 88\n      - 0.12\n      - '[-0.09, 0.32]'\n    - - Medium\n      - 0.2-0.6\n      - 135\n      - 0.31\n      - '[0.16, 0.45]'\n    - - Hard\n      - <0.2\n      - 174\n      - 0.16\n      - '[0.02, 0.30]'\n  figures_description:\n  - '2-panel inverted-U plot: rho_sj vs difficulty stratum for NER (left) and RE (right)\n    with CI ribbons'\n  analysis: 'Inverted-U pattern 是 strongest analytical finding：明确解释了 \"为什么 overall\n    rho 只有  0.41——因为 easy 和 hard instances dilute the signal\"。Medium stratum 的 rho=0.44（NER）\n    说明 SJ 在 sweet spot 上的 discriminative power 是合理的。但 fuzzy boundaries 限制了  practical\n    guidance 的 precision——论文不能说 \"只在 F1 0.4-0.8 的 instance 上用 SJ\"， 因为 you don''t know\n    F1 at test time。这个分析是 diagnostic contribution 的核心， 但需要 honest framing about the\n    boundary fuzziness。\n\n    '\n- name: selection_curves\n  plan_id: exp-010\n  description: Best-of-N selection curves (N=1,2,4,8,16) for SJ vs FK vs random\n  expected_results:\n    curves_sj:\n      n1: 0.6671\n      n2: 0.672\n      n4: 0.678\n      n8: 0.683\n      n16: 0.685\n    curves_fk:\n      n1: 0.6671\n      n2: 0.67\n      n4: 0.674\n      n8: 0.676\n      n16: 0.677\n    curves_rand:\n      n1: 0.6671\n      n2: 0.669\n      n4: 0.671\n      n8: 0.673\n      n16: 0.674\n    curves_oracle:\n      n1: 0.6671\n      n2: 0.71\n      n4: 0.745\n      n8: 0.776\n      n16: 0.789\n    sj_fk_gap_at_n16: 0.008\n    sj_fk_gap_at_n8: 0.007\n  result_rationale: 'Selection curves 显示 SJ 在所有 N 上 consistently outperform FK 和 random，但\n    gap  modest：N=16 时 SJ vs FK 仅 0.8pp。Curves 都呈现 diminishing returns，与 oracle curve  的\n    gap 在 N 增大时反而 widen——说明 more samples 主要增加了 oracle ceiling（more diverse  outputs\n    to choose from），但 SJ 的 selection ability 没有 proportionally 提升。 SJ-FK gap 随 N 微增（从\n    N=4 的 0.4pp 到 N=16 的 0.8pp），因为 more samples 让 SJ  的 structural comparison 更 stable。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: F1 vs N for 4 strategies (SJ, FK, random, oracle) with shaded CI bands.\n    Oracle curve rises steeply; SJ/FK/random cluster near the bottom, gap best visible\n    in inset zoom'\n  analysis: '这张图的问题是 SJ/FK/random 三条线 visually 太接近，只有 inset/zoom 才能看到差异。 Oracle curve\n    远在上方，强调了 selection 的 headroom 还很大。最佳 framing： \"SJ consistently outperforms alternatives,\n    but current correlation levels limit headroom  capture to ~15%\"。作为 P2 visualization，informative\n    但不 critical for acceptance。\n\n    '\n- name: ner_ood_robustness\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: OntoNotes 域内 vs 域外 NER consistency signal 鲁棒性\n  expected_results:\n    in_domain_rho_sj: 0.29\n    ood_rho_sj: 0.24\n    in_domain_greedy_f1: 0.583\n    ood_greedy_f1: 0.51\n    ood_sj_minus_fk: 0.02\n    ood_rho_fk: 0.22\n    ood_n: ~1200\n    ood_pct_zero: 22.5\n  result_rationale: 'OOD 的 rho 从 in-domain 的 0.29 降至 0.24，因为 domain shift 引入了 systematic\n    error  pattern 而非 random uncertainty——model 在 OOD domain 上 consistently 犯同类错误（e.g.,  新闻训练的\n    model 在 broadcast/weblog 上 systematically miss informal entity mentions）， 这种 systematic\n    error 产生 high consistency（samples 一致地错）但 low accuracy， 破坏了 SJ-accuracy correlation。SJ>FK\n    仅 2pp，在 practical 意义上可忽略。 这进一步收窄了 SJ 的 applicable scope：不仅受 type granularity 影响，还受\n    domain match 影响。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: In-domain vs OOD on OntoNotes NER'\n    columns:\n    - Setting\n    - Greedy F1\n    - rho_sj\n    - rho_fk\n    - SJ-FK\n    rows:\n    - - In-domain (nw)\n      - 0.583\n      - 0.29\n      - 0.26\n      - +3pp\n    - - OOD (bc/wb)\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.24\n      - 0.22\n      - +2pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired bar chart: in-domain vs OOD rho for SJ and FK'\n  analysis: OOD 结果是 median tier 的 additional risk factor。与 OntoNotes in-domain 的弱结果叠加，\n    叙事被进一步压缩。但也提供了额外 analysis angle：systematic vs random error 对 consistency  signal\n    的不同影响。论文中作为 \"limitations & future work\" section 的 content 是 appropriate， 但不能作为\n    positive contribution。P2 优先级下如果时间紧可以 cut。\n","userModified":false}}
